	quest.002EE463206F8C6C.title: "Primordial Violet: 5 Kills"
	quest.0058F3A24476F139.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate awakening of Imprisoned Jester. In-slot: +50%% physical/magic damage, +30%% crit chance for +100%% crit. Toggle: 25%% reflect on all incoming damage; The Bit Goes On — fatal hits become 5s of invulnerable invisibility instead of death (5min CD, drains pools to 5%%). Modes: Chaos Theater (360° AOE, hits HP+SHP, 16-block radius), Curtain Call (current-HP AOE, 16-block radius, hits HP+SHP), Final Punishment (mark target with Sentence — 5%% max HP/sec for 10s, on death absorbs 25%% EP).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Imprisoned Jester (ascension:imprisoned_jester), then use Ascension Awakening Altar. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension Awakening Altar: Reach at least 5,000,000 maximum EP and become a True Demon Lord or True Hero. Master the listed Unique skill. Deal 1,000,000 cumulative spiritual damage while Imprisoned Jester is in its skill slot; uses ascension:jester_spirit_damage, default gateSpiritDamage=1,000,000. Build an Awakening Altar with its floor one block below the altar. In a 9×9 area centered on the altar, include floor positions where dx²+dz² is at most 17. Use Deepslate Bricks for interior positions; use non-top Deepslate Brick Slabs wherever a north/east/south/west neighboring position is outside that shape. At offsets (-2,-2), (-2,+2), (+2,-2), (+2,+2), build pillars starting at altar height: Deepslate Bricks, Ascension Deepslate Magic Block, Deepslate Bricks, then TenSura Pure Magisteel Block. Drop one Ultimate Catalyst directly above the altar so it absorbs it, then interact with the altar using an empty hand. Stay alive, in the same dimension, and within 8 horizontal blocks for the 10-second ritual. If several eligible mastered Unique skills meet their gates, the ritual chooses one randomly. Success replaces that Unique with its Ultimate and starts a 120-minute per-player cooldown by default.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Imprisoned Jester (ascension:imprisoned_jester) through Ascension Awakening Altar.&r &7Requirements: Deal 1,000,000 cumulative spiritual damage while Imprisoned Jester is in its skill slot; uses ascension:jester_spirit_damage, default gateSpiritDamage=1,000,000; mastered Imprisoned Jester; max EP at least 5M; True Demon Lord or True Hero; doAscensionUltimate gamerule enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Pillar arrangement, internal eaten/damage counters, charged-stone NBT and per-player cooldown are not measurable by a simple item/kill task. Consumed special items are taken during preparation; ritual cancellation does not prove they are refunded.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: The Unbound Jester — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 5,000,000 — exact maximum EP gate used by the altar&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero state&r"
		"&f• Master: Imprisoned Jester — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• ascension:jester_spirit_damage: 1,000,000 — exact cumulative custom statistic used by the altar gate&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0058F3A24476F139.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Ascension"
	quest.0058F3A24476F139.title: "The Unbound Jester"
