	quest.0254FEAE9EF5E46A.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.0254FEAE9EF5E46A.title: "Daemonic Dragon Lord"
	quest.025A013725F84FE1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe absolute authority of Holy magic, Spiritron particles, Separation of Laws, and Dictation of Interference.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess trnightmare:metatron. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Metatron, Lord of Purity ｣ (trnightmare:metatron), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Metatron, Lord of Purity ｣ (trnightmare:metatron) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Metatron, Lord of Purity ｣ (trnightmare:metatron)&r"
		"&f• Win 15 village raids&r"
		"&f• Master 5 Holy Magic spells&r"
		"&f• Raise custom statistic trnightmare:spiritrons_used to 10,000&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Metatron, Lord of Purity ｣ (trnightmare:metatron).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,500,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Surya, King of Brillance ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Metatron, Lord of Purity ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Village raids won: 15 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• trnightmare:spiritrons_used: 10,000 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,500,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.025A013725F84FE1.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.025A013725F84FE1.title: "｢ Surya, King of Brillance ｣"
