	quest.028658EE1A87B8DE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lTroubleshooting checklist&r"
		"&f1. Confirm ETTitleSystem is enabled.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Check the exact title in the Elite Tensura Codex.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Verify the requirement type: held skill is not mastered skill, total damage is not single-hit damage, and an unlock is not an equipped title.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Reopen the Codex or relog after completing a requirement so the server can synchronize your title data.&r"
	]
	quest.028658EE1A87B8DE.title: "When a Title Will Not Unlock"
	quest.0286DEDF75ECF8FF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fProxy rights granted under Michael. Seven modes of absolute superiority.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Michael, Lord of Justice ｣ (trnightmare:michael), then use Michael subordinate grant. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Michael subordinate grant: A different player or eligible entity must possess Michael (trnightmare:michael) and place Alternative in Michael's grant mode. Become that Michael user's recognized subordinate. The owner targets you and confirms the grant. The grant learns Alternative on the subordinate. Each Alternative variant can be granted once and the default Michael limit is eight variants.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Michael, Lord of Justice ｣ (trnightmare:michael) through Michael subordinate grant.&r &7Requirements: source owns Michael; target is source subordinate; Alternative variant/limit available.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8You cannot self-grant this route. FTB cannot verify subordinate ownership or Michael's per-variant grant ledger.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Alternative, Proxy Rights ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0286DEDF75ECF8FF.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.0286DEDF75ECF8FF.title: "｢ Alternative, Proxy Rights ｣"
	quest.0288766E33546EB0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fLaunch up to eight devastating aura blasts at foes.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.0288766E33546EB0.quest_subtitle: "Projectile Battlewill Arts • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0288766E33546EB0.title: "Dark Eight Palms"
