	quest.02BD590D1F903E73.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fEmpower your attacks with the effect of Poison, toggleable when mastered.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: either use/eat 100 Spider Eyes OR kill 100 tensura:black_spider. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAqua Frog (tensura:aqua_frog); Army Wasp (tensura:army_wasp); Cave Spider (minecraft:cave_spider); Phantaspore (tensura:phantaspore); Pufferfish (minecraft:pufferfish)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAbyssal Tiefling (trarcane:abyssal_tiefling); Divine Loxodrome Scorpion (mysticism:divine_loxodrome_scorpion); Divine Singularity Scorpion (mysticism:divine_singularity_scorpion); Gravity Soul Insect (mysticism:gravity_soul_insect); Loxodrome Scorpion (mysticism:loxodrome_scorpion); Loxodrome Scorpion Insectar (mysticism:loxodrome_scorpion_insectar)&r"
		"&fLoxodrome Scorpion Savant (mysticism:loxodrome_scorpion_savant); Poison Soul Insect (mysticism:poison_soul_insect); Salamander (trnightmare:salamander); Salamander Assassin (trnightmare:salamander_assassin); Salamander Fire Spirit (trnightmare:salamander_fire_spirit); Salamander Fire Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:salamander_fire_dragon)&r"
		"&fSalamander Poison Spirit (trnightmare:salamander_poison_spirit); Salamander Poison Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:salamander_poison_dragon); Salamander Warlock (trnightmare:salamander_warlock); Scorpion (mysticism:scorpion); Singularity Scorpion (mysticism:singularity_scorpion); Singularity Scorpion Insectar (mysticism:singularity_scorpion_insectar)&r"
		"&fSingularity Scorpion Savant (mysticism:singularity_scorpion_savant)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Poison — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.02BD590D1F903E73.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
