		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f100,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fAspectborn&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fGreater Aspectborn&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
