	quest.03DCD45008CBE03C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7Ultimate spacetime lord — coating, usurpation, prison, and time itself.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess trnightmare:time_traveler. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Time Traveler (trnightmare:time_traveler), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Time Traveler (trnightmare:time_traveler) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Yog-Sotohort, God of Space-Time ｣ (trnightmare:yog-sotohort) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Usurper (tensura:usurper)&r"
		"&f• Master Infinity Prison (tensura:infinity_prison)&r"
		"&f• Master Absolute Severance (tensura:absolute_severance)&r"
		"&f• Use §bTime Traveler (trnightmare:time_traveler)'s `TimeTravelerActivationCount` mechanic until its internal counter reaches 25&r"
		"&f• Master §bTime Traveler (trnightmare:time_traveler).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,101,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Yog-Sothoth, Lord of Space-Time ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Usurper — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Infinity Prison — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Absolute Severance — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: §bTime Traveler — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,101,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
