	quest.0463E75B6B6C3AF5.title: "Legioner: 10 Kills"
	quest.04683D9524DA42C5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn aspectual magic that inverts day and night alignment to alter combat conditions.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Common Buried, Common Burnt, Common Frozen, Common Rotted, Common Ruined, Uncommon Buried, Uncommon Burnt, Uncommon Frozen, Uncommon Rotted, Uncommon Ruined.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Great Basic, Great Upgraded, High Basic, High Upgraded, Low Basic, Low Upgraded, Medium Basic, Medium Upgraded.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.04683D9524DA42C5.quest_subtitle: "Other \\& Addon Magic • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.04683D9524DA42C5.title: "Day-Night Inversion"
	quest.047DA3D502E20F16.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f200,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fPrimordial Daemon Lord&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 200,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 200,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Primordial Arch Daemon — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
