	quest.0566E97D02E8905E.title: "Sentientdisintegrate"
	quest.057083D984322A15.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIs it alive, or is it dead? The only way to find out is to open the box. But since it's a cat, maybe it'll grant you some of its properties.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Schrödinger — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.057083D984322A15.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
	quest.057083D984322A15.title: "Schrödinger"
	quest.05893D9C8FD93875.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYour powerful authority over the element of Water as the True Frost Dragon.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. TR Origins True Dragon element grant: Follow the TR Origins race progression and become the Frost True Dragon. When the True Dragon storage registers that element, DragonElementUtils automatically learns Dragon Factor: Frost and applies the element's resistance/skill package.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8The skill is intrinsic to that selected True Dragon element and is tagged no-plundering.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Dragon Factor: Frost — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.05893D9C8FD93875.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR Origins"
	quest.05893D9C8FD93875.title: "Dragon Factor: Frost"
	quest.05914B1FABB2222B.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat The Dead King 1 time after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+500 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.05914B1FABB2222B.title: "The Dead King: First Kill"
	quest.05B0117B8E6DB6B5.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Elite Draugr 100 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+1,000 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.05B0117B8E6DB6B5.title: "Elite Draugr: 100 Kills"
	quest.05B616DE1B7B35CB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGuard like a wilden, Stalk like a wilden, Hunt like a wilden, your walk is much like a wilden.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.WILDEN_GUARDIAN_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.WILDEN_HUNTER_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.WILDEN_STALKER_GENETICS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Wilden Stalk — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.05B616DE1B7B35CB.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.05B616DE1B7B35CB.title: "Wilden Stalk"
