	quest.05E995EBC2650CA1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&7The mod does not provide an effect description for this ability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master StarlightUniqueSkills.VESTIGES_OF_EIDOLONS.get(); then master StarlightUniqueSkills.REMNANTS_OF_ASCENSION.get(); then master tensura:law_manipulation; then master UtilityArts.HAZE.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Lethe Lady Of Phantasm — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.05E995EBC2650CA1.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.05E995EBC2650CA1.title: "Lethe Lady Of Phantasm"
	quest.05F0F4316CEB8DD9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fActive: summon a shadowy training clone in front of you. Idle until hit; once provoked, fights back with melee that bypasses ALL resistances and nullifications. Killing the clone grants 10%% of your current EP as bonus. Costs 50%% current aura and 50%% current MP. CD 5 min. Lifespan 2 min. One clone at a time.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.05F0F4316CEB8DD9.quest_subtitle: "Advanced \\& Addon Battlewill • Ascension"
	quest.05F0F4316CEB8DD9.title: "Image Training"
	quest.05FA67D269C581A4.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f2,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fQueen Wasp Savant&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fStar Soul Insect&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Divine Queen Wasp — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.05FA67D269C581A4.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • Mysticism"
	quest.05FA67D269C581A4.title: "Divine Queen Wasp"
	quest.05FD53B15885B818.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fMove freely through space, teleport large distances or create spatial gates. Manipulate stardust to immense damage.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fMai Furuki (tensura:mai_furuki)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Traveler — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.05FD53B15885B818.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
