	quest.06C1F7332132CAEF.quest_desc: [
		"&fPick a Unique skill whose confirmed acquisition method fits the character you are building. Then read its outgoing evolution edges before you grind for it.&r"
		""
		"&fSome Unique skills evolve automatically, some use advancements or rituals, and some are replaced by the result. The individual skill page is the authority.&r"
	]
	quest.06C1F7332132CAEF.title: "Choose a Unique Skill Route"
	quest.06CCD71DCFCFC279.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weaker holy attacks or reduce the damage from stronger divine powers.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Guaranteed kill grant (default config): defeat tensura_neb:luminous_valentine; the Skill Obtain addon awards this skill at 100% default chance.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Guaranteed kill grant (default config): defeat tensura:hinata_sakaguchi; the Skill Obtain addon awards this skill at 100% default chance.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fGazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Luminous Valentine (tensura_neb:luminous_valentine); Sun Spirit (aether:sun_spirit); Umvuthi (mowziesmobs:umvuthi); Valkyrie (aether:valkyrie); Valkyrie Queen (aether:valkyrie_queen)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fCherub (mysticism:cherub); Cherub of Origin (trorigins:cherub_of_origin); Divine Tengu (mysticism:divine_tengu); Fairy Princess (trnightmare:fairy_princess); Lesser Goddess (trnightmare:lesser_goddess); Mystic Angel (mysticism:mystic_angel)&r"
		"&fMystic Angel of Origin (trorigins:mystic_angel_of_origin); Seraph (mysticism:seraph); Seraph of Origin (trorigins:seraph_of_origin); Tengu Saint (mysticism:tengu_saint)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Holy Attack Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.06CCD71DCFCFC279.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.06CCD71DCFCFC279.title: "Holy Attack Resistance"
	quest.06DD05DE7DE49BA5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weak electrical damage or resist the damage from stronger attacks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fGazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Memoires (mysticism:memoires); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); Kobolediator (cataclysm:kobolediator); Koboleton (cataclysm:koboleton); Modern Remnant (cataclysm:modern_remnant); Valkyrie Queen (aether:valkyrie_queen); Wadjet (cataclysm:wadjet)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAir Genasi (trarcane:air_genasi); Charged Perforator (mysticism:charged_perforator); Demon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); Dissonance Deity (mysticism:dissonance_deity); Earthshaker Dancer (trnightmare:earthshaker_dancer); God Slime (tensura:god_slime)&r"
		"&fLightning Aberration (mysticism:lightning_aberration); Lightning Soul Insect (mysticism:lightning_soul_insect); Metal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Overloading Worm (mysticism:overloading_worm); Royal Demon (trnightmare:royal_demon)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Electricity Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.06DD05DE7DE49BA5.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.06DD05DE7DE49BA5.title: "Electricity Resistance"
	quest.06DF1CCA7AE83209.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA husk of what you formally were. The leftovers, discarded without a second thought when the split happened. Coldness seeps through your skin as you freeze everything to reclaim your other parts.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master UniqueMysticismSkills.RESHIRAM.get(); then master UniqueMysticismSkills.ZEKROM.get(); then possess UniqueMysticismSkills.ZEKROM.get(); then possess UniqueMysticismSkills.KYUREM.get(); then possess UniqueMysticismSkills.RESHIRAM.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Kyurem — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
