	quest.075D63D8BD605EDA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fToggle: +5% magicule regen (+10% mastered). Masters slowly while toggled on. Auto-learned once Energy Charge is mastered and Haki is acquired.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Energy Charge (ascension:energy_charge), then use Ascension automatic mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension automatic mastery unlock: Obtain a Battlewill Manual from the installed mob loot or a Battlewill Trainer dwarf and hold-use it. An unbound manual rolls the configured battlewillManualList, which includes tensura:battlewill. Learn and master tensura:battlewill; the Ascension player-tick check then automatically grants ascension:energy_charge when its config switch is enabled and you do not have Mysticism Restricted. Then master ascension:energy_charge and possess tensura:haki. The server checks these unlocks during player ticks. Keep the skill enabled in server settings and allow the learning check to run; failed repeated attempts are throttled to once per 60 seconds.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Energy Charge (ascension:energy_charge) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Obtain a Battlewill Manual from the installed mob loot or a Battlewill Trainer dwarf and hold-use it. An unbound manual rolls the configured battlewillManualList, which includes tensura:battlewill. Learn and master tensura:battlewill; the Ascension player-tick check then automatically grants ascension:energy_charge when its config switch is enabled and you do not have Mysticism Restricted. Then master ascension:energy_charge and possess tensura:haki.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Magicule Resonance (ascension:magicule_resonance) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master ascension:magicule_attunement.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Mysticism Restricted causes Energy Charge, Maximum Charge, Magicule Attunement, Magicule Resonance and Magicule Dominion to be removed.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Magicule Attunement — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: Battlewill — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: Energy Charge — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: Haki — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.075D63D8BD605EDA.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • Ascension"
	quest.075D63D8BD605EDA.title: "Magicule Attunement"
	quest.075EC22BC194CDED.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§bTime abides no reason—§r\\n§3For it deprives us all equally.§r\\n§9Yet brooks not a second to be reclaimed.§r&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Awakened Feldway reward: Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival or Adventure; the killing damage must resolve to you as the reward player. Choose this available authority in Feldway’s reward screen. It must be unclaimed and you must be allowed to claim an exclusive skill. The reward is once per player by the default Feldway reward gamerule. Exclusive ownership is enforced across players and a player is limited to one exclusive authority.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8A kill counter cannot establish world-wide exclusive ownership or whether a reward was already claimed. Check the reward screen.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Istaroth — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Defeat 1 × tensuramoreskills:feldway_awakened (forward-only) — forward-only FTB counter; it cannot prove reward availability or historical kills&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.075EC22BC194CDED.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Tensura More Skills"
	quest.075EC22BC194CDED.title: "Istaroth"
