	quest.07E9D08B28F4CBAE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate craftsmanship. Requires mastered Godly Craftsman, Law Manipulation, and 100 unique item types engraved through Godly Craftsman. In-slot Precision Miner grants Luck V and triple ore drops. Kiln, Refine, Smithing, and Craftsmen modes open portable workshops with 500,000 EP gear bonuses.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:godly_craftsman. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Godly Craftsman (tensura:godly_craftsman), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Godly Craftsman (tensura:godly_craftsman) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Godly Craftsman (tensura:godly_craftsman)&r"
		"&f• Master Law Manipulation (tensura:law_manipulation)&r"
		"&f• Engrave 100 Unique-skill items with Godly Craftsman&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 600,000&r"
		"&f• Master Godly Craftsman (tensura:godly_craftsman).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 600,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Amatsumara, Lord of Crafts ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Godly Craftsman — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Law Manipulation — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 600,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
