	quest.0802BC3CF07D6323.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fDash and attack the target's eyes, throat, heart, kidneys, lungs, and groin with eight consecutive and near instant slashes.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Obtain Five Petals Thrust's bound manual from Gazel Dwargo, learn it, and master it. Its onSkillMastered hook directly grants a learning instance of Eight Petals Flash.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
