	quest.08032A59ECCF829B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSteadfast and unyielding, this blessing reinforces your defense and grants a deep connection to nature’s strength.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gift (trnightmare:gift), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation: Obtain Gift (or its Ultimate continuation Astraea) and place it in an active skill slot. Open Gift Creation / Astraea Blessing Creation and select this skill from the available blessings. Confirm creation. The default Gift creation cost is 0 Magicules with a 100-tick cooldown. The result lives inside Gift/Astraea as a sub-ability rather than a separate learned skill.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gift (trnightmare:gift) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB ability tasks cannot inspect sub-ability slots; use the parent-skill tracker and manual confirmation.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §6§lGift — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.08032A59ECCF829B.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.08032A59ECCF829B.title: "Earth Blessing"
	quest.08066F25DC1DB25C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f2,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fMajin Elemental Lord&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Divine Majin Elemental — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.08066F25DC1DB25C.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • Mysticism"
	quest.08066F25DC1DB25C.title: "Divine Majin Elemental"
	quest.082C6A6DBBC2F8D7.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Winged Cat 50 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+100 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.082C6A6DBBC2F8D7.title: "Winged Cat: 50 Kills"
	quest.083549B32EBBF569.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fInherit the genetics of a small creature known for its speed.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess StarlightUniqueSkills.LIGHT_REMAINS.get(); then possess StarlightUniqueSkills.VESTIGES_OF_EIDOLONS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Starbuncle Genetics — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.083549B32EBBF569.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.083549B32EBBF569.title: "Starbuncle Genetics"
	quest.0839A9DDB6D8EE79.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA God-class ultimate skill tied to the origin of knowledge and universal records.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master trnightmare:astral_light. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Astral Light, Lord of Creation ｣ (trnightmare:astral_light), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astral Light, Lord of Creation ｣ (trnightmare:astral_light) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Astral Light, Lord of Creation ｣ (trnightmare:astral_light)&r"
		"&f• Obtain and carry the Akashic Memory item required by this condition&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 20,000,000&r"
		"&f• Have at least 60,000,000 current EP&r"
		"&f• Activate ｢ Astral Light, Lord of Creation ｣ (trnightmare:astral_light)'s hidden `Byakko` condition&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Astral Light, Lord of Creation ｣ (trnightmare:astral_light).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 20,000,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare God Skills gamerule must also be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• For non-creative players, this God-class skill must not already have another world owner; the successful evolution claims its ownership record.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Akashic Records, God of Origin ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Astral Light, Lord of Creation ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 20,000,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Current EP: 60,000,000 — exact current EP value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0839A9DDB6D8EE79.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.0839A9DDB6D8EE79.title: "｢ Akashic Records, God of Origin ｣"
	quest.0847608EE8DD6189.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f2,500,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f50× Life Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fSacred Tree Child&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,500,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 50 x Life Essence (trnightmare:life_essence): Complete Direwolf Raids (1-2 at 65%), use bone meal on a non-mature crop (50%), or break a mature crop (10%). Then eat/use all 50; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,500,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: True Fairy King — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.0847608EE8DD6189.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.0847608EE8DD6189.title: "True Fairy King"
