	quest.08FB8461B6F4EDC8.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBecome able to cast mastered magic instantly, in water or even under the effects of silence.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: master magic spells until the relevant counter reaches 10. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fApostle (trnightmare:apostle); Apostle (trvirtuoso:apostle); Contractor (trnightmare:contractor); Contractor (trvirtuoso:contractor); Disciple (trnightmare:disciple); Disciple (trvirtuoso:disciple)&r"
		"&fEnforcer (trnightmare:enforcer); Enforcer (trvirtuoso:enforcer); Fairy Queen (trarcane:fairy_queen); Hermit (trnightmare:hermit); Hermit (trvirtuoso:hermit); Jedidiah (trnightmare:jedidiah)&r"
		"&fJedidiah (trvirtuoso:jedidiah); Myrddin (trnightmare:myrddin); Myrddin (trvirtuoso:myrddin); Primordial Arch Daemon (trorigins:primordial_arch_daemon); Primordial Daemon Lord (trorigins:primordial_daemon_lord); Primordial Devil Lord (trorigins:primordial_devil_lord)&r"
		"&fScholar (trnightmare:scholar); Scholar (trvirtuoso:scholar); Sorcerer (trnightmare:sorcerer); Sorcerer (trvirtuoso:sorcerer); Trickster (trnightmare:trickster); Trickster (trvirtuoso:trickster)&r"
		"&fWanderer (trnightmare:wanderer); Wanderer (trvirtuoso:wanderer)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Chant Annulment — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.08FB8461B6F4EDC8.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.08FB8461B6F4EDC8.title: "Chant Annulment"
	quest.0903BB2573FAAFE7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGreatly enhance the caster's defence.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Common Rotted.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Medium Rare.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fApothecarist (irons_spellbooks:apothecarist); Priest (irons_spellbooks:priest)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
