	quest.093284FD14FE032F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fFlip the rules. Change alignments, invert buffs and debuffs while shifting strengths and weaknesses to your benefit.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Second-skill roll: this skill is also in the higher-priority second Unique Skill pool when that configured roll occurs.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Reverser — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.093284FD14FE032F.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.093284FD14FE032F.title: "Reverser"
	quest.094041E81BC868CA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f5× Zane Blood, Zane Blood"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fGhoul&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fHuman&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fVampire Overcomer&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Obtain 5 x Zane Blood (tensura:zane_blood): Defeat Luminous Valentine; her loot table in this pack drops 1-3 Zane Blood. Then eat/use all 5; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Current race: Vampire — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
