	quest.094C323FB5F1037A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fRestrict teleportation, confuse enemies by swapping places, and use your blink as well as the spatial gate to cross large distances.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Second-skill roll: this skill is also in the higher-priority second Unique Skill pool when that configured roll occurs.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with Charm (tensura:charm), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Charm (tensura:charm) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 4).&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Michael, Angel of Locks (tensuramoreskills:michael_angel_of_locks) through MoreSkills Michael natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Infinity Prison; possess Suppressor; maximum Magicule > 5,000,000 x MP_SKILL_COST/100.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Suppressor — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.094C323FB5F1037A.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.094C323FB5F1037A.title: "Suppressor"
	quest.096D1C54BEE37DF8.quest_desc: [
