	quest.09A4B9C7FE3CEE2E.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis chapter covers all &e20&f player-facing Common skills in the pack.&r"
		"&fEach page explains what the skill does, how to learn it, which mobs use it, which races grant it, and where it can evolve.&r"
		"&7Use the checkmark to mark a page as read. Automatic tasks only report progress; they never grant a skill.&r"
		"&7Learn and mastery tasks check your current character. Statistics may include older progress, but FTB kill tasks start counting only after the quest begins tracking them.&r"
	]
	quest.09A4B9C7FE3CEE2E.quest_subtitle: "Review the Common skill catalog"
	quest.09A4B9C7FE3CEE2E.title: "Common Skills"
	quest.09AB93860113727B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§2Life abides no reason—§r\\n§aFor none are born by their own consent.§r&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Awakened Feldway reward: Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival or Adventure; the killing damage must resolve to you as the reward player. Choose this available authority in Feldway’s reward screen. It must be unclaimed and you must be allowed to claim an exclusive skill. The reward is once per player by the default Feldway reward gamerule. Exclusive ownership is enforced across players and a player is limited to one exclusive authority.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8A kill counter cannot establish world-wide exclusive ownership or whether a reward was already claimed. Check the reward screen.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Naberius — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Defeat 1 × tensuramoreskills:feldway_awakened (forward-only) — forward-only FTB counter; it cannot prove reward availability or historical kills&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.09AB93860113727B.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Tensura More Skills"
	quest.09AB93860113727B.title: "Naberius"
