	quest.09C7A0739C49F819.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f10,000–14,000 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f4,000–6,000"
		"&eMagicules: &f6,000–8,000"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fGiantification, Steel Strength, Strengthen Body, Magic Resistance"
		"&eRace modifiers: &fMax Health +30, Spiritual Health +140, Attack +5"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fAncient Giant&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 10,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
