	quest.09CA3B2956E6E4CA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fInherit the genetics of a ferocious beast known for being durable.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess StarlightUniqueSkills.LIGHT_REMAINS.get(); then possess StarlightUniqueSkills.VESTIGES_OF_EIDOLONS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Wilden Guardian Genetics — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.09CA3B2956E6E4CA.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.09CA3B2956E6E4CA.title: "Wilden Guardian Genetics"
	quest.09DD9D8DC39C7E35.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fReveals hidden presence and analyzes distant entities.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Learn both Analytical Appraisal and Farsight, then master either one. Unique Monsters' mastery listener checks that both are present and grants Appraisal Eye.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Appraisal Eye — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8The tracker verifies the resulting skill; addon-specific counters and random rolls are not exposed to FTB Quests.&r"
	]
	quest.09DD9D8DC39C7E35.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • Tensura Unique Monsters"
	quest.09DD9D8DC39C7E35.title: "Appraisal Eye"
	quest.09E297D167E4B343.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYou have gazed into the void and the void gazes back. You learn skills much faster&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition: Personally kill 30 vanilla Wardens. The check reads the lifetime minecraft:warden killed statistic. Gain EP after the thirtieth kill so the usual acquisition check runs and learns Forbidden Knowledge.&r"
		""
