	quest.09EE69605346B4BA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCompletely negate all abnormal conditions and their effects.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fGravebound Colossus (elitetensura:gravebound_colossus); Vaelthorn, the Hollow Sovereign (elitetensura:lich_boss); Yuuki Kagurazaka (tensura_guild:yuuki_kagurazaka)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDivine Fox (trnightmare:divine_fox); Fairy Prince (trnightmare:fairy_prince); Greater Mystic Fox (trnightmare:greater_mystic_fox); Guardian Of The Tree (trnightmare:guardian_of_the_tree); Hell Rizer (trnightmare:hell_rizer); Lesser Mystic Fox (trnightmare:lesser_mystic_fox)&r"
		"&fNinehead (trnightmare:ninehead); Ninetail (trnightmare:ninetail); One Eyed God (trnightmare:one_eyed_god); Royal Demon (trnightmare:royal_demon); Slayer Fairy (trnightmare:slayer_fairy); Soul Beast (trnightmare:soul_beast)&r"
		"&fTen Commandment (trnightmare:ten_commandments)&r"
