	quest.0A07A166C8B708F1.title: "Wither Skeleton: 5 Kills"
	quest.0A155C9BB8AD6619.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe Necronomicon is a forbidden tome of godlike duality and psychic ruin. The final evolution of Holy Demonic Inversion.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Holy Demonic Inversion (trnightmare:holy_demonic_inversion), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Holy Demonic Inversion (trnightmare:holy_demonic_inversion) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Kill 45,000 human-type entities&r"
		"&f• Master Holy Demonic Inversion (trnightmare:holy_demonic_inversion)&r"
		"&f• Master 20 Magic abilities&r"
		"&f• Use Holy Demonic Inversion (trnightmare:holy_demonic_inversion)'s `Legions` mechanic until its internal counter reaches 50&r"
		"&f• Use Holy Demonic Inversion (trnightmare:holy_demonic_inversion)'s `Alignments` mechanic until its internal counter reaches 50&r"
		"&f• Master Thought Acceleration (tensura:thought_acceleration)&r"
		"&f• Master Universal Perception (tensura:universal_perception)&r"
		"&f• Master Demon Lord Haki (tensura:demon_lord_haki)&r"
		"&f• Master Analytical Appraisal (tensura:analytical_appraisal)&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 300,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Necronomicon, Book of Magic ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Human-type kills: 45,000 — exact TenSura human-kill counter used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Master: Holy Demonic Inversion — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Magic mastered (lifetime counter): 20 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Master: Thought Acceleration — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Universal Perception — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Demon Lord Haki — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Analytical Appraisal — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 300,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
