	quest.0A1A4841A9410D48.title: "Purifier"
	quest.0A2A4641CE2EAAA3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f2,000–7,000 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f500–1,500"
		"&eMagicules: &f1,500–5,500"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fSelf-Regeneration, Absorb \\& Dissolve, Water Breathing, Wind Attack Resistance"
		"&eRace modifiers: &fMax Health -15, Spiritual Health -10, Movement Speed +0.02"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fAxolotl Knight&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fAxolotl Wizard&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Axolotl — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
