	quest.0AB6F3D2FBD3D12D.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Slime Throne Extras"
	quest.0AB6F3D2FBD3D12D.title: "Zephyr Wisp"
	quest.0AC23DB66BCB67F0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe more you give away, the more you feel closer to yourself. Perhaps it even strengthens you along the way.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Provider — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0AC23DB66BCB67F0.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
	quest.0AC23DB66BCB67F0.title: "Provider"
	quest.0AC394F0A4946F37.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGod-class void sovereign. Commands imaginary space, void predation, multidimensional barriers, True Dragon nucleation, and nihility.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_wisdom), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony ｣ (trnightmare:beelzebuth), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_wisdom) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony ｣ (trnightmare:beelzebuth) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Spacetime Domination (trnightmare:spacetime_domination) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Name 100 subordinates&r"
		"&f• Master 100 total skills&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_wisdom)&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony ｣ (trnightmare:beelzebuth)&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony ｣ (trnightmare:beelzebuth).&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_wisdom).&r"
		"&f• Reach maximum Magicule capacity 20,000,000 minus 5,000,000 for each currently owned Veldora, Velgrynd, Velzard, or Velgaia Ultimate (floor 0).&r"
		"&f• Reach total EP 40,000,000 if you own at least one of those True Dragon Ultimates; otherwise reach 60,000,000 EP. These values are configurable defaults.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare God Skills gamerule must also be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• For non-creative players, this God-class skill must not already have another world owner; the successful evolution claims its ownership record.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Azathoth, God of The Void ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Skills mastered (lifetime counter): 100 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 20,000,000 — conservative no-True-Dragon threshold; the actual gate is reduced by 5,000,000 per owned True Dragon Ultimate&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 60,000,000 — conservative no-True-Dragon threshold; the actual gate is 40,000,000 when at least one True Dragon Ultimate is owned&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
