	quest.0AF896B8134CACFC.title: "Arch Phantom: 50 Kills"
	quest.0B10F2B27A289642.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe Wedding Bells of Holy Matrimony fill the world, being close to an ally when surrounded by enemies makes the bells more powerful&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Rare Buried, Rare Burnt, Rare Frozen, Rare Rotted, Rare Ruined, Uncommon Buried, Uncommon Burnt, Uncommon Frozen, Uncommon Rotted, Uncommon Ruined.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Great Basic, Great Upgraded, High Basic, High Upgraded, Medium Basic, Medium Upgraded.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.0B10F2B27A289642.quest_subtitle: "Other \\& Addon Magic • TR: Nightmare"
