	quest.0B288EE1D049C9E4.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUse magicule to strengthen your muscles.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 3,000. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fIron Golem (minecraft:iron_golem); Mark Lauren (tensura:mark_lauren); Orc Disaster (tensura:orc_disaster); Orc Lord (tensura:orc_lord)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fBeetle (mysticism:beetle); Death Oni (tensura:death_oni); Divine Drone Beetle (mysticism:divine_drone_beetle); Divine Fighter (tensura:divine_fighter); Divine King (ascension:divine_king); Divine Oni (tensura:divine_oni)&r"
		"&fDivine Stag Beetle (mysticism:divine_stag_beetle); Divine Vampire (tensura:divine_vampire); Drone Beetle (mysticism:drone_beetle); Drone Beetle Insectar (mysticism:drone_beetle_insectar); Drone Beetle Savant (mysticism:drone_beetle_savant); Enlightened Ogre (tensura:enlightened_ogre)&r"
		"&fFantasy Soul Insect (mysticism:fantasy_soul_insect); Ghoul (tensura:ghoul); Kijin (tensura:kijin); Lightning Soul Insect (mysticism:lightning_soul_insect); Monkey King (ascension:monkey_king); Monkey Martial Artist (ascension:monkey_martial_artist)&r"
		"&fMonkey Warrior (ascension:monkey_warrior); Mystic Oni (tensura:mystic_oni); Ogre (tensura:ogre); Spirit Oni (tensura:spirit_oni); Stag Beetle (mysticism:stag_beetle); Stag Beetle Insectar (mysticism:stag_beetle_insectar)&r"
		"&fStag Beetle Savant (mysticism:stag_beetle_savant); Sun Wukong (ascension:sun_wukong); Vampire (tensura:vampire); Vampire Lord (tensura:vampire_lord); Vampire Overcomer (tensura:vampire_overcomer); Wicked Oni (tensura:wicked_oni)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Berserk (tensura:berserk) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 5).&r"
		"&f• Berserker (tensura:berserker) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 3).&r"
		"&f• Fighter (tensura:fighter) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 4).&r"
		"&f• Martial Master (tensura:martial_master) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 4).&r"
		"&f• Murderer (tensura:murderer) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 2).&r"
		"&f• Shadow Striker (tensura:shadow_striker) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 2).&r"
		"&f• Wrath (tensura:wrath) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Strength — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0B288EE1D049C9E4.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0B288EE1D049C9E4.title: "Strength"
	quest.0B3160B7B7D5516B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCease all change. The times call for it. Prevent targets from moving or regenerating, and stop all things from harming you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Stagnator — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0B3160B7B7D5516B.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
	quest.0B3160B7B7D5516B.title: "Stagnator"
	quest.0B3E1D25487B5021.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Direwolf 5 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+50 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.0B3E1D25487B5021.title: "Direwolf: 5 Kills"
	quest.0B413A17D7BA05BA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f1,800–3,100 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f1,500–2,500"
		"&eMagicules: &f300–600"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fStrength"
		"&eRace modifiers: &fMax Health +6, Spiritual Health +15, Attack +1, Movement Speed +0.01"
		""
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&fThis race does not use the usual EP or item requirement list. Follow its route below."
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fHobgoblin&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fEnlightened Ogre&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fKijin&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fSpirit Oni&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Choose this race from a reincarnation or starting-race menu where it is offered. No evolution prerequisite is declared for the starting form.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Current race: Ogre — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.0B413A17D7BA05BA.quest_subtitle: "Starting Reincarnation • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0B413A17D7BA05BA.title: "Ogre"
	quest.0B4FBB752D9DCAB7.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Corrodent 5 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+50 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.0B4FBB752D9DCAB7.title: "Corrodent: 5 Kills"
	quest.0B59E3F1E7777589.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f7,000–9,000 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f2,000–3,000"
		"&eMagicules: &f5,000–6,000"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fMagic Resistance, Possession"
		"&eRace modifiers: &fMax Health +20, Spiritual Health +90, Attack +0.4"
		""
		"&e&lGetting a body&r"
		"&fLesser Daemon begins with Possession. Put it in an active skill slot. If you already have a physical form, the first use leaves that body behind and turns you spiritual. While spiritual, aim at an eligible living target in range and activate Possession again.&r"
		""
		"&fYou cannot possess invulnerable or spiritual targets, anything tagged &etensura:no_possession&f, or a target protected by Spiritual Attack Nullification. Weaker, lower-EP bodies are the safest starting choices.&r"
		""
		"&fSuggested early bodies: a Wandering Trader for a quick humanoid body, a llama for mobility and utility, or an Iron Golem when you need a large health pool. Exact inherited stats are still limited by the skill and server configuration. Keep your original body and return route safe.&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fArch Daemon&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fGreater Daemon&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 7,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Secure a physical body with Possession before exploring dangerous Overworld areas. A spiritual daemon is vulnerable to mechanics that specifically affect spiritual beings.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 7,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Lesser Daemon — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Body state and possession eligibility cannot be read reliably by FTB Quests, so that step remains a manual check.&r"
	]
	quest.0B59E3F1E7777589.quest_subtitle: "Starting Reincarnation • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0B59E3F1E7777589.title: "Lesser Daemon"
	quest.0B6541B3EFAE94E4.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fStrengthen your body to better protect yourself against attacks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 15,000. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fFolgen (tensura:folgen); Magicule Glutton (magicule_glutton:magicule_glutton); Mark Lauren (tensura:mark_lauren); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAncient Giant (tensura:ancient_giant); Divine Giant (tensura:divine_giant); Giant (tensura:giant)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Strengthen Body — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0B6541B3EFAE94E4.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0B6541B3EFAE94E4.title: "Strengthen Body"
	quest.0B6B70AA76F773D9.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Candicorn 1 time after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+25 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.0B6B70AA76F773D9.title: "Candicorn: First Kill"
	quest.0B843548C5A04E8F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fChannel your will, converting magicules into aura.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Trade with a Battlewill Trainer dwarf at level 5. Its bound-manual trade tag explicitly includes this art; buy the named/glinting manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fUnlocks Maximum Will (trnightmare:maximum_will): Master Violent Break and Battlewill.&r"
		"&fUnlocks Energy Charge (ascension:energy_charge): Master Battlewill; Mysticism Restricted must be absent and Energy Charge must be enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.0B843548C5A04E8F.quest_subtitle: "Utility Battlewill Arts • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0B843548C5A04E8F.title: "Battlewill"
	quest.0B8CAF7CE4FC9B43.quest_desc: [
