	quest.0BAE4ECAA5014A14.title: "Crystal Glutton: 50 Kills"
	quest.0BC42949349AB203.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fParallel law. Infinite storehouse. Judgment without equal.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Gilgamesh, Lord of Treasure ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_lord_of_treasures), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Gilgamesh, King of Uruk ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_king_of_uruk), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Gilgamesh, Lord of Treasure ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_lord_of_treasures) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Gilgamesh, King of Uruk ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_king_of_uruk) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Gilgamesh, Lord of Treasure ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_lord_of_treasures); prior mastery still counts if the skill later evolved&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Gilgamesh, King of Uruk ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_king_of_uruk)&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 2,000,000&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Gilgamesh, King of Uruk ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_king_of_uruk).&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Gilgamesh, Lord of Treasure ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_lord_of_treasures) (recorded historical mastery also counts).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 2,000,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Gilgamesh, God of Myth ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Gilgamesh, Lord of Treasure ｣ — exact current mastery; historical mastery accepted by this condition cannot be shown&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Gilgamesh, King of Uruk ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 2,000,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
