		"&fSource much like plasma, and fluid like blood. Noticeably increases the amount of source your vessel can store and regenerate.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.FLARECANNON_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.FLASHJACK_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.SIREN_GENETICS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Plasmatic Source — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0C38D964A7DD9654.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.0C38D964A7DD9654.title: "Plasmatic Source"
	quest.0C3DFF2612CFF7BA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
