	quest.0C689CDB4A0F295F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Lightning abilities by a large amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above dominationEpAcquirement (server-config value); then master tensura:lightning_manipulation. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Lightning Manipulation (tensura:lightning_manipulation), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with Lightning Manipulation (tensura:lightning_manipulation), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDissonance Deity (mysticism:dissonance_deity); Lightning Aberration (mysticism:lightning_aberration)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Lightning Manipulation (tensura:lightning_manipulation) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:lightning_manipulation; possess tensura:lightning_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Lightning Manipulation (tensura:lightning_manipulation) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:lightning_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:lightning_domination.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Lightning Domination — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0C689CDB4A0F295F.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0C689CDB4A0F295F.title: "Lightning Domination"
