	quest.0CA8C75B26389244.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fStand as a bastion against the force of your enemies. Absorb the damage from your allies and fortify their defenses.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Second-skill roll: this skill is also in the higher-priority second Unique Skill pool when that configured roll occurs.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with Charm (tensura:charm), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Charm (tensura:charm) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 3).&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Beelzebub, Lord of Gourmet ｣ (trnightmare:beelzebub) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Guardian — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0CA8C75B26389244.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0CA8C75B26389244.title: "Guardian"
	quest.0CA91FE1523D4199.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA King-class ultimate skill associated with fallen authority and corrupt dominion.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Astarte, Lord of Heaven ｣ (trnightmare:astarte), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣ (trnightmare:belphegor), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astarte, Lord of Heaven ｣ (trnightmare:astarte) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣ (trnightmare:belphegor) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Astarte, Lord of Heaven ｣ (trnightmare:astarte)&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣ (trnightmare:belphegor)&r"
		"&f• Use ｢ Astarte, Lord of Heaven ｣ (trnightmare:astarte)'s `heavenly_design_uses` mechanic 10 times&r"
		"&f• Build ｢ Astarte, Lord of Heaven ｣ (trnightmare:astarte)'s `astarte_recycled` list to 10 entries&r"
		"&f• Store at least 100,000 in ｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣ (trnightmare:belphegor)'s `tempMP` value&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Astarte, Lord of Heaven ｣ (trnightmare:astarte).&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣ (trnightmare:belphegor).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 3,900,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astaroth, King of Fallen ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Astarte, Lord of Heaven ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 3,900,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0CA91FE1523D4199.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.0CA91FE1523D4199.title: "｢ Astaroth, King of Fallen ｣"
	quest.0CBDD82126E49C06.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&7The mod does not provide an effect description for this ability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Gabriel, Lord of Patience ｣ (trnightmare:gabriel), then use TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming: Own one matching source Ultimate: trnightmare:gabriel, and develop its matching Ego/personality. Raise that Ego above 225 social points, then use the Ego evolution screen to confirm each stage through stage 4. Each attempt has a 12-minute cooldown and a 30% failure chance by default; failure halves social points. When stage 4 reports that the Ego is ready, use the Ego naming command/menu and choose a name. The first naming pays the configured base naming cost; the mod creates the mapped Manas skill and transfers mastery.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Gabriel, Lord of Patience ｣ (trnightmare:gabriel) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can verify the source and resulting skills but cannot read Ego personality, social points, stage, cooldown, failure roll, or naming cost.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §5Patient Manas — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Gabriel, Lord of Patience ｣ — alternative/matching source aid; Ego stage and personality remain manual&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0CBDD82126E49C06.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.0CBDD82126E49C06.title: "Patient Manas"
	quest.0CBE2CF7E7996D06.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate of Unyielding — hope, backup, fortitude, and life domination.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
