	quest.0D0074DB7E8348EB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fFire a concentrated sphere of wind toward targets.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Rare Ruined.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Great Basic, High Basic.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fArch Daemon (tensura:arch_daemon); Greater Angel (trnightmare:greater_angel); Greater Daemon (tensura:greater_daemon); Greater Fallen (trnightmare:greater_fallen)&r"
		"&fGreater Phantom (trnightmare:greater_phantom); Primordial Blanc (trnightmare:sentient_boss_blanc); Primordial Bleu (trnightmare:sentient_boss_bleu); Primordial Jaune (trnightmare:sentient_boss_jaune)&r"
		"&fPrimordial Vert (trnightmare:sentient_boss_vert); Primordial Violet (trnightmare:sentient_boss_violet); Sentient Boss Ancient Daemon (trnightmare:sentient_boss_ancient_daemon); Sentient Boss Noir (trnightmare:sentient_boss_noir)&r"
		"&fSentient Boss Primordial Daemon (trnightmare:sentient_boss_primordial_daemon); Veldora Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_veldora)&r"
		"&fMay roll this ability when it spawns:&r"
		"&fSentient Boss Gii Crimson (trnightmare:sentient_boss_gii_crimson)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.0D0074DB7E8348EB.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0D0074DB7E8348EB.title: "Tornado Blade"
	quest.0D0AAA84FD822054.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fStrike the air to launch a wide shockwave, splitting heavy Wind and Gravity damage across targets.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.0D0AAA84FD822054.quest_subtitle: "Advanced \\& Addon Battlewill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.0D0AAA84FD822054.title: "Air Palm"
