	quest.0D3AE526B81749FC.title: "Full Character Reset — Use 2"
	quest.0D3D71059EDDE203.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSpew a horrifying breath to paralyze your prey.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fEvil Centipede (tensura:evil_centipede); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fRimeblight Hydra (mysticism:rimeblight_hydra)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Paralysing Breath — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0D3D71059EDDE203.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0D3D71059EDDE203.title: "Paralysing Breath"
	quest.0D3F1D72E232C41A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f800,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fFrost Wolf&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fNivalis Frost Wolf&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDivine Wolf&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 800,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Master Cryogenic Cessation (mysticism:cryogenic_cessation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 800,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Master: Cryogenic Cessation — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Glacier Spirit Wolf — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.0D3F1D72E232C41A.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Mysticism"
	quest.0D3F1D72E232C41A.title: "Glacier Spirit Wolf"
	quest.0D58F12EC358B1C7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Water abilities by a large amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above dominationEpAcquirement (server-config value); then master tensura:water_manipulation. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Water Manipulation (tensura:water_manipulation), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Water Manipulation (tensura:water_manipulation), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Frost, Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Water Manipulation (tensura:water_manipulation) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:water_manipulation; possess tensura:water_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Water Manipulation (tensura:water_manipulation) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:water_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:water_domination.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Water Domination — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0D58F12EC358B1C7.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.0D58F12EC358B1C7.title: "Water Domination"
	quest.0D5AF8162968BB51.quest_desc: [
