	quest.0DC24EA3DB3899D5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§3Coffin of Darkness is a terrifyingly powerful §5Enchantment-Type Unique Skill §3that draws from the darkest knowledge of the Demon Clan. Its abilities are so dangerous and overwhelming that even high-ranking §6Goddess-Clan §3and §cDemon-Clan §3consider it §l§4forbidden §3and §u§lunstable.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §5§lCoffin of Darkness — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
