	quest.0E5996E646D4AB3C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYou seek to build a world of truths. Are you prepared to scorch and burn everything in your path to make the truthful world you seek so badly?&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master UniqueMysticismSkills.ZEKROM.get(); then master UniqueMysticismSkills.KYUREM.get(); then possess UniqueMysticismSkills.ZEKROM.get(); then possess UniqueMysticismSkills.KYUREM.get(); then possess UniqueMysticismSkills.RESHIRAM.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Reshiram — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.0E5996E646D4AB3C.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
