	quest.0EEDEB4DF372A657.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7The perfected evolution of §fStasis§7. Anchor magicule and aura with §bFixed State§7, bend localized time through §fTime Control§7 and §fTime Freeze§7, bind a single foe with §fWhite Lock§7, and cross the battlefield on §bBlock Acceleration§7 glass.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Gabriel, Lord of Patience ｣ (trnightmare:gabriel) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §fCadence — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
