		"&fDemonic Dragon (ascension:demonic_dragon); Divine Dragon (tensura:divine_dragon); Divine Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:divine_netherite_dragon); Dragonewt (tensura:dragonewt); Ender Dragonewt (ascension:ender_dragonewt); Enflamed Aberration (mysticism:enflamed_aberration)&r"
		"&fLesser Nether Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_nether_dragon); Magma Worm (mysticism:magma_worm); Medium Nether Dragon (trnightmare:medium_nether_dragon); Molten Perforator (mysticism:molten_perforator); Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:netherite_dragon); Scrap Dragon (trnightmare:scrap_dragon)&r"
