		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCall forth or manipulate small amounts of water.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Lesser-or-higher Water spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Water Spiritual Magic through Lesser, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Water. Minimum contract level: Lesser. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
