		"&f2. Obtain 1 x Royal Blood (tensura:royal_blood): Defeat a Royal Orc (25%), Orc Lord (50%), or Orc Disaster (guaranteed). Then eat/use all 1; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
