		"&f2. Learn Water Manipulation (tensura:water_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Learn Wind Manipulation (tensura:wind_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f4. Learn Ice Manipulation (mysticism:ice_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f5. Attempt the evolution while standing in a biome tagged Cold.&r"
		"&f6. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
