	quest.1057F61DEFA95084.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.1057F61DEFA95084.title: "Heavenly Eye"
	quest.105DCC06FEDA0188.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f3,000–5,000 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f1,000–2,000"
		"&eMagicules: &f2,000–3,000"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fExoskeleton, Analytical Appraisal"
		"&eRace modifiers: &fMax Health +15, Spiritual Health +85, Attack -0.8, Movement Speed -0.03"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fAnt&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fBeetle&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fCentipede&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fMantis&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fScorpion&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fWasp&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 3,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 3,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Insect — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.105DCC06FEDA0188.quest_subtitle: "Starting Reincarnation • Mysticism"
	quest.105DCC06FEDA0188.title: "Insect"
	quest.106B95CB6FEF3DB7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn upgraded spacetime package requiring mastered Spatial Domination and a compatible ultimate. Grants Spacetime Infliction, Warp Shot, Dimension Ray, Dimension Storm, Fault Field, Space-Time Cleanse, Spatial Transfer, and a learnable local Time Stop.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Spacetime Manipulation (trnightmare:spacetime_manipulation), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Sentient (nightmareutils:sentient), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with ｢ Azathoth, God of The Void ｣ (trnightmare:azathoth), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with ｢ Azazel, Lord of Temptation ｣ (trnightmare:azazel), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. Start with ｢ Nodens, God of Abyss ｣ (trnightmare:nodens), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f6. Start with ｢ Samael, Lord of Deadly Poison ｣ (trnightmare:samael), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f7. Start with ｢ Yog-Sotohort, God of Space-Time ｣ (trnightmare:yog-sotohort), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f8. TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition: Master Spacetime Manipulation. Also possess at least one configured compatible authority: Sentient, Azathoth, Azazel, Nodens, Samael, or Yog-Sotohort. Gain EP to run the acquisition check. On success the source Spacetime Manipulation skill is disabled as part of the upgrade.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Spacetime Manipulation (trnightmare:spacetime_manipulation) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		"&f• Sentient (nightmareutils:sentient) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Azathoth, God of The Void ｣ (trnightmare:azathoth) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Azazel, Lord of Temptation ｣ (trnightmare:azazel) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Nodens, God of Abyss ｣ (trnightmare:nodens) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Samael, Lord of Deadly Poison ｣ (trnightmare:samael) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Yog-Sotohort, God of Space-Time ｣ (trnightmare:yog-sotohort) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Spacetime Domination — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.106B95CB6FEF3DB7.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.106B95CB6FEF3DB7.title: "Spacetime Domination"
	quest.10851E43AE130F4B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIncrease the speed at which you learn and master skills, magic and arts.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: reach a combined total of 20 mastered Magic and Battlewill abilities. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fArchevoker (irons_spellbooks:archevoker); Echo of Tyros, First Flamebearer (irons_spellbooks:fire_boss); Evoker (minecraft:evoker); The Dead King (irons_spellbooks:dead_king)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fApostle (trnightmare:apostle); Apostle (trvirtuoso:apostle); Contractor (trnightmare:contractor); Contractor (trvirtuoso:contractor); Disciple (trnightmare:disciple); Disciple (trvirtuoso:disciple)&r"
		"&fDivine Saiyan (elitetensura:divine_saiyan); Enforcer (trnightmare:enforcer); Enforcer (trvirtuoso:enforcer); Hermit (trnightmare:hermit); Hermit (trvirtuoso:hermit); High Class Saiyan (elitetensura:high_saiyan)&r"
		"&fJedidiah (trnightmare:jedidiah); Jedidiah (trvirtuoso:jedidiah); Kobold (stextras:kobold); Medium Class Saiyan (elitetensura:medium_saiyan); Myrddin (trnightmare:myrddin); Myrddin (trvirtuoso:myrddin)&r"
		"&fScholar (trnightmare:scholar); Scholar (trvirtuoso:scholar); Sorcerer (trnightmare:sorcerer); Sorcerer (trvirtuoso:sorcerer); Trickster (trnightmare:trickster); Trickster (trvirtuoso:trickster)&r"
		"&fWanderer (trnightmare:wanderer); Wanderer (trvirtuoso:wanderer)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Analyst (tensura:analyst) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:sage; possess tensura:sage, tensura:chant_annulment, tensura:farsight, tensura:telepathy, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:magic_jamming, tensura:flame_domination, tensura:poison, tensura:analytical_apprasial; pay 1,050,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 3).&r"
		"&f• Seeker (tensura:seeker) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:sage; possess tensura:sage, tensura:chant_annulment, tensura:farsight, tensura:telepathy, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:magic_jamming, tensura:flame_domination, tensura:poison, tensura:analytical_apprasial; pay 1,050,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 3).&r"
		"&f• Great Sage (tensura:great_sage) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:sage; possess tensura:sage, tensura:chant_annulment, tensura:farsight, tensura:telepathy, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:magic_jamming, tensura:flame_domination, tensura:poison, tensura:analytical_apprasial; pay 1,050,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Great Sage (tensura:great_sage) through Moo's Tensura Addon — Great Crystal Altar awakening.&r &7Requirements: Own Sage; XP level 45; at least 60,000 current EP at ritual start; at least 1 mastered Skill; remain at the altar for 300 ticks. Default magicule cost is 0 and naming is not required.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sage — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.10851E43AE130F4B.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.10851E43AE130F4B.title: "Sage"
	quest.10AACDD39546073D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe half elf that brought doom to the world.&r"
