	quest.10FC7EC32DF197D9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate evolution of Chosen One. Toggle the skill on to gather fallen subordinates as Memories in the Banner of the Supreme King. While in your ability slot, Hero's Boons grant you and nearby allies HOTV, Luck, crit, and dodge. Lucky Field, Haki, Charisma, and Einherjar round out the lord of heroes.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:chosen_one. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Chosen One (tensura:chosen_one), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Chosen One (tensura:chosen_one) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Chosen One (tensura:chosen_one)&r"
		"&f• Awaken as a True Hero&r"
		"&f• Have at least 5,000,000 EP&r"
		"&f• Satisfy the True Hero courage event flag&r"
		"&f• Satisfy the True Hero true-love event flag&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 900,000&r"
		"&f• Master Chosen One (tensura:chosen_one).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 900,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ True Hero, King of Champions ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Chosen One — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• True Hero — exact current True Hero state&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 5,000,000 — exact maximum EP value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 900,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.10FC7EC32DF197D9.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
