	quest.1205A291C25D13F3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAll things have an end, and after mastering the power granted to you by your loneliness, you know exactly what those endings look like.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
