	quest.1298F8F90CB9193B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fToggle: dragons treat you as neutral; your Ice/Fire/Thunder Breath bypass resistances. Grants Ice/Fire/Thunder Breath and Dragon Skin/Ear/Eye automatically. Eating a Dragon Essence permanently adds +20 max HP (uncapped, reset on death). Modes: Dragon Infusion (consume a Dragon Heart in hand for +20,000 EP), Dragon Rage (Strength X for 30s, 60s cooldown).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• The Slayer of Dragons (ascension:slayer_of_dragons) through Ascension Awakening Altar.&r &7Requirements: Carry 30 items in the Ascension dragon-essences tag; 30 are consumed when the ritual prepares; mastered Dragon Slayer; max EP at least 5M; True Demon Lord or True Hero; doAscensionUltimate gamerule enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Dragon Slayer — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
