	quest.135840EC40348777.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fMelt into the shadows and move unseen by all but the most keen observers.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Guaranteed kill grant (default config): defeat tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight; the Skill Obtain addon awards this skill at 100% default chance.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fEnderman (minecraft:enderman); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAmped Guitar Wolf (mysticism:amped_guitar_wolf); Antumbra Spirit Wolf (mysticism:antumbra_spirit_wolf); Apostle (trnightmare:apostle); Apostle (trvirtuoso:apostle); Black Fang (mysticism:black_fang); Blazing Scorch Wolf (mysticism:blazing_scorch_wolf)&r"
		"&fBlue Fang (mysticism:blue_fang); Brown Fang (mysticism:brown_fang); Corrupted Dragon (ascension:corrupted_dragon); Corrupted Dragonkin (ascension:corrupted_dragonkin); Cursed Dragon (ascension:cursed_dragon); Darkness Fang (mysticism:darkness_fang)&r"
		"&fDemon Dragon God (ascension:demon_dragon_god); Demonic Dragon (ascension:demonic_dragon); Direwolf (mysticism:direwolf); Disciple (trnightmare:disciple); Disciple (trvirtuoso:disciple); Divine Vampire (tensura:divine_vampire)&r"
		"&fDivine Wolf (mysticism:divine_wolf); Frost Wolf (mysticism:frost_wolf); Glacier Spirit Wolf (mysticism:glacier_spirit_wolf); Green Fang (mysticism:green_fang); Guitar Wolf (mysticism:guitar_wolf); Hermit (trnightmare:hermit)&r"
		"&fHermit (trvirtuoso:hermit); Jedidiah (trnightmare:jedidiah); Jedidiah (trvirtuoso:jedidiah); Light Fang (mysticism:light_fang); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:gale_spirit_wolf); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:magic_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&fMagic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:ocean_spirit_wolf); Molten Spirit Wolf (mysticism:molten_spirit_wolf); Mountain Spirit Wolf (mysticism:mountain_spirit_wolf); Mystical Black Fang (mysticism:mystical_black_fang); Mystical Black Fang (mysticism:mystical_blue_fang); Mystical Brown Fang (mysticism:mystical_brown_fang)&r"
