	quest.1388E3DFBAD62E05.title: "Investigator"
	quest.13B424141DFEBD83.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f200,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fLesser Memory Aspectborn&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fGreater Memory Aspectborn&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 200,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 200,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Memory Aspectborn — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.13B424141DFEBD83.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Starlight"
	quest.13B424141DFEBD83.title: "Memory Aspectborn"
	quest.13B696E14FE432B2.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCreate a shield of condensed aura to block attacks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Trade with a Battlewill Trainer dwarf at level 4. Its bound-manual trade tag explicitly includes this art; buy the named/glinting manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.13B696E14FE432B2.quest_subtitle: "Utility Battlewill Arts • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.13B696E14FE432B2.title: "Aura Shield"
	quest.13CDCA09EE26E30A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f2,200,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Elemental Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&f9 Tailed Fox&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,200,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 10 x Elemental Essence (tensura:elemental_essence): Defeat Akash, Ifrit, Sylphide, Undine, or War Gnome (guaranteed). Several lesser elemental mobs and qualifying summoned Elemental Colossi have a 10% source. Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,200,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Divine Kitsune — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.13CDCA09EE26E30A.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • Ascension"
	quest.13CDCA09EE26E30A.title: "Divine Kitsune"
