	quest.141AFF99D2311DB1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA Unique Skill that allows its user to bestow mastered skills upon subordinates and reclaim them when necessary.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Moo's Tensura Addon — automatic Granter awakening: Become named and obtain Great Sage. Reach at least 200,000 current EP and master at least 5 learned abilities. Gather at least 5 subordinates within the addon's 32-block scan radius, or have 5 subordinates already recorded by its recognition system. Wait for the server's automatic progression check (every 100 ticks, about 5 seconds). The addon learns Granter and awards moostensuraaddon:authority_to_bestow.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Benevolent Empowerment (moostensuraaddon:benevolent_empowerment) through Moo's Tensura Addon — Granter evolution (True Hero path).&r &7Requirements: Master Granter; be named; True Hero; 1,000,000 current EP; 500,000 current Magicules (consumed); 10 other mastered Skills; 10 successful Granter grants; 10 nearby or recognized subordinates.&r"
		"&f• Absolute Governance (moostensuraaddon:absolute_governance) through Moo's Tensura Addon — Granter evolution (True Demon Lord path).&r &7Requirements: Master Granter; be named; True Demon Lord; 1,000,000 current EP; 500,000 current Magicules (consumed); 10 other mastered Skills; 10 successful Granter grants; 10 nearby or recognized subordinates.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Naming and Moo's nearby/recognized-subordinate union are not exposed to an FTB task. The skill-mastered statistic is only an approximate lifetime aid.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Granter — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: Great Sage — exact prerequisite&r"
		"&f• Current EP: 200,000 — exact current EP gate&r"
		"&f• Skills mastered (lifetime counter): 5 — approximate lifetime aid; the addon counts currently mastered learned skills&r"
		"&f• Advancement completed: moostensuraaddon:authority_to_bestow — exact successful automatic-awakening outcome&r"
		"&f• Master: Granter — exact current mastery required before either Ultimate evolution&r"
		"&f• Advancement completed: moostensuraaddon:granter_mastered — exact Moo progression milestone awarded when Granter is mastered&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.141AFF99D2311DB1.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Moo's Tensura Addon"
	quest.141AFF99D2311DB1.title: "Granter"
	quest.142367A06BE0E193.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCreate a wall of fire to keep targets away.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Common Burnt, Uncommon Burnt.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Low Basic.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fPrimordial Blanc (trnightmare:sentient_boss_blanc); Velgrynd Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_velgrynd)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.142367A06BE0E193.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.142367A06BE0E193.title: "Fire Wall"
