	quest.1443198E8EFCF5D1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Space abilities by a large amount and deals massive damage by splitting a target with dimensional attacks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 400,000; then master tensura:spatial_manipulation. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Spatial Manipulation (tensura:spatial_manipulation), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Spatial Manipulation (tensura:spatial_manipulation), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Abyss, Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Spatial Manipulation (tensura:spatial_manipulation) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:spatial_manipulation; possess tensura:spatial_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Spatial Manipulation (tensura:spatial_manipulation) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:spatial_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:spatial_domination.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Hastur, Lord of Starwind ｣ (trnightmare:hastur) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Uriel, Lord of Oaths ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_oath) through TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis.&r &7Requirements: master four component skills; 375,000 Magicules; valid non-imprinted component instances.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Spatial Domination — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.1443198E8EFCF5D1.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.1443198E8EFCF5D1.title: "Spatial Domination"
	quest.14458BEBFA734B66.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUse magicule to manipulate the weather.&r"
