		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f80,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Life Essence, 20× Daemon Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fHigher Fairy&8 — Normal evolution&r"
