		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 80,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 10 x Life Essence (trnightmare:life_essence): Complete Direwolf Raids (1-2 at 65%), use bone meal on a non-mature crop (50%), or break a mature crop (10%). Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Obtain 20 x Daemon Essence (tensura:daemon_essence): Defeat Arch Daemons (50%), Greater Daemons (10%), or Lesser Daemons (1%). It also appears in Hell Ruins chests and Hell Ruins archaeology. Then eat/use all 20; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f4. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 80,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Dark Fairy — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
