	quest.161749D608251143.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn ultimate skill tied to slothful control, suppression, and overwhelming lethargy.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Sloth (tensura:sloth), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Sloth (tensura:sloth) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astaroth, King of Fallen ｣ (trnightmare:astaroth) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Sloth Manas (trnightmare:sloth_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Raise Sloth (tensura:sloth)'s `storedMagicule` stored value to at least 25,000&r"
		"&f• Master Sloth (tensura:sloth)&r"
		"&f• Stay motionless in a bed for the configured duration (Math.max(0, belphegor.evolutionBedStillMinutes) * 60 * 20 ticks in code)&r"
		"&f• Kill 1,000 mobs&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,000,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Sloth — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Mobs killed: 1,000 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,000,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.161749D608251143.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.161749D608251143.title: "｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣"
