	quest.167E63D181B0AF6E.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTrue Dragon of Storms. Storm-type magic while in slot. Hold to summon Veldora's human form.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. TR: Nightmare inner-world True Dragon teaching: Progress the Veldora inner-world relationship until reputation is at least 500. Learn Veldora's intrinsic taught skill first. Continue selecting the teaching interaction in that dragon's inner-world dialogue. Each qualifying teaching interaction rolls a 5% default chance to grant the matching True Dragon Ultimate. Repeat until it succeeds; the same grant also teaches Pseudo Dragon Body if missing.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare friendship route:&f befriend the Sentient Boss Veldora, meet 500 Friendship, 300 Loyalty, and 850 Bond, then choose 'Analyze Veldora' in the friendship menu. Each eligible attempt rolls a 10%, increased to 40% at 1,000 Bond chance to teach this skill; repeat the interaction after failures.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Pseudo Dragon Body (trnightmare:pseudo_dragon_body) through True Dragon Ultimate companion grant.&r &7Requirements: successfully learn any True Dragon Ultimate through inner-world teaching.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Reputation and the random teaching roll are not exposed to FTB Quests. This is a repeatable chance, not a guaranteed interaction.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Veldora, Lord of Storms ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.167E63D181B0AF6E.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.167E63D181B0AF6E.title: "｢ Veldora, Lord of Storms ｣"
