	quest.16A6BE192B8988DA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTransfer skills between you and your subordinates, or teach a subordinate one of your skills.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:gourmet; then possess tensura:gluttony; then possess tensura:starved. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Food Chain — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
