	quest.16E4718060CC71B4.title: "Netherite Ministrosity: First Kill"
	quest.16E7EDB31C20D490.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§oMotion is born from pause. Form is sculpted in collapse. What was power is no longer force — but continuity, shaped through pressure and will.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master StarlightUniqueSkills.EMBER_REMAINS.get(); then master StarlightUniqueSkills.CURRENT_UNBROKEN.get(); then master StarlightUniqueSkills.SHAPE_FORGOTTEN.get(); then possess a Hero Egg or be a True Hero. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Remnants of Ascension — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.16E7EDB31C20D490.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.16E7EDB31C20D490.title: "Remnants of Ascension"
	quest.16F31B9A5D5C67D7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fPut even the strongest entities into sleep.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Epic Tome.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.16F31B9A5D5C67D7.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
