	quest.17807CA04D139377.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lRead the prerequisite title&r"
		"&fMany titles form named chains. Examples in the installed JAR include Wanderer I → Wanderer II → Wanderer III and Orc Footsoldier → Orc Warrior → Orc General → Orc Lord → Orc Disaster.&r"
		""
		"&fWhen a title lists another title as a requirement, unlock the earlier entry first. The complete 195-title source catalog is included in the audit beside this quest pack.&r"
	]
