		"&f2. Obtain 30 x Lightning Essence (mysticism:lightning_essence): Defeat Sylphide (guaranteed), or collect an essence created by a lightning strike (10% strike chance; the Elemental Realm wind biome also runs the installed lightning/essence event). Then eat/use all 30; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
