	quest.184B3B7CD7CC1885.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7Ascend the Heavenly Throne. Erase chaos, dominate minds, and execute absolute justice. You alone control the circuits, you alone are to be God! Isn't that right.... Master§&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master trnightmare:dominator. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Dominator (trnightmare:dominator), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Dominator (trnightmare:dominator) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Alternative, Proxy Rights ｣ (trnightmare:alternative) through Michael subordinate grant.&r &7Requirements: source owns Michael; target is source subordinate; Alternative variant/limit available.&r"
		"&f• Justice Manas (trnightmare:justice_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master §6Dominator (trnightmare:dominator)&r"
		"&f• Win 25 village raids&r"
		"&f• Kill 5,000 mobs&r"
		"&f• Master §6Dominator (trnightmare:dominator).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 900,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Michael, Lord of Justice ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: §6Dominator — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Village raids won: 25 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Mobs killed: 5,000 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 900,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.184B3B7CD7CC1885.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.184B3B7CD7CC1885.title: "｢ Michael, Lord of Justice ｣"
