	quest.1A1FB7C775700D69.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fHarvest of every skill you have owned. Store memories, recreate lost arts, craft new ones, duplicate mastered creations, and gift analyzed skills to allies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Uriel, Lord of Vows ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_vow), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Uriel, Lord of Oaths ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_oath), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Uriel, Lord of Vows ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_vow) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Uriel, Lord of Oaths ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_oath) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Tenebrosum, God of Souls ｣ (trnightmare:tenebrosum) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Use Shub-Niggurath's first registered evolution method while its precursor conditions are satisfied&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,200,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Shub-Niggurath, King of Harvest ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,200,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.1A1FB7C775700D69.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.1A1FB7C775700D69.title: "｢ Shub-Niggurath, King of Harvest ｣"
