	quest.1ACDFE81D4AF9AC9.title: "Nameless Sorcerer: 10 Kills"
	quest.1AD9128D1BA61073.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA black hole sucking everything into a singularity&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Lord-or-higher Earth spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Earth Spiritual Magic through Lord, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Evolve into Mysticism's Elemental Lord or Majin Lord while your stored element is Earth. The race-set hook installs an Earth Lord spirit, grants Summon Greater Elemental, and directly learns Gravitational Void.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Earth. Minimum contract level: Lord. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
