	quest.1C3CA496FA71F26E.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fShoot a blast of roar in front of you scaring any afflicted entities.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 5,000. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fDirewolf (tensura:direwolf); Elder Guardian (minecraft:elder_guardian); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight)&r"
