	quest.1CE8084B3B746543.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYou seek to build a world of ideals. Be warned as not everyone shares the same ideals. Raze anything in your path with a clap of lightning.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master UniqueMysticismSkills.RESHIRAM.get(); then master UniqueMysticismSkills.KYUREM.get(); then possess UniqueMysticismSkills.ZEKROM.get(); then possess UniqueMysticismSkills.KYUREM.get(); then possess UniqueMysticismSkills.RESHIRAM.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Zekrom — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.1CE8084B3B746543.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
	quest.1CE8084B3B746543.title: "Zekrom"
	quest.1D0E2386A5D95E8B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f3,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f20× Dragon Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fSovereign Djinn&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fOmniversal Djinn&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 3,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 20 x Dragon Essence (tensura:dragon_essence): Defeat Charybdis (1-3 guaranteed), a Basilisk (1%), or a Dragonewt-type Lizardman (25%). Lizardman throne/storage loot and Elite crates are additional sources. Then eat/use all 20; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 3,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Infinite Djinn — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.1D0E2386A5D95E8B.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Ascension"
	quest.1D0E2386A5D95E8B.title: "Infinite Djinn"
