	quest.1D20356E2E96B241.title: "Akash: 5 Kills"
	quest.1D319EF93A1B86E6.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn extra skill that channels destruction through divine darkness beams and customizable firing styles.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Learn Astaroth. Astaroth's learning hook grants Hand of Destruction automatically if you do not already own it.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Hand of Destruction — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8The tracker verifies the resulting skill; addon-specific counters and random rolls are not exposed to FTB Quests.&r"
	]
	quest.1D319EF93A1B86E6.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.1D319EF93A1B86E6.title: "Hand of Destruction"
	quest.1D372F458641F37F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&7The mod does not provide an effect description for this ability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣ (trnightmare:belphegor), then use TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming: Own one matching source Ultimate: trnightmare:belphegor, and develop its matching Ego/personality. Raise that Ego above 225 social points, then use the Ego evolution screen to confirm each stage through stage 4. Each attempt has a 12-minute cooldown and a 30% failure chance by default; failure halves social points. When stage 4 reports that the Ego is ready, use the Ego naming command/menu and choose a name. The first naming pays the configured base naming cost; the mod creates the mapped Manas skill and transfers mastery.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣ (trnightmare:belphegor) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can verify the source and resulting skills but cannot read Ego personality, social points, stage, cooldown, failure roll, or naming cost.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §5Sloth Manas — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Belphegor, Lord of Sloth ｣ — alternative/matching source aid; Ego stage and personality remain manual&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.1D372F458641F37F.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.1D372F458641F37F.title: "Sloth Manas"
