	quest.1DA4D7B87EB8DF03.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoost your bodies healing to nearly impossible levels &r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 300,000; then master tensura:self_regeneration; then defeat tensura:charybdis. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fCharybdis (tensura:charybdis); Supermassive Slime (tensura:supermassive_slime); Ender Guardian (cataclysm:ender_guardian)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAccursed Goddess (trnightmare:accursed_goddess); Brother Of Chaos (trnightmare:brother_of_chaos); Daughter Of Light (trnightmare:daughter_of_light); Death Oni (tensura:death_oni); Divine Fighter (tensura:divine_fighter); Divine Giant (tensura:divine_giant)&r"
		"&fDivine Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:divine_netherite_dragon); Divine Soldier (trnightmare:divine_soldier); Divine Vampire (tensura:divine_vampire); Fairy Prince (trnightmare:fairy_prince); Goddess Princess (trnightmare:princess_of_goddess); Higher Goddess (trnightmare:higher_class_goddess)&r"
		"&fLance Corporal (trnightmare:lance_corporal); Middle-Class Demon (trnightmare:mid_class_demon); Nameless Goddess (trnightmare:nameless_goddess); Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:netherite_dragon); One Eyed God (trnightmare:one_eyed_god); Slayer Fairy (trnightmare:slayer_fairy)&r"
		"&fVampire Lord (tensura:vampire_lord); Wicked Oni (tensura:wicked_oni)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Ultraspeed Regeneration — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
