		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fHigh Orc&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fOrc Disaster&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Obtain 10 x Royal Blood (tensura:royal_blood): Defeat a Royal Orc (25%), Orc Lord (50%), or Orc Disaster (guaranteed). Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Current race: Orc Lord — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
