	quest.1E4C53362892E132.title: "Axolotl: 100 Kills"
	quest.1E5876E9BA3A734F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAfter taking in the power of those around you to the point of gluttonous overconsumption. You absorb energy just as you did before, with your limits on uniques refreshed. Your growth fuels everyone.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master trnightmare:sentient_being; then master tensura:gluttony. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Sentient Being (trnightmare:sentient_being), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Sentient Being (trnightmare:sentient_being) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Carnation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.1E5876E9BA3A734F.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.1E5876E9BA3A734F.title: "Carnation"
	quest.1E678551C716F74D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fManifest a private inner dimension. A skin-only echo of you remains outside; if it dies, you return to where it fell. Activate again to leave and rejoin your echo.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition: Raise EP above 100,000 and base maximum Magicules to at least 1,000. Gain EP again to run the usual acquisition check; Inner World is learned automatically when both installed defaults are met.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Inner World — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 100,001 — optional progress aid&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,000 — optional progress aid&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.1E678551C716F74D.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.1E678551C716F74D.title: "Inner World"
