	quest.1E79F936FF19FD9E.quest_subtitle: "Starting Reincarnation • Mysticism"
	quest.1E79F936FF19FD9E.title: "Phantom"
	quest.1E88838AC79A26BD.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fWhile in-slot, the user is treated as Digital Nature.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gift (trnightmare:gift), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation: Obtain Gift (or its Ultimate continuation Astraea) and place it in an active skill slot. Open Gift Creation / Astraea Blessing Creation and select this skill from the available blessings. Confirm creation. The default Gift creation cost is 0 Magicules with a 100-tick cooldown. The result lives inside Gift/Astraea as a sub-ability rather than a separate learned skill.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gift (trnightmare:gift) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB ability tasks cannot inspect sub-ability slots; use the parent-skill tracker and manual confirmation.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §6§lGift — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.1E88838AC79A26BD.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.1E88838AC79A26BD.title: "Divine Protection of Time"
	quest.1EB69FDD4824EFF4.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Gravity abilities and allows unhindered flight while active.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eUseful Ability route:&f master Gravity Field and Gravity Flight. The GravityManipulationEasy game rule is enabled by default; while it remains enabled, the addon checks once per second and grants Gravity Manipulation automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. &eGravity Hammer route:&f learn and master TR: Nightmare's Gravity Hammer Battlewill. Its mastery hook starts learning Gravity Manipulation; using the mastered art also grants it if still missing.&r"
		""
		"&f3. &eOppressor route:&f permanently learn Oppressor. Oppressor's learning hook immediately starts learning Gravity Manipulation. Temporary Oppressor instances do not qualify.&r"
		""
		"&f4. &eBase TenSura mastery route:&f master the configured number of gravity-tagged skills. The installed default is 3. The check runs whenever a skill reaches mastery.&r"
		""
		"&f5. &eCharybdis Core route:&f right-click a cooldown/inert Charybdis Core with an empty hand. Gravity Manipulation is in its configured skill list and the core is consumed on a successful learn. You can also use Degenerate's core-fusion mode on an Inactive, Active, or Cooldown Charybdis Core; Gravity Manipulation is present in all three installed fusion lists.&r"
		""
		"&f6. &eRace route:&f choose or evolve into a race that grants or exposes the skill, including Fairy Prince and Gravity Soul Insect. Ascension's Void Dragonewt lists it as an intrinsic learnable rather than a guaranteed starting intrinsic.&r"
		""
		"&f7. &eTR: Nightmare True Dragon route:&f placing the Velgaia/Earth True Dragon form in its active slot applies its passives and grants Earth Manipulation plus Gravity Manipulation if missing.&r"
		""
		"&f8. &eMob-plunder route:&f Charybdis and Ascension's Cataclysm Ender Golem possess Gravity Manipulation. Use a compatible plunder mechanic such as Gluttony's subordinate retrieval or Corrosion kill route; possession alone does not guarantee a drop.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Gravity Domination through mastering Gravity Manipulation, or through TR: Nightmare's Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation recipe for 100,000 MP.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Gravity Manipulation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8FTB can verify the resulting skill, but not the selected core phase, plunder roll, or private mastery-hook timing.&r"
	]
	quest.1EB69FDD4824EFF4.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.1EB69FDD4824EFF4.title: "Gravity Manipulation"
