	quest.205A67252A4C31F6.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA King-class ultimate skill that embodies total destruction and catastrophic force.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Breaker (trnightmare:breaker), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Breaker (trnightmare:breaker) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Kill 5,000 mobs&r"
		"&f• Carry 25 x tensura:daemon_essence (the condition does not consume it when its final flag is false)&r"
		"&f• Master 30 Magic abilities&r"
		"&f• Master 5 Battlewill abilities&r"
		"&f• Master Spatial Domination (tensura:spatial_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Multilayer Barrier (tensura:multilayer_barrier)&r"
		"&f• Master Breaker (trnightmare:breaker)&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 750,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Abaddon, King of Destruction ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Mobs killed: 5,000 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Carry 25 × tensura:daemon_essence — exact current inventory count; consumption/ritual success is not proven&r"
		"&f• Magic mastered (lifetime counter): 30 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Battlewill mastered (lifetime counter): 5 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Master: Spatial Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Multilayer Barrier — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Breaker — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 750,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.205A67252A4C31F6.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
