	quest.21267F42BBF2680C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fToggle: +19% learning/mastery rate for all skills, plus Chant Annulment for mastered magic. Modes: Magic Chant (learn new magic for XP), Study (steal a skill from a target's mind), Create Tome (turn a learned magic into a tome book).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Timeless Mage (ascension:timeless_mage) through Ascension Awakening Altar.&r &7Requirements: Know at least one Aspectual Magic from every AspectualType except MISC. You need type coverage, not every individual spell; mastered Great Mage; max EP at least 5M; True Demon Lord or True Hero; doAscensionUltimate gamerule enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Great Mage — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
