	quest.2172129A25CADF12.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Daemon Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fEnlightened Ogre&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fKijin&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDeath Oni&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Obtain 10 x Daemon Essence (tensura:daemon_essence): Defeat Arch Daemons (50%), Greater Daemons (10%), or Lesser Daemons (1%). It also appears in Hell Ruins chests and Hell Ruins archaeology. Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Current race: Wicked Oni — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
