	quest.219403B4C6F9A8FB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§4Snatch §3is both an Enchantment-Type and Stealth-Type Unique Skill that allows the user to §0rob §3objectsand even the abilities of otherswithout ever laying a finger on them. This §8intangible attack §3slips through §9barriers, §7armor, and §8defenses alike, making it §4lethal §3in the hands of someone who knows how to use it. When wielded correctly, it's less a skill and more a §cviolation of reality.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §4Snatch — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
