		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: either use/eat 100 Rotten Flesh, kill 100 tensura:tempest_serpent, kill 1 tensura:orc_lord, OR kill 1 tensura:orc_disaster. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
