	quest.21A8C6D552CCC83C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAnalyze targets' status and power.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Uncommon Burnt.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Low Rare.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.21A8C6D552CCC83C.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.21A8C6D552CCC83C.title: "Analyze"
	quest.21B1790674F4318A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYour body is uniquely powered by source, making you innately resistant to the four elements, and raises your magic's power when using Elemental Magic.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.AMETHYST_GOLEM_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.DRYGMY_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.FLARECANNON_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.FLASHJACK_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.SIREN_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.STARBUNCLE_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.WHIRLISPRIG_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.WILDEN_GUARDIAN_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.WILDEN_HUNTER_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.WILDEN_STALKER_GENETICS.get(); then master StarlightIntrinsicSkills.WIXIE_GENETICS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Source Powered — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
