	quest.21FACD75EEB5E946.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate awakening of Great Mage. Auto-learns and masters every aspectual and spirit magic; passive chant annulment. Toggle: +29 mastery gain, perfect Analytical Appraisal, magic bypasses resistances, and grants creative flight that Magic Jamming cannot interrupt. Modes: Create Tome / Zoltraak / Magic Dominate.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Great Mage (ascension:great_mage), then use Ascension Awakening Altar. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension Awakening Altar: Reach at least 5,000,000 maximum EP and become a True Demon Lord or True Hero. Master the listed Unique skill. Know at least one Aspectual Magic from every AspectualType except MISC. You need type coverage, not every individual spell. Build an Awakening Altar with its floor one block below the altar. In a 9×9 area centered on the altar, include floor positions where dx²+dz² is at most 17. Use Deepslate Bricks for interior positions; use non-top Deepslate Brick Slabs wherever a north/east/south/west neighboring position is outside that shape. At offsets (-2,-2), (-2,+2), (+2,-2), (+2,+2), build pillars starting at altar height: Deepslate Bricks, Ascension Deepslate Magic Block, Deepslate Bricks, then TenSura Pure Magisteel Block. Drop one Ultimate Catalyst directly above the altar so it absorbs it, then interact with the altar using an empty hand. Stay alive, in the same dimension, and within 8 horizontal blocks for the 10-second ritual. If several eligible mastered Unique skills meet their gates, the ritual chooses one randomly. Success replaces that Unique with its Ultimate and starts a 120-minute per-player cooldown by default.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Great Mage (ascension:great_mage) through Ascension Awakening Altar.&r &7Requirements: Know at least one Aspectual Magic from every AspectualType except MISC. You need type coverage, not every individual spell; mastered Great Mage; max EP at least 5M; True Demon Lord or True Hero; doAscensionUltimate gamerule enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Pillar arrangement, internal eaten/damage counters, charged-stone NBT and per-player cooldown are not measurable by a simple item/kill task. Consumed special items are taken during preparation; ritual cancellation does not prove they are refunded.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Timeless Mage — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 5,000,000 — exact maximum EP gate used by the altar&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero state&r"
		"&f• Master: Great Mage — completes when mastered&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.21FACD75EEB5E946.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Ascension"
	quest.21FACD75EEB5E946.title: "Timeless Mage"
