	quest.22B644902B4520C3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7Born from the collapse of §4Pride§7, forged in the void between soul and thought, §9Nodens§7 is the incarnation of pure abyssal thought. This §dGod-Class Ultimate Skill§7 cannot be learned, only survived.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess trnightmare:lucifer. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Lucifer, Lord of Pride ｣ (trnightmare:lucifer), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Lucifer, Lord of Pride ｣ (trnightmare:lucifer) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Spacetime Domination (trnightmare:spacetime_domination) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Learn ｢ Lucifer, Lord of Pride ｣ (trnightmare:lucifer)&r"
		"&f• Have at least 40,000,000 EP&r"
		"&f• Master 150 total skills&r"
		"&f• Analyze 8 Ultimate-skill submodes with Lucifer&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 3,400,000&r"
		"&f• Learn/own ｢ Lucifer, Lord of Pride ｣ (trnightmare:lucifer).&r"
		"&f• Standard path: reach 40,000,000 maximum EP, master 150 total skills plus Spatial Motion and Multilayer Barrier, analyze at least 8 Ultimate submodes with Lucifer, and (by default) analyze Raphael's Alteration mode.&r"
		"&f• The standard maximum-Magicule gate is 3,400,000 plus the default acquisition cost of every Ultimate submode currently stored in Lucifer/Nodens; it is therefore dynamic, not a fixed 3,400,000 total.&r"
		"&f• Alternate path: reach 30,000,000 maximum EP and either own or have Lucifer store Azathoth's Soul Gluttony mode and Shub-Niggurath's Skill Storage mode. This route requires 12,300,000 maximum Magicule capacity.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare God Skills gamerule must also be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• For non-creative players, this God-class skill must not already have another world owner; the successful evolution claims its ownership record.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Nodens, God of Abyss ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Lucifer, Lord of Pride ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 40,000,000 — exact maximum EP value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Skills mastered (lifetime counter): 150 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 3,400,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 12,300,000 — exact alternate-path gate; the standard-path requirement is dynamic and can differ&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.22B644902B4520C3.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.22B644902B4520C3.title: "｢ Nodens, God of Abyss ｣"
	quest.22BEF8648EAB4A2E.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fWarp behind your target for a devastating opener, apply Blood Mist, then activate again to detonate it.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.22BEF8648EAB4A2E.quest_subtitle: "Advanced \\& Addon Battlewill • TR: Nightmare"
