		"&fArmored Giant (twilightforest:armored_giant); Ferrous Wroughtnaut (mowziesmobs:ferrous_wroughtnaut); Knight Phantom (twilightforest:knight_phantom); Minoshroom (twilightforest:minoshroom); Naga (mowziesmobs:naga); Sandworm (block_factorys_bosses:sandworm); Scylla (cataclysm:scylla); Soul Knight Wither Skeleton (block_factorys_bosses:soul_knight_wither_skeleton); The Harbinger (cataclysm:the_harbinger); The Prowler (cataclysm:the_prowler); Umvuthana Raptor (mowziesmobs:umvuthana_raptor); Underworld Knight (block_factorys_bosses:underworld_knight); Valkyrie (aether:valkyrie); Valkyrie Queen (aether:valkyrie_queen)&r"
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Haki — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
