	quest.2422A0268A9839A8.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSpill your own blood to summon a mist which steals the vitality of your enemies and can be blown up to harm any nearby entities or shoot a powerful blood beam.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fLuminous Valentine (tensura_neb:luminous_valentine); The Dead King (irons_spellbooks:dead_king)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fBlood Noble (ascension:blood_noble); Divine Vampire (tensura:divine_vampire); Elder Bloodfiend (ascension:elder_bloodfiend); Frog Monarch (ascension:frog_monarch); Infinite Djinn (ascension:infinite_djinn); Kindred Bloodfiend (ascension:kindred_bloodfiend)&r"
		"&fOmniversal Djinn (ascension:omniversal_djinn); Progenitor Bloodfiend (ascension:progenitor_bloodfiend); Sovereign Djinn (ascension:sovereign_djinn); Vampire Lord (tensura:vampire_lord); Vampire Overcomer (tensura:vampire_overcomer)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Blood Mist — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2422A0268A9839A8.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.2422A0268A9839A8.title: "Blood Mist"
