	quest.24299C6F821D6B9D.title: "Crystal Glutton: 25 Kills"
	quest.242F80C84C27FB7A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fFire a light beam that deals massive damage to undead entities and burns blocks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Medium-or-higher Light spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Light Spiritual Magic through Medium, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Light. Minimum contract level: Medium. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fSeraph (trnightmare:seraph)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.242F80C84C27FB7A.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.242F80C84C27FB7A.title: "Solar Beam"
	quest.24336CE8670347D4.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA unique skill that studies, stores and weaponizes hostile status effects.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Fungus Infection — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.24336CE8670347D4.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Tensura More Skills"
	quest.24336CE8670347D4.title: "Fungus Infection"
	quest.24516ADDAD66C141.quest_desc: [
		"&fReach a form that has no further registered evolution in its current line. This is about completing your route, not collecting every race in the pack.&r"
		""
		"&fThe milestone completes when your current race has no remaining evolution defined for it.&r"
	]
	quest.24516ADDAD66C141.title: "Finish a Race Evolution Line"
	quest.24581E18FB061747.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fActive: pull nearby items and XP orbs to you within 8 blocks for 5s (12 blocks / 10s mastered). Costs 2000 magicule (1000 mastered). 20s cooldown (10s mastered). Obtained by using a plunderer skill on an Iron Golem.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Eye of Mind (ascension:eye_of_mind), then use Ascension Eye of Mind analysis copy. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension Eye of Mind analysis copy: Obtain Eye of Mind (ascension:eye_of_mind) and place it in an active skill slot. Find a newly loaded Iron Golem (minecraft:iron_golem). Ascension automatically gives that mob ascension:magnetized_vacuum while the relevant skill setting is enabled. Target the mob within 20 blocks, select Eye of Mind's Analysis mode, and activate it. The copy chance is 25% normally or 50% after mastering Eye of Mind. Repeat after the short failed-attempt cooldown until the skill is copied. If the target has other eligible skills, Analysis randomly chooses among the eligible unowned skills.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Eye of Mind (ascension:eye_of_mind) through Ascension Eye of Mind analysis copy.&r &7Requirements: own Eye of Mind; analyze minecraft:iron_golem; successful 25%/50% copy roll.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can confirm Eye of Mind and the resulting skill, but cannot observe the targeted mob or random Analysis roll.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Magnetized Vacuum — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.24581E18FB061747.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • Ascension"
	quest.24581E18FB061747.title: "Magnetized Vacuum"
	quest.245DCEA74819C4BE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate awakening of Bubble Majin. Toggle: full HP heal every 10s, cleanse all negative effects every 5s, reflect basic projectiles. Modes: Storage, Candy for me! (12-block AOE — turns every entity you're 2x stronger than (5x for bosses) into a single merged Majin Candy that lands in your inventory; copies all skills except ultimates), Hunger (held — pink Gluttony-style predation mist, no corrosion DOT, cost-free).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Bubble Majin (ascension:bubble_majin), then use Ascension Awakening Altar. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension Awakening Altar: Reach at least 5,000,000 maximum EP and become a True Demon Lord or True Hero. Master the listed Unique skill. Eat 50 Majin Candies over your lifetime; the ascension:majin_candies_eaten counter must reach 50. Build an Awakening Altar with its floor one block below the altar. In a 9×9 area centered on the altar, include floor positions where dx²+dz² is at most 17. Use Deepslate Bricks for interior positions; use non-top Deepslate Brick Slabs wherever a north/east/south/west neighboring position is outside that shape. At offsets (-2,-2), (-2,+2), (+2,-2), (+2,+2), build pillars starting at altar height: Deepslate Bricks, Ascension Deepslate Magic Block, Deepslate Bricks, then TenSura Pure Magisteel Block. Drop one Ultimate Catalyst directly above the altar so it absorbs it, then interact with the altar using an empty hand. Stay alive, in the same dimension, and within 8 horizontal blocks for the 10-second ritual. If several eligible mastered Unique skills meet their gates, the ritual chooses one randomly. Success replaces that Unique with its Ultimate and starts a 120-minute per-player cooldown by default.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Bubble Majin (ascension:bubble_majin) through Ascension Awakening Altar.&r &7Requirements: Eat 50 Majin Candies over your lifetime; the ascension:majin_candies_eaten counter must reach 50; mastered Bubble Majin; max EP at least 5M; True Demon Lord or True Hero; doAscensionUltimate gamerule enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Pillar arrangement, internal eaten/damage counters, charged-stone NBT and per-player cooldown are not measurable by a simple item/kill task. Consumed special items are taken during preparation; ritual cancellation does not prove they are refunded.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: The Evil Majin — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 5,000,000 — exact maximum EP gate used by the altar&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero state&r"
		"&f• Master: Bubble Majin — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• ascension:majin_candies_eaten: 50 — exact lifetime custom statistic used by the altar gate&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.245DCEA74819C4BE.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Ascension"
	quest.245DCEA74819C4BE.title: "The Evil Majin"
	quest.247176C613BD8C16.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fFeed on your enemies' defeat. Gain EP from kills, destroy equipment faster, and boost your physical stats based on your power level.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Strength (tensura:strength), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fShogo Taguchi (tensura:shogo_taguchi)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Strength (tensura:strength) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 3).&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Berserker — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.247176C613BD8C16.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.247176C613BD8C16.title: "Berserker"
	quest.247333E373FECBAA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f450,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fMutant Giant&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fGod Of Earth&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 450,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 450,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: One Eyed God — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.247333E373FECBAA.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
