	quest.248EDF78BF90939B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fEquipped: +20% physical and magic damage, +10% crit (+10% physical / +10% crit mastered). Toggle: reflect 25% of incoming physical damage. Forces your alignment to Chaos. Modes: Chaos Spades (white-flame Soul-damage breath scaling with EP, capped at 10M EP), Explosive Goodbye (below 25% HP, detonate for missing-HP damage to nearby enemies' HP and SHP — kills you).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• The Unbound Jester (ascension:unbound_jester) through Ascension Awakening Altar.&r &7Requirements: Deal 1,000,000 cumulative spiritual damage while Imprisoned Jester is in its skill slot; uses ascension:jester_spirit_damage, default gateSpiritDamage=1,000,000; mastered Imprisoned Jester; max EP at least 5M; True Demon Lord or True Hero; doAscensionUltimate gamerule enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Imprisoned Jester — completes when you learn it&r"
