	quest.249C4248FBAB1E2D.title: "Checkpoint"
	quest.249EC5966813E851.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBeelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony is the ultimate evolved Skill of Gluttony. Devour all in your path&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:gluttony; then possess tensura:merciless. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Gluttony (tensura:gluttony), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gluttony (tensura:gluttony) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Azathoth, God of The Void ｣ (trnightmare:azathoth) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Gluttony Manas (trnightmare:gluttony_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Kill 1,500 mobs&r"
		"&f• Eat 10 cake slices&r"
		"&f• Master Gluttony (tensura:gluttony)&r"
		"&f• Master Merciless (tensura:merciless)&r"
		"&f• Be at or below 0.5 of maximum HP when attempting evolution&r"
		"&f• Master Gluttony (tensura:gluttony).&r"
		"&f• Master Merciless (tensura:merciless).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,500,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Mobs killed: 1,500 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Cake slices eaten: 10 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Master: Gluttony — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Merciless — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,500,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
