	quest.252F7104277CD8CD.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn ultimate angelic key that devours prisons and suppressors, crowning space itself with divine locks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Infinity Prison (tensura:infinity_prison), then use MoreSkills Michael natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Suppressor (tensura:suppressor), then use MoreSkills Michael natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. MoreSkills Michael natural acquisition: Learn and master Infinity Prison (tensura:infinity_prison), and also learn Suppressor (tensura:suppressor). Raise maximum Magicule capacity strictly above 5,000,000 at the default MP skill-cost gamerule. The threshold scales with that gamerule. Gain EP so the usual acquisition check runs. On success, Michael is learned, both Infinity Prison and Suppressor are consumed, and 5,000,000 current Magicules are deducted.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Infinity Prison (tensura:infinity_prison) through MoreSkills Michael natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Infinity Prison; possess Suppressor; maximum Magicule > 5,000,000 x MP_SKILL_COST/100.&r"
		"&f• Suppressor (tensura:suppressor) through MoreSkills Michael natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Infinity Prison; possess Suppressor; maximum Magicule > 5,000,000 x MP_SKILL_COST/100.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8The installed code checks the capacity gate before deducting current Magicules; arrive with enough current Magicules to avoid being reduced to zero.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Michael, Angel of Locks — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Infinity Prison — exact configured prerequisite mastery&r"
		"&f• Learn: Suppressor — exact additional class-level prerequisite&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 5,000,001 — default rule requires strictly more than 5,000,000 maximum Magicules&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
