		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 3,500,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Defeat 2 TenSura bosses. This evolution uses TenSura's lifetime boss-defeat count.&r"
		"&f3. Drain 15,000 total blood through the Blood Arts blood-drain mechanics. This is the mod's cumulative totalBloodDrained value, not your current stored-blood amount.&r"
		"&f4. Successfully turn 120 mobs or consenting players into kindred with Blood Arts: Kindred Rite. This is the mod's cumulative totalThrallsTurned value.&r"
		"&f5. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 3,500,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Bosses defeated: 2 — exact lifetime custom-stat counter; may predate this quest&r"
		"&f• Current race: Crimson Progenitor — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
