	quest.26938372911AC9B4.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTrue Uriel awakened from Infinity Prison. It grants believer scaling, absolute guard, imprisoning authority, severing force, and a bound Imaginary Space that stores blocked energy.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:infinity_prison. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Infinity Prison (tensura:infinity_prison), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Infinity Prison (tensura:infinity_prison) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Shub-Niggurath, King of Harvest ｣ (trnightmare:shub_niggurath) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Paladin Manas (trnightmare:paladin_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Infinity Prison (tensura:infinity_prison)&r"
		"&f• Win 25 village raids&r"
		"&f• Name 50 subordinates&r"
		"&f• Master Infinity Prison (tensura:infinity_prison).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,750,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Uriel, Lord of Vows ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Infinity Prison — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Village raids won: 25 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,750,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
