	quest.271DF190EB229583.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fHold: regen 5% max magicule/s (7% mastered) at the cost of 1% max aura/s. Auto-learned at 25,000 EP.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Master Battlewill, remove/avoid Mysticism Restricted, and allow Ascension's player-tick check to run. It learns Energy Charge automatically.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fEvolves/unlocks from: Battlewill. Master Battlewill; Mysticism Restricted must be absent and Energy Charge must be enabled.&r"
		"&fUnlocks Maximum Charge (ascension:maximum_charge): Master Energy Charge; Mysticism Restricted must be absent and Maximum Charge must be enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
