	quest.280B3CA6B413CF42.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis chapter covers all &e187&f player-facing Unique skills in the pack.&r"
		"&fEach page explains what the skill does, how to learn it, which mobs use it, which races grant it, and where it can evolve.&r"
		"&7Use the checkmark to mark a page as read. Automatic tasks only report progress; they never grant a skill.&r"
		"&7Learn and mastery tasks check your current character. Statistics may include older progress, but FTB kill tasks start counting only after the quest begins tracking them.&r"
	]
	quest.280B3CA6B413CF42.quest_subtitle: "Review the Unique skill catalog"
	quest.280B3CA6B413CF42.title: "Unique Skills"
	quest.280BFE57D7A8D5C8.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCoat the caster with a Magic Barrier with the strength based on Health.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Rare Buried.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Medium Rare.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fGreater Daemon (tensura:greater_daemon)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.280BFE57D7A8D5C8.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.280BFE57D7A8D5C8.title: "Magic Barrier"
	quest.281489B24AC58960.quest_desc: [
		"&fTenSura generates several ruined Wizard Tower variants. This route uses the Ruined tower as the tracked example.&r"
		""
		"&fApproach from outside, check upper floors before dropping into enclosed rooms, and keep any unusual magic materials for later recipes.&r"
	]
	quest.281489B24AC58960.title: "Tier 1: Search a Wizard Tower"
	quest.28159659CA2F382E.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBy obtaining the mythical Hero Egg, the veil of deception is torn apart. No illusion or concealment can deceive your sight, and your vision becomes perfect.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: be awakened as a True Hero. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fCosmic Deity (ascension:cosmic_deity); Divine Angel (ascension:divine_angel)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Eye of Truth — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.28159659CA2F382E.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.28159659CA2F382E.title: "Eye of Truth"
	quest.28181F993ECEC8B1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f420,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fNinehead&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fSoul Beast&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 420,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 420,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Ninetail — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.28181F993ECEC8B1.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.28181F993ECEC8B1.title: "Ninetail"
