	quest.291AC495F643EDEF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYour powerful authority over the elements of Wind, Water and Space as the True Storm Dragon.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. TR Origins True Dragon element grant: Follow the TR Origins race progression and become the Storm True Dragon. When the True Dragon storage registers that element, DragonElementUtils automatically learns Dragon Factor: Storm and applies the element's resistance/skill package.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8The skill is intrinsic to that selected True Dragon element and is tagged no-plundering.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Dragon Factor: Storm — completes when you learn it&r"
