		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 10,000. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAmped Guitar Wolf (mysticism:amped_guitar_wolf); Antumbra Spirit Wolf (mysticism:antumbra_spirit_wolf); Blazing Scorch Wolf (mysticism:blazing_scorch_wolf); Divine Tengu (mysticism:divine_tengu); Divine Wolf (mysticism:divine_wolf); Glacier Spirit Wolf (mysticism:glacier_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&fMagic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:gale_spirit_wolf); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:magic_spirit_wolf); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:ocean_spirit_wolf); Molten Spirit Wolf (mysticism:molten_spirit_wolf); Mountain Spirit Wolf (mysticism:mountain_spirit_wolf); Mystical Black Fang (mysticism:mystical_black_fang)&r"
		"&fMystical Black Fang (mysticism:mystical_blue_fang); Mystical Brown Fang (mysticism:mystical_brown_fang); Mystical Darkness Fang (mysticism:mystical_darkness_fang); Mystical Green Fang (mysticism:mystical_green_fang); Mystical Light Fang (mysticism:mystical_light_fang); Mystical Purple Fang (mysticism:mystical_purple_fang)&r"
		"&fMystical Red Fang (mysticism:mystical_red_fang); Nivalis Frost Wolf (mysticism:nivalis_frost_wolf); Penumbra Spirit Wolf (mysticism:penumbra_spirit_wolf); Planet Spirit Wolf (mysticism:planet_spirit_wolf); Storm Spirit Wolf (mysticism:storm_spirit_wolf); String Spirit Wolf (mysticism:string_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&fTempest Star Wolf (mysticism:tempest_star_wolf); Tengu (mysticism:tengu); Tengu Saint (mysticism:tengu_saint); Volcanic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:volcanic_spirit_wolf)&r"
