		"&f2. Obtain 8 x Elemental Essence (tensura:elemental_essence): Defeat Akash, Ifrit, Sylphide, Undine, or War Gnome (guaranteed). Several lesser elemental mobs and qualifying summoned Elemental Colossi have a 10% source. Then eat/use all 8; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
