	quest.2A81EF1A0621E72B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f10,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fDirewolf&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fAmped Guitar Wolf&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fString Spirit Wolf&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 10,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Learn Sound Manipulation (tensura:sound_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sound Manipulation — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Guitar Wolf — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.2A81EF1A0621E72B.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Mysticism"
	quest.2A81EF1A0621E72B.title: "Guitar Wolf"
	quest.2A84E7FD0A5564FA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fShoot many light projectiles that deal massive damage to undead creatures.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Greater-or-higher Light spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Light Spiritual Magic through Greater, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Light. Minimum contract level: Greater. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fSeraph (trnightmare:seraph)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.2A84E7FD0A5564FA.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.2A84E7FD0A5564FA.title: "Solar Rain"
	quest.2A93DA10CF8855D1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIm boutta stasis rn bro&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare boss-drop route:&f personally defeat the Sentient Boss Velzard. The skill is rolled from that boss's configured reward list; its chance is half of TenSura's configured Otherworlder skill-drop percentage, so the kill is not guaranteed to award it.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §fStasis — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2A93DA10CF8855D1.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
