	quest.2AE4E14781A6E94A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fManipulate gravity to allow flight, your momentum from before will be continued.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 10,000. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fBlaze (minecraft:blaze); Charybdis (tensura:charybdis); Wither (minecraft:wither)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Gravity Flight — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2AE4E14781A6E94A.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.2AE4E14781A6E94A.title: "Gravity Flight"
