	quest.2B22EB636B5F30B3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe ultimate evolution of Deal Maker — forge contracts that bind even ultimates, crystallize skills, and enter the minds of those bound to you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Deal Maker (trnightmare:deal_maker), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Deal Maker (trnightmare:deal_maker) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Deal Maker (trnightmare:deal_maker)&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 1,000,000&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,000,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Pazuzu, Lord of Mischief ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Deal Maker — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,000,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2B22EB636B5F30B3.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
