	quest.2B97BB08E1962521.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f420,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f20× Life Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fFairy Prince&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fTrue Fairy King&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 420,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 20 x Life Essence (trnightmare:life_essence): Complete Direwolf Raids (1-2 at 65%), use bone meal on a non-mature crop (50%), or break a mature crop (10%). Then eat/use all 20; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 420,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Sacred Tree Child — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.2B97BB08E1962521.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.2B97BB08E1962521.title: "Sacred Tree Child"
	quest.2B9F2904394437B3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUse your sensitive hearing to precisely pin the location of any nearby mobs which make sound.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAbyssal Dragonewt (ascension:abyssal_dragonewt); Arch Daemonic Dragon (trnightmare:arch_daemonic_dragon); Arch Dragon (trnightmare:arch_dragon); Chaos Dragon (ascension:chaos_dragon); Corrupted Dragon (ascension:corrupted_dragon); Corrupted Dragonkin (ascension:corrupted_dragonkin)&r"
		"&fCursed Dragon (ascension:cursed_dragon); Daemonic Dragon Lord (trnightmare:daemonic_dragon_lord); Death Dragon (trnightmare:death_dragon); Demon Dragon God (ascension:demon_dragon_god); Demonic Dragon (ascension:demonic_dragon); Devil Dragon Lord (trnightmare:devil_dragon_lord)&r"
		"&fDivine Dragon (tensura:divine_dragon); Divine Dragon Lord (trnightmare:divine_dragon_lord); Divine Gehenna Dragon (trnightmare:divine_gehenna_dragon); Divine Heavenly Dragon (trnightmare:divine_heavenly_dragon); Divine Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:divine_netherite_dragon); Divine Saiyan (elitetensura:divine_saiyan)&r"
		"&fDivine Void Dragon (trnightmare:divine_void_dragon); Dragon Lord (trnightmare:dragon_lord); Dragonewt (tensura:dragonewt); Dragonoid (mysticism:dragonoid); Element Dragon (trnightmare:element_dragon); Ender Dragon Prince (trnightmare:ender_dragon_prince)&r"
		"&fEnder Dragonewt (ascension:ender_dragonewt); Frostcoil Sea Serpent (mysticism:frostcoil_sea_serpent); Frostwrought Leviathan (mysticism:frostwrought_leviathan); Gehenna Dragon (trnightmare:gehenna_dragon); Heavenly Dragon (trnightmare:heavenly_dragon); High Class Saiyan (elitetensura:high_saiyan)&r"
		"&fLesser Daemonic Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_daemonic_dragon); Lesser Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_dragon); Lesser Ender Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_ender_dragon); Lesser Holy Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_holy_dragon); Lesser Nether Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_nether_dragon); Lesser Zombie Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_zombie_dragon)&r"
		"&fMedium Daemonic Dragon (trnightmare:medium_daemonic_dragon); Medium Dragon (trnightmare:medium_dragon); Medium Ender Dragon (trnightmare:medium_ender_dragon); Medium Holy Dragon (trnightmare:medium_holy_dragon); Medium Nether Dragon (trnightmare:medium_nether_dragon); Medium Zombie Dragon (trnightmare:medium_zombie_dragon)&r"
		"&fNetherite Dragon (trnightmare:netherite_dragon); Saint Dragon (trnightmare:saint_dragon); Salamander Fire Spirit (trnightmare:salamander_fire_spirit); Salamander Fire Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:salamander_fire_dragon); Salamander Warlock (trnightmare:salamander_warlock); Scrap Dragon (trnightmare:scrap_dragon)&r"
		"&fSundeity Loong (mysticism:sundeity_loong); Sunfire Lindwurm (mysticism:sunfire_lindwurm); True Dragon (trorigins:true_dragon); True Dragonewt (tensura:true_dragonewt); True Dragonoid (mysticism:true_dragonoid); Void Dragon (trnightmare:void_dragon)&r"
		"&fVoid Dragonewt (ascension:void_dragonewt)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Dragon Ear — completes when you learn it&r"
