	quest.2BB596EFF69BA06D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts the power of Earth abilities by a decent amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: reach Earth Spirit level 1. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Earth grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fBeast Gnome (tensura:beast_gnome); War Gnome (tensura:war_gnome)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fBlazing Scorch Wolf (mysticism:blazing_scorch_wolf); Brown Fang (mysticism:brown_fang); Earth Genasi (trarcane:earth_genasi); Earth Soul Insect (mysticism:earth_soul_insect); Fairy Lord (trarcane:fairy_lord); Fairy Queen (trarcane:fairy_queen)&r"
		"&fGiant Dancer (trnightmare:giant_dancer); Giant Warrior (trnightmare:giant_warrior); Lesser Giant (trnightmare:lesser_giant); Molten Spirit Wolf (mysticism:molten_spirit_wolf); Mountain Spirit Wolf (mysticism:mountain_spirit_wolf); Mystical Brown Fang (mysticism:mystical_brown_fang)&r"
		"&fScorch Wolf (mysticism:scorch_wolf)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Earth Domination (tensura:earth_domination) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:earth_manipulation; possess tensura:earth_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Earth Domination (tensura:earth_domination) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:earth_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:earth_domination.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Earth Manipulation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2BB596EFF69BA06D.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.2BB596EFF69BA06D.title: "Earth Manipulation"
	quest.2BB9991872A9B7EE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
