		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 200,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Master Flame Manipulation (tensura:flame_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
