	quest.2BB9991872A9B7EE.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Mysticism"
	quest.2BB9991872A9B7EE.title: "Mystical Red Fang"
	quest.2BC865C97FBC3429.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSummon a Basilisk to temporarily fight for you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Tame a Basilisk. The POST_TAME_EVENT permanently records you as owner and directly teaches Summon Basilisk.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.2BC865C97FBC3429.quest_subtitle: "Summoning Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.2BC865C97FBC3429.title: "Summon Basilisk"
	quest.2BCD0A2AB8EF9E6A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&fThis race does not use the usual EP or item requirement list. Follow its route below."
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 1,500,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Drain 5,500 total blood through the Blood Arts blood-drain mechanics. This is the mod's cumulative totalBloodDrained value, not your current stored-blood amount.&r"
		"&f3. Successfully turn 50 mobs or consenting players into kindred with Blood Arts: Kindred Rite. This is the mod's cumulative totalThrallsTurned value.&r"
		"&f4. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 1,500,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Blood Monarch — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.2BCD0A2AB8EF9E6A.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • TenSura More Skills"
