	quest.2BCD998525CC7F68.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fHold: regen 10% max magicule/s (15% mastered) at the cost of 2% max aura/s. Auto-learned at 100,000 EP once Energy Charge is mastered.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Master Energy Charge, remove/avoid Mysticism Restricted, and allow Ascension's player-tick check to run. It learns Maximum Charge automatically.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fEvolves/unlocks from: Energy Charge. Master Energy Charge; Mysticism Restricted must be absent and Maximum Charge must be enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
