	quest.2D10B7B3852E8372.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn ultimate skill of creation-based light and celestial manifestation.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:creator. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Creator (tensura:creator), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Creator (tensura:creator) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Akashic Records, God of Origin ｣ (trnightmare:akashic_records) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Creator (tensura:creator)&r"
		"&f• Master Law Manipulation (tensura:law_manipulation)&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 750,000&r"
		"&f• Create Anti-Skill at least 10 times with Astral Light's precursor system&r"
		"&f• Master Creator (tensura:creator).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 750,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astral Light, Lord of Creation ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Creator — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Law Manipulation — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 750,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2D10B7B3852E8372.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.2D10B7B3852E8372.title: "｢ Astral Light, Lord of Creation ｣"
	quest.2D12A9BE1BD6358A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fLike the lizardmen, move through water and mud with no penalties while receiving a slight defense buff. &r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fLizardman (tensura:lizardman); Megalodon (tensura:megalodon); Orc Disaster (tensura:orc_disaster); Orc Lord (tensura:orc_lord)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAbyssal Dragonewt (ascension:abyssal_dragonewt); Chaos Dragon (ascension:chaos_dragon); Corrupted Dragon (ascension:corrupted_dragon); Corrupted Dragonkin (ascension:corrupted_dragonkin); Cursed Dragon (ascension:cursed_dragon); Demon Dragon God (ascension:demon_dragon_god)&r"
		"&fDemonic Dragon (ascension:demonic_dragon); Divine Dragon (tensura:divine_dragon); Dragonewt (tensura:dragonewt); Ender Dragonewt (ascension:ender_dragonewt); Lizardman (tensura:lizardman); True Dragonewt (tensura:true_dragonewt)&r"
		"&fVoid Dragonewt (ascension:void_dragonewt)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Scale Armor — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2D12A9BE1BD6358A.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.2D12A9BE1BD6358A.title: "Scale Armor"
