	quest.2D8836BEBFE1C9DF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate awakening of Sealer. Passive: every kill grants +0.5 Max Spiritual HP, capped at +20,000. Modes: Seal (capture mob into stone if 1.5x stronger), Suppress (seal 20% of self or sneak-target's Max EP into a stone), Enough is Enough (steal a random skill — excluding ultimates / magics / battlewills — into a redeemable stone). All produced stones land in your inventory.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Sealer (ascension:sealer), then use Ascension Awakening Altar. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension Awakening Altar: Reach at least 5,000,000 maximum EP and become a True Demon Lord or True Hero. Master the listed Unique skill. Carry a Suppression Stone whose stored aura plus stored magicules is at least 400,000; one qualifying stone is consumed when the ritual prepares. Build an Awakening Altar with its floor one block below the altar. In a 9×9 area centered on the altar, include floor positions where dx²+dz² is at most 17. Use Deepslate Bricks for interior positions; use non-top Deepslate Brick Slabs wherever a north/east/south/west neighboring position is outside that shape. At offsets (-2,-2), (-2,+2), (+2,-2), (+2,+2), build pillars starting at altar height: Deepslate Bricks, Ascension Deepslate Magic Block, Deepslate Bricks, then TenSura Pure Magisteel Block. Drop one Ultimate Catalyst directly above the altar so it absorbs it, then interact with the altar using an empty hand. Stay alive, in the same dimension, and within 8 horizontal blocks for the 10-second ritual. If several eligible mastered Unique skills meet their gates, the ritual chooses one randomly. Success replaces that Unique with its Ultimate and starts a 120-minute per-player cooldown by default.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Sealer (ascension:sealer) through Ascension Awakening Altar.&r &7Requirements: Carry a Suppression Stone whose stored aura plus stored magicules is at least 400,000; one qualifying stone is consumed when the ritual prepares; mastered Sealer; max EP at least 5M; True Demon Lord or True Hero; doAscensionUltimate gamerule enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Pillar arrangement, internal eaten/damage counters, charged-stone NBT and per-player cooldown are not measurable by a simple item/kill task. Consumed special items are taken during preparation; ritual cancellation does not prove they are refunded.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: The One Who Seals — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 5,000,000 — exact maximum EP gate used by the altar&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero state&r"
		"&f• Master: Sealer — completes when mastered&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2D8836BEBFE1C9DF.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Ascension"
	quest.2D8836BEBFE1C9DF.title: "The One Who Seals"
	quest.2D9CCDC887F5CAD0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fWhile in-slot, the user becomes Blessed and takes reduced Fire, Water, Lightning, Wind, Earth, Space, Light, and Dark damage.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gift (trnightmare:gift), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation: Obtain Gift (or its Ultimate continuation Astraea) and place it in an active skill slot. Open Gift Creation / Astraea Blessing Creation and select this skill from the available blessings. Confirm creation. The default Gift creation cost is 0 Magicules with a 100-tick cooldown. The result lives inside Gift/Astraea as a sub-ability rather than a separate learned skill.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gift (trnightmare:gift) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB ability tasks cannot inspect sub-ability slots; use the parent-skill tracker and manual confirmation.&r"
