	quest.2D9CCDC887F5CAD0.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.2D9CCDC887F5CAD0.title: "Divine Protection of Gathering Spirits"
	quest.2DAF625F3F052F61.quest_desc: [
		"&fUse the Labyrinth Tree route and enter the Labyrinth dimension. Its vertical exits matter: Mysticism also connects the upper Labyrinth to the Elemental Realm.&r"
		""
		"&fSimply reaching the Labyrinth finishes this visit; you do not need to defeat anything there.&r"
	]
	quest.2DAF625F3F052F61.title: "8. Descend into the Labyrinth"
	quest.2DBDA3A32FDB11C5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA unique skill that drags the dying soul into limbo.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: I Want to Be Just Like You! — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2DBDA3A32FDB11C5.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Tensura More Skills"
	quest.2DBDA3A32FDB11C5.title: "I Want to Be Just Like You!"
	quest.2DE36B1C49C51C4B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fProtect yourself from harm by summoning armorsaurus scales around your body.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fArmorsaurus (tensura:armorsaurus); Crystal Glutton (magicule_glutton:crystal_glutton); Magicule Glutton (magicule_glutton:magicule_glutton); Metal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAbyssal Dragonewt (ascension:abyssal_dragonewt); Ascended Djinn (ascension:ascended_djinn); Axolotl Knight (trnightmare:axolotl_knight); Axolotl Steel Spirit (trnightmare:axolotl_steel_spirit); Axolotl Steel Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:axolotl_steel_dragon); Beholder (ascension:beholder)&r"
		"&fBlood Noble (ascension:blood_noble); Bog Ancient (ascension:bog_ancient); Chaos Dragon (ascension:chaos_dragon); Chaotic Deity (ascension:chaotic_deity); Cosmic Deity (ascension:cosmic_deity); Davy Jones (ascension:davy_jones)&r"
		"&fDeath Tyrant (ascension:death_tyrant); Divine Angel (ascension:divine_angel); Divine King (ascension:divine_king); Divine Saiyan (elitetensura:divine_saiyan); Elder Bloodfiend (ascension:elder_bloodfiend); Fallen Angel (ascension:fallen_angel)&r"
		"&fFrog Monarch (ascension:frog_monarch); Gauth (ascension:gauth); Giant Elder (trnightmare:giant_elder); High Class Saiyan (elitetensura:high_saiyan); Infinite Djinn (ascension:infinite_djinn); Medium Class Saiyan (elitetensura:medium_saiyan)&r"
		"&fMetal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Monkey King (ascension:monkey_king); Monkey Martial Artist (ascension:monkey_martial_artist); Omniversal Djinn (ascension:omniversal_djinn); Phantom Corsair (ascension:phantom_corsair); Phantom Djinn (ascension:phantom_djinn)&r"
		"&fPrimordial Djinn (ascension:primordial_djinn); Progenitor Bloodfiend (ascension:progenitor_bloodfiend); Royal Djinn (ascension:royal_djinn); Seraphim (ascension:seraphim); Sovereign Djinn (ascension:sovereign_djinn); Sun Wukong (ascension:sun_wukong)&r"
		"&fSwamp Sovereign (ascension:swamp_sovereign); Venom Lord (ascension:venom_lord); Void Dragonewt (ascension:void_dragonewt); Wishbound Djinn (ascension:wishbound_djinn)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Body Armor — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2DE36B1C49C51C4B.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.2DE36B1C49C51C4B.title: "Body Armor"
	quest.2E19D80970B45C72.quest_desc: [
		"&fElite Tensura adds a separate title progression system with 195 built-in titles in the installed JAR. Titles have their own requirements, rarity, chains, active slots, and attribute bonuses.&r"
		""
		"&fWork around this guide in either direction. These are instructions, not artificial progression locks; the Elite Tensura Codex and server-side title data decide what you have actually unlocked.&r"
	]
	quest.2E19D80970B45C72.quest_subtitle: "Unlock, equip, and troubleshoot titles"
	quest.2E19D80970B45C72.title: "Elite Tensura Title Guide"
	quest.2E2F8B561B9DDA63.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGather Purifying energy into an array, and unleash it upon an imprisoned foe.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Epic Tome.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Great Upgraded.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.2E2F8B561B9DDA63.quest_subtitle: "Other \\& Addon Magic • TR: Nightmare"
