	quest.2E732468BF2B39D8.title: "Holy"
	quest.2E7B7284FF579CD8.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fToggle: +10% magicule regen (+20% mastered). Auto-learned once Magicule Attunement is mastered.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Magicule Attunement (ascension:magicule_attunement), then use Ascension automatic mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension automatic mastery unlock: Master ascension:magicule_attunement. The server checks these unlocks during player ticks. Keep the skill enabled in server settings and allow the learning check to run; failed repeated attempts are throttled to once per 60 seconds.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Magicule Attunement (ascension:magicule_attunement) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master ascension:magicule_attunement.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Magicule Dominion (ascension:magicule_dominion) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master ascension:magicule_resonance.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Mysticism Restricted causes Energy Charge, Maximum Charge, Magicule Attunement, Magicule Resonance and Magicule Dominion to be removed.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Magicule Resonance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Magicule Attunement — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.2E7B7284FF579CD8.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • Ascension"
	quest.2E7B7284FF579CD8.title: "Magicule Resonance"
	quest.2E875E49E7344012.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f30,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Ice Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fLesser Glacier Wyrm&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fFrostcoil Sea Serpent&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fRimefang Drake&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 30,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 10 x Ice Essence (mysticism:ice_essence): Defeat Undine (guaranteed), or mine Mysticism Ice Ore for its configured ore drop. Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 30,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Greater Glacier Wyrm — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
