	quest.2E900D086CF4B18D.title: "Chaos Doll"
	quest.2EE59FC5072A218F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fToggle to assume your bonded True Dragon's body (4x EP). Costs 500 magicule per second while active. Requires a True Dragon ultimate. Incompatible with Dragon Mode.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Veldora, Lord of Storms ｣ (trnightmare:veldora_lord_of_storms), then use True Dragon Ultimate companion grant. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Velgrynd, Lord of Scorch ｣ (trnightmare:velgrynd_lord_of_scorch), then use True Dragon Ultimate companion grant. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with ｢ Velzard, Lord of Frost ｣ (trnightmare:velzard_lord_of_frost), then use True Dragon Ultimate companion grant. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with ｢ Velgaia, Lord of Earth-Star ｣ (trnightmare:velgaia_lord_of_earth), then use True Dragon Ultimate companion grant. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. True Dragon Ultimate companion grant: Use the inner-world True Dragon teaching route to obtain any one of the four True Dragon Ultimates. On the successful 5% Ultimate teaching roll, the same teaching mechanic also grants Pseudo Dragon Body if it is missing.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Veldora, Lord of Storms ｣ (trnightmare:veldora_lord_of_storms) through True Dragon Ultimate companion grant.&r &7Requirements: successfully learn any True Dragon Ultimate through inner-world teaching.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Velgrynd, Lord of Scorch ｣ (trnightmare:velgrynd_lord_of_scorch) through True Dragon Ultimate companion grant.&r &7Requirements: successfully learn any True Dragon Ultimate through inner-world teaching.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Velzard, Lord of Frost ｣ (trnightmare:velzard_lord_of_frost) through True Dragon Ultimate companion grant.&r &7Requirements: successfully learn any True Dragon Ultimate through inner-world teaching.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Velgaia, Lord of Earth-Star ｣ (trnightmare:velgaia_lord_of_earth) through True Dragon Ultimate companion grant.&r &7Requirements: successfully learn any True Dragon Ultimate through inner-world teaching.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8It is granted only by the teaching hook, not merely by acquiring the Ultimate through another source.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Pseudo Dragon Body — completes when you learn it&r"
