		"&f2. Obtain 3 x Flame Essence (mysticism:flame_essence): Defeat Ifrit (guaranteed) or a vanilla Blaze (1%). Then eat/use all 3; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
