	quest.2FA2CCF27E595CCB.quest_desc: [
		"&fFor TR: Nightmare's nonlethal solo-naming route, win 25 ordinary Minecraft village raids. A raid only counts when Minecraft awards the victory; TenSura raids are a different system.&r"
		""
		"&fThe counter is lifetime progress and survives death. Once it reaches 25, defeat any creature or gain permanent EP to make the self-naming check run. You must also be nameable, unnamed, and without a permanent owner.&r"
	]
	quest.2FA2CCF27E595CCB.title: "Solo Naming: Win 25 Village Raids"
	quest.2FB522773633EC99.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCreate any Unique Skill and use it for a limited amount of time.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare boss-drop route:&f personally defeat the Sentient Boss Yuuki Desire. The skill is rolled from that boss's configured reward list; its chance is half of TenSura's configured Otherworlder skill-drop percentage, so the kill is not guaranteed to award it.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fYuuki Kagurazaka (tensura_guild:yuuki_kagurazaka)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astral Light, Lord of Creation ｣ (trnightmare:astral_light) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Hephaestus, Lord of Creation (elitetensura:hephaestus) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Creator — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
