	quest.309C2D461ABDEFC6.title: "Sorcerer"
	quest.30A134FDD1FCA353.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCharge up power scales, then lunge through your target with a piercing strike.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.30A134FDD1FCA353.quest_subtitle: "Advanced \\& Addon Battlewill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.30A134FDD1FCA353.title: "Spiral Penetrator"
	quest.30A98AA0B3A9B14A.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis chapter covers all &e124&f player-facing Extra skills in the pack.&r"
		"&fEach page explains what the skill does, how to learn it, which mobs use it, which races grant it, and where it can evolve.&r"
		"&7Use the checkmark to mark a page as read. Automatic tasks only report progress; they never grant a skill.&r"
		"&7Learn and mastery tasks check your current character. Statistics may include older progress, but FTB kill tasks start counting only after the quest begins tracking them.&r"
	]
	quest.30A98AA0B3A9B14A.quest_subtitle: "Review the Extra skill catalog"
	quest.30A98AA0B3A9B14A.title: "Extra Skills"
	quest.30AB23F4977C3964.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Legioner 1 time after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+25 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.30AB23F4977C3964.title: "Legioner: First Kill"
	quest.30CCD2CC0993A19E.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis chapter contains all &e6&f abilities players can obtain in this category.&r"
		"&fMagic is grouped as Aspectual, Spiritual, Summoning, or Miscellaneous. Battlewill is grouped by use: Melee, Projectile, Utility, or Advanced/Addon.&r"
		"&fEach page explains what the ability does, how to learn it, which mobs use it, and whether it upgrades.&r"
		"&eTomes:&r &fA bound Magic Tome teaches the named magic after it is held for at least 10 ticks. Rank-A Guild tomes rotate every 7 Minecraft days by default. An Unbound Tome at a Spellbinding Table only copies Magic you already know and have mastered; it is not an initial unlock.&r"
		"&eBattlewill Manuals:&r &fA bound manual teaches its named art. An unbound manual rolls the 26-art list. Manuals are consumed on a valid use attempt even if the ability cannot be learned.&r"
		"&7The Learn task updates when you gain the ability. The book cannot predict random tome or manual rolls, spirit-contract chances, shop rotations, or uninterrupted training.&r"
	]
	quest.30CCD2CC0993A19E.quest_subtitle: "6 obtainable abilities"
	quest.30CCD2CC0993A19E.title: "Summoning Magic"
	quest.30CDA1719A47B98D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA Unique Skill that abuses loopholes in the world's rules.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Exploiter — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.30CDA1719A47B98D.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Tensura More Skills"
	quest.30CDA1719A47B98D.title: "Exploiter"
