		"Defeat Phantom 100 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+1,000 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.30CE754249E2C0E3.title: "Phantom: 100 Kills"
	quest.30CF6CE972D6B2AC.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f10,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eBoss kills: &f4 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f50× Elemental Essence, 50× Daemon Essence, 50× Dragon Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fInfinite Djinn&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 10,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Defeat 4 TenSura bosses. This evolution uses TenSura's lifetime boss-defeat count.&r"
		"&f3. Obtain 50 x Elemental Essence (tensura:elemental_essence): Defeat Akash, Ifrit, Sylphide, Undine, or War Gnome (guaranteed). Several lesser elemental mobs and qualifying summoned Elemental Colossi have a 10% source. Then eat/use all 50; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f4. Obtain 50 x Daemon Essence (tensura:daemon_essence): Defeat Arch Daemons (50%), Greater Daemons (10%), or Lesser Daemons (1%). It also appears in Hell Ruins chests and Hell Ruins archaeology. Then eat/use all 50; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f5. Obtain 50 x Dragon Essence (tensura:dragon_essence): Defeat Charybdis (1-3 guaranteed), a Basilisk (1%), or a Dragonewt-type Lizardman (25%). Lizardman throne/storage loot and Elite crates are additional sources. Then eat/use all 50; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f6. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Bosses defeated: 4 — exact lifetime custom-stat counter; may predate this quest&r"
		"&f• Current race: Omniversal Djinn — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.30CF6CE972D6B2AC.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • Ascension"
	quest.30CF6CE972D6B2AC.title: "Omniversal Djinn"
