	quest.3128788378768691.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f160,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &fDaemon Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fLesser Dragon&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fMedium Daemonic Dragon&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 160,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 1 x Daemon Essence (tensura:daemon_essence): Defeat Arch Daemons (50%), Greater Daemons (10%), or Lesser Daemons (1%). It also appears in Hell Ruins chests and Hell Ruins archaeology. Then eat/use all 1; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 160,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Lesser Daemonic Dragon — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.3128788378768691.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.3128788378768691.title: "Lesser Daemonic Dragon"
	quest.313661DAB5C7602A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate flame charity — Spacetime Manipulation, stronger Amplification, Encore, Stockpile, Parallel Existence, Cardinal Acceleration, Multidimensional Barrier, and Scorch Excitation.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master trnightmare:raguel. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ (trnightmare:raguel), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ (trnightmare:raguel) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ (trnightmare:raguel)&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 2,400,000&r"
		"&f• Raise custom statistic trnightmare:masayuuki_defeats to 1&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ (trnightmare:raguel).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 2,400,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Cthugha, King of Divine Flame ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 2,400,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• trnightmare:masayuuki_defeats: 1 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.313661DAB5C7602A.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.313661DAB5C7602A.title: "｢ Cthugha, King of Divine Flame ｣"
