	quest.3163A89476653CA9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Gravity abilities by a large amount and allows you to fly without hindrance.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above dominationEpAcquirement (server-config value); then master tensura:gravity_manipulation. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Gravity Manipulation (tensura:gravity_manipulation), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Gravity Manipulation (tensura:gravity_manipulation), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gravity Manipulation (tensura:gravity_manipulation) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:gravity_manipulation; possess tensura:gravity_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Gravity Manipulation (tensura:gravity_manipulation) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:gravity_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:gravity_domination.&r"
		""
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fEnder Guardian (cataclysm:ender_guardian)&r"
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Gravity Domination — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3163A89476653CA9.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.3163A89476653CA9.title: "Gravity Domination"
