	quest.3185B32A5C96AC86.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fPlace down differently sized barriers which block enemies in or out. Strong attacks can still destroy them.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 80,000; then defeat tensura:ifrit. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fIfrit (tensura:ifrit); Shizu (tensura:shizu)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fApostle (trnightmare:apostle); Apostle (trvirtuoso:apostle); Disciple (trnightmare:disciple); Disciple (trvirtuoso:disciple); Jedidiah (trnightmare:jedidiah); Jedidiah (trvirtuoso:jedidiah)&r"
		"&fSorcerer (trvirtuoso:sorcerer)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Multilayer Barrier (tensura:multilayer_barrier) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:ranged_barrier; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:multilayer_barrier.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Ranged Barrier — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3185B32A5C96AC86.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.3185B32A5C96AC86.title: "Ranged Barrier"
