	quest.3195A24ADD31611D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weaker darkness damage or reduce the damage of stronger attacks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Abyss grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fCarrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Cultist (irons_spellbooks:cultist); Gazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Memoires (mysticism:memoires); Necromancer (irons_spellbooks:necromancer); Adherent (twilightforest:adherent); Knight Phantom (twilightforest:knight_phantom); Lich (twilightforest:lich); Maledictus (cataclysm:maledictus); Soul Knight Wither Skeleton (block_factorys_bosses:soul_knight_wither_skeleton); The Harbinger (cataclysm:the_harbinger); The Prowler (cataclysm:the_prowler)&r"
		"&fThe Dead King (irons_spellbooks:dead_king); Vaelthorn, the Hollow Sovereign (elitetensura:lich_boss)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDark Fairy (trnightmare:dark_fairy); Demon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); Fallen (mysticism:fallen); Fallen Lord (mysticism:fallen_lord); God Slime (tensura:god_slime); Lower-Class Demon (trnightmare:lower_class_demon)&r"
		"&fMetal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Mutant Giant (trnightmare:mutant_giant); Salamander Poison Spirit (trnightmare:salamander_poison_spirit); Salamander Poison Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:salamander_poison_dragon)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Darkness Attack Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
