	quest.31BB65D153488EBA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§5Asmodeus, Lord Of Lust §3is a powerful Ultimate Skill capable of bending the rules of §fLife §3and §0Death&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:lust. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Lust (tensura:lust), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Lust (tensura:lust) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Lust Manas (trnightmare:lust_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Lust (tensura:lust)&r"
		"&f• Name 25 subordinates&r"
		"&f• Breed animals 100 times&r"
		"&f• Master Lust (tensura:lust).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,200,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Asmodeus, Lord of Lust ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Lust — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Animals bred: 100 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,200,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.31BB65D153488EBA.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.31BB65D153488EBA.title: "｢ Asmodeus, Lord of Lust ｣"
	quest.31C4D83856D17AD0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f500,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eMust be named"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fCorrupted Dragon&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDemonic Dragon&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 500,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Have another eligible player name you through TenSura's Naming interaction/key menu. An anvil-renamed name tag does not satisfy the stored existence-name check.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 500,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Cursed Dragon — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.31C4D83856D17AD0.quest_subtitle: "Special / Non-standard Race • Ascension"
