	quest.31D57F3C4BF3ACFE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe golem’s outer layer is composed of hyper-compressed, high-purity crystals. This shell acts as a multi-layered filter that can bend, split, and neutralize magical energy upon contact.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDiamond Sovereign (traddon:diamond_sovereign); Geode Golem (traddon:geode_golem); Prism Knight (traddon:prism_knight)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Refractive Shell — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
