	quest.31F0A93309E83730.title: "Origin Arch Angel"
	quest.31FC845757E479C3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fWhen you control the chances of anything happening, nothing goes without your say, but no one can predict what that say is.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess trnightmare:faust. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Faust, Lord of Investigation ｣ (trnightmare:faust), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Faust, Lord of Investigation ｣ (trnightmare:faust) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Faust, Lord of Investigation ｣ (trnightmare:faust)&r"
		"&f• Have at least 30,000,000 EP&r"
		"&f• Master Spatial Domination (tensura:spatial_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Lightning Domination (tensura:lightning_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Wind Domination (tensura:wind_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Water Domination (tensura:water_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Multilayer Barrier (tensura:multilayer_barrier)&r"
		"&f• Master Body Double (tensura:body_double)&r"
		"&f• Use ｢ Faust, Lord of Investigation ｣ (trnightmare:faust)'s `fullyInvestigated` mechanic until its internal counter reaches Math.max(0, nyarla.nyarlaFulls - 1)&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Faust, Lord of Investigation ｣ (trnightmare:faust).&r"
		"&f• Master Investigator (trnightmare:investigator).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,550,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Nyarlathotep, King of Chaos ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Faust, Lord of Investigation ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 30,000,000 — exact maximum EP value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Master: Spatial Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Lightning Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Wind Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Water Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Multilayer Barrier — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Body Double — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Investigator — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,550,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.31FC845757E479C3.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.31FC845757E479C3.title: "｢ Nyarlathotep, King of Chaos ｣"
	quest.31FDAFDFF9151FFB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fEmbody malice and fight on the side of evil. Gain increased power from killing your foes, manipulate your enemies into joining your side and empower your allies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Tantalous, King of Evil ｣ (trnightmare:tantalus) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Villain — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
