	quest.32CAA0FBFF997454.title: "Guardian: 100 Kills"
	quest.32D3B80FC42692FC.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7Toggle on to convert MP into instant HP and SHP recovery. HP is handled before instant regeneration effects; SHP yields to them.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Learn Lucifer and keep it active long enough for its server tick to run. Lucifer automatically grants Godspeed Regeneration when it is missing.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Godspeed Regeneration — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8The tracker verifies the resulting skill; addon-specific counters and random rolls are not exposed to FTB Quests.&r"
	]
	quest.32D3B80FC42692FC.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.32D3B80FC42692FC.title: "Godspeed Regeneration"
	quest.32E49CC10641D7FE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn Ultimate Skill born from Granter through heroic authority. It blesses subordinates with guidance, protection, and shared growth.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Granter (moostensuraaddon:granter), then use Moo's Tensura Addon — Granter evolution (True Hero path). Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Moo's Tensura Addon — Granter evolution (True Hero path): Master Granter, become a True Hero, remain named, and reach at least 1,000,000 current EP plus 500,000 current Magicules. Have 10 mastered learned skills excluding Granter, complete 10 successful Granter grants, and gather or previously register 10 subordinates within the addon's recognition system. Wait for the automatic 100-tick check. The addon consumes 500,000 Magicules, removes Granter, learns Benevolent Empowerment, and awards moostensuraaddon:path_of_benevolence.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Granter (moostensuraaddon:granter) through Moo's Tensura Addon — Granter evolution (True Hero path).&r &7Requirements: Master Granter; be named; True Hero; 1,000,000 current EP; 500,000 current Magicules (consumed); 10 other mastered Skills; 10 successful Granter grants; 10 nearby or recognized subordinates.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Successful Granter grants, naming, and nearby/recognized-subordinate counts have no installed FTB task. The total mastered statistic is approximate because the code counts current skills excluding Granter.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Benevolent Empowerment — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Granter — exact prerequisite before Granter is replaced&r"
		"&f• True Hero — exact current awakening path&r"
		"&f• Current EP: 1,000,000 — exact current EP gate&r"
		"&f• Current Magicules: 500,000 — exact current Magicules gate; success consumes this amount&r"
		"&f• Skills mastered (lifetime counter): 10 — approximate lifetime aid; the addon requires 10 current mastered skills excluding Granter&r"
		"&f• Advancement completed: moostensuraaddon:granter_mastered — exact Moo prerequisite milestone&r"
		"&f• Advancement completed: moostensuraaddon:path_of_benevolence — exact successful Granter-evolution outcome&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
