	quest.3310D421BD540BE2.quest_desc: [
		"&fUse the Sunken City expedition to reach and defeat Cataclysm's Leviathan. Water breathing, underwater movement, and a prepared retreat matter as much as raw damage.&r"
		""
		"&fDefeating the Leviathan earns the guide's large finale reward. The fight stays available from the beginning, like every other suggested arena.&r"
