	quest.3345B37413CCCDED.title: "Morel Cow: 5 Kills"
	quest.33504D2276F1A95A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weaker thermal damage regardless of its type or resist stronger attacks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fElemental Colossus (tensura:elemental_colossus)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fSalamander Fire Spirit (trnightmare:salamander_fire_spirit); Salamander Fire Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:salamander_fire_dragon); Salamander Warlock (trnightmare:salamander_warlock)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Thermal Fluctuation Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.33504D2276F1A95A.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.33504D2276F1A95A.title: "Thermal Fluctuation Resistance"
	quest.33565A35185A6710.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f2,100–3,500 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f100–500"
		"&eMagicules: &f2,000–3,000"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fPhysical Attack Resistance, Pain Nullification"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fHuman&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fSpirit Skeleton&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fWight King&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,100. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,100 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Wight — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
