	quest.336A6967761CA362.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7Sin Factor of greed — seat Lion's Heart in a vessel, freeze attacks with time-stopped steel, and turn every blow spatial.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §6Witch's Greed — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.336A6967761CA362.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.336A6967761CA362.title: "Witch's Greed"
	quest.338245BF4818CACE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weak cold damage or resist the damage of powerful attacks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Frost grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fCarrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Cryomancer (irons_spellbooks:cryomancer); Gazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Ice Spider (irons_spellbooks:ice_spider); Memoires (mysticism:memoires); Aptrgangr (cataclysm:aptrgangr); Lich (twilightforest:lich); The Leviathan (cataclysm:the_leviathan); Winter Wolf (twilightforest:winter_wolf)&r"
		"&fSnow Golem (minecraft:snow_golem)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDemon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); Frostcoil Sea Serpent (mysticism:frostcoil_sea_serpent); Frostwrought Leviathan (mysticism:frostwrought_leviathan); God Slime (tensura:god_slime); Greater Glacier Wyrm (mysticism:greater_glacier_wyrm); Lesser Glacier Wyrm (mysticism:lesser_glacier_wyrm)&r"
		"&fMetal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Rimeblight Hydra (mysticism:rimeblight_hydra); Rimefang Drake (mysticism:rimefang_drake)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Cold Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
