	quest.3472FBF1E42CD3ED.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fQuickly blink forward in space to a location within view.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Medium-or-higher Space spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Space Spiritual Magic through Medium, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Space. Minimum contract level: Medium. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fAkash (tensura:akash)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.3472FBF1E42CD3ED.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.3472FBF1E42CD3ED.title: "Teleport"
	quest.3475DDDF377EE5B4.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGather your aura into a powerful blast.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Trade with a Battlewill Trainer dwarf at level 4. Its bound-manual trade tag explicitly includes this art; buy the named/glinting manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fLaplace (tensura_guild:laplace); Primordial Bleu (trnightmare:sentient_boss_bleu); Primordial Jaune (trnightmare:sentient_boss_jaune); Sentient Boss Glenda (trnightmare:sentient_boss_glenda)&r"
		"&fVelzard Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_velzard)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fUnlocks Maximum Magic Bullet (tensura:maximum_magic_bullet): Master Magic Bullet.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.3475DDDF377EE5B4.quest_subtitle: "Projectile Battlewill Arts • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.3475DDDF377EE5B4.title: "Magic Bullet"
	quest.3487199DACBB1E47.quest_desc: [
