	quest.34FA4031DF13F505.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCommand your absolute authority over Deceleration, allowing you to freeze all enemies with ice and spew superchilled ice. Additionally, freeze the surroundings into ice&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Frost grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fFrostcoil Sea Serpent (mysticism:frostcoil_sea_serpent); Frostwrought Leviathan (mysticism:frostwrought_leviathan); Glacier Spirit Wolf (mysticism:glacier_spirit_wolf); Greater Glacier Wyrm (mysticism:greater_glacier_wyrm); Nivalis Frost Wolf (mysticism:nivalis_frost_wolf); Rimeblight Hydra (mysticism:rimeblight_hydra)&r"
		"&fRimefang Drake (mysticism:rimefang_drake)&r"
		""
