	quest.350F62610319387A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fFires a concentrated blade to cut your enemies with the power of water.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Medium-or-higher Water spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Water Spiritual Magic through Medium, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Water. Minimum contract level: Medium. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fUndine (tensura:undine)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
