	quest.350F62610319387A.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.350F62610319387A.title: "Water Cutter"
	quest.35103A790E3D9F0B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&7The mod does not provide an effect description for this ability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:villain. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Villain (tensura:villain), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Villain (tensura:villain) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Villain (tensura:villain)&r"
		"&f• Have at least 2,000,000 current EP&r"
		"&f• Kill 2,500 human-type entities&r"
		"&f• Raise the internal `trnightmare_tantalus_no_remorse` counter to 1&r"
		"&f• Raise the internal `trnightmare_tantalus_no_love` counter to 1&r"
		"&f• Raise the internal `trnightmare_tantalus_no_shame` counter to 1&r"
		"&f• Master Villain (tensura:villain).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 600,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Tantalous, King of Evil ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Villain — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Current EP: 2,000,000 — exact current EP value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Human-type kills: 2,500 — exact TenSura human-kill counter used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 600,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.35103A790E3D9F0B.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.35103A790E3D9F0B.title: "｢ Tantalous, King of Evil ｣"
	quest.3511BEDD9EAD42A7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate awakening of Dragon Slayer. Toggle on for: peace with all dragons; ice/fire/thunder breath bypass resistances; +30 Max HP per dragon essence or Ice\\\\& Fire flesh eaten (no cap, removed on death); each dragon kill permanently grants +50,000 Max EP and +1 armor. Modes: Dragon Infusion (consume held Dragon Heart for +40k/+50k EP), Draconic Rage (5 min of Strength XX + Strengthen V + Resistance III), Dragon King Roar (held — fires Ice + Flame + Thunder breaths simultaneously).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Dragon Slayer (ascension:dragon_slayer), then use Ascension Awakening Altar. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension Awakening Altar: Reach at least 5,000,000 maximum EP and become a True Demon Lord or True Hero. Master the listed Unique skill. Carry 30 items in the Ascension dragon-essences tag; 30 are consumed when the ritual prepares. Build an Awakening Altar with its floor one block below the altar. In a 9×9 area centered on the altar, include floor positions where dx²+dz² is at most 17. Use Deepslate Bricks for interior positions; use non-top Deepslate Brick Slabs wherever a north/east/south/west neighboring position is outside that shape. At offsets (-2,-2), (-2,+2), (+2,-2), (+2,+2), build pillars starting at altar height: Deepslate Bricks, Ascension Deepslate Magic Block, Deepslate Bricks, then TenSura Pure Magisteel Block. Drop one Ultimate Catalyst directly above the altar so it absorbs it, then interact with the altar using an empty hand. Stay alive, in the same dimension, and within 8 horizontal blocks for the 10-second ritual. If several eligible mastered Unique skills meet their gates, the ritual chooses one randomly. Success replaces that Unique with its Ultimate and starts a 120-minute per-player cooldown by default.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Dragon Slayer (ascension:dragon_slayer) through Ascension Awakening Altar.&r &7Requirements: Carry 30 items in the Ascension dragon-essences tag; 30 are consumed when the ritual prepares; mastered Dragon Slayer; max EP at least 5M; True Demon Lord or True Hero; doAscensionUltimate gamerule enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Pillar arrangement, internal eaten/damage counters, charged-stone NBT and per-player cooldown are not measurable by a simple item/kill task. Consumed special items are taken during preparation; ritual cancellation does not prove they are refunded.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: The Slayer of Dragons — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 5,000,000 — exact maximum EP gate used by the altar&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero state&r"
		"&f• Master: Dragon Slayer — completes when mastered&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
