	quest.361D01FA9772F8E2.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSupreme discernment, sky gate, and the mystic code's authority.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master trnightmare:gilgamesh_lord_of_treasures. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Gilgamesh, God of Myth ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_god_of_myth) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Gilgamesh, Lord of Treasure ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_lord_of_treasures)&r"
		"&f• Have at least 12,000,000 EP&r"
		"&f• Reach Light Spirit level 4&r"
		"&f• Carry 4 x tensura:orichalcum_block (the condition does not consume it when its final flag is false)&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 x tensura:hihiirokane_helmet (the condition does not consume it when its final flag is false)&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 x tensura:hihiirokane_chestplate (the condition does not consume it when its final flag is false)&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 x tensura:hihiirokane_leggings (the condition does not consume it when its final flag is false)&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 x tensura:hihiirokane_boots (the condition does not consume it when its final flag is false)&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 x tensura:tempest_scale_shield (the condition does not consume it when its final flag is false)&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 1,200,000&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Gilgamesh, Lord of Treasure ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_lord_of_treasures).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,200,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Gilgamesh, King of Uruk ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Gilgamesh, Lord of Treasure ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 12,000,000 — exact maximum EP value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Carry 4 × tensura:orichalcum_block — exact current inventory count; consumption/ritual success is not proven&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 × tensura:hihiirokane_helmet — exact current inventory count; consumption/ritual success is not proven&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 × tensura:hihiirokane_chestplate — exact current inventory count; consumption/ritual success is not proven&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 × tensura:hihiirokane_leggings — exact current inventory count; consumption/ritual success is not proven&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 × tensura:hihiirokane_boots — exact current inventory count; consumption/ritual success is not proven&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 × tensura:tempest_scale_shield — exact current inventory count; consumption/ritual success is not proven&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,200,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
