	quest.3728B2A53AD5097B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§oWhat fades does not vanish. What is gone still lingers. It listens to silence, and weaves truth from what remains.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master StarlightUniqueSkills.LIGHT_REMAINS.get(); then master StarlightUniqueSkills.ECHO_ENDURES.get(); then master StarlightUniqueSkills.LIFE_RETURNS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Vestiges of Eidolons — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3728B2A53AD5097B.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.3728B2A53AD5097B.title: "Vestiges of Eidolons"
	quest.372B674ABE7F21BD.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f2,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f35× Holy Essence, 55× Daemon Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fNameless Goddess&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 35 x Holy Essence (trnightmare:holy_essence): Complete Human Raids or Direwolf Raids (2-5 at 75% per reward roll), or defeat Sentient Masayuuki (2-10 at 50%). Then eat/use all 35; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Obtain 55 x Daemon Essence (tensura:daemon_essence): Defeat Arch Daemons (50%), Greater Daemons (10%), or Lesser Daemons (1%). It also appears in Hell Ruins chests and Hell Ruins archaeology. Then eat/use all 55; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f4. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Brother Of Chaos — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
