	quest.3808592E9547B912.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe serpent that devours its own tail. Feed on the fight, strike across seconds, shed what wounds you, rewind your missteps, complete death rather than avoid it, and devour what stands before you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Survivor (tensura:survivor), then use Elite Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Gourmet (tensura:gourmet), then use Elite Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Elite Ultimate acquisition: Learn and master every prerequisite: tensura:survivor, tensura:gourmet. Reach at least 10,000,000 EP and awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. Gain EP again so the normal skill-acquisition check runs. With the skill enabled, the addon grants the Ultimate automatically.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Survivor (tensura:survivor) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		"&f• Gourmet (tensura:gourmet) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Elite requirementsEnabled=false bypasses the mastery/EP/awakening gate.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Ouroboros, Lord of Eternity — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000,000 — exact default Elite EP gate&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero gate&r"
		"&f• Master: Survivor — exact current mastery required by Elite&r"
		"&f• Master: Gourmet — exact current mastery required by Elite&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3808592E9547B912.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Elite Tensura"
	quest.3808592E9547B912.title: "Ouroboros, Lord of Eternity"
	quest.38341CC16B7A2F89.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&fThis race does not use the usual EP or item requirement list. Follow its route below."
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. No explicit prerequisite object is declared. Follow an incoming evolution route shown above, then select this form when TenSura offers it.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Current race: Vampiric Dragon — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
