	quest.3934C075BFBEF53A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fRestrict and weaken a single target, applying debuffs to allow you to finish them off.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Greater-or-higher Earth spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Earth Spiritual Magic through Greater, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Earth. Minimum contract level: Greater. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fHinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); War Gnome (tensura:war_gnome)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.3934C075BFBEF53A.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.3934C075BFBEF53A.title: "Earth Jail"
	quest.393553F258C27408.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA hundred spirits contained within your well of authority, all to die for you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess StarlightIntrinsicSkills.WARDED_SOUL.get(); then possess StarlightIntrinsicSkills.SOUL_PLUNDERER.get(); then possess StarlightIntrinsicSkills.MALIGNANT_BODY.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Spirit Sorcerer — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.393553F258C27408.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.393553F258C27408.title: "Spirit Sorcerer"
	quest.393A0653241B221E.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSummon an aura of sorrow that slows and weakens nearby enemies, filling them with despair. The skill also throws objects or air, amplifying the feeling of hopelessness around you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master tensura:thrower; then master tensura:molecular_manipulation. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Melancholy — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.393A0653241B221E.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
	quest.393A0653241B221E.title: "Melancholy"
	quest.39497747FE090C0B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTear space asunder granting yourself and your allies safe passage.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Not obtainable in normal play: there is no direct player-learning method in this pack version. If a compatible mob below uses it, Gluttony may still be able to copy it; otherwise it is mob-only or command-only.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fLuminous Valentine (tensura_neb:luminous_valentine); Mai Furuki (tensura:mai_furuki)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Spatial Manipulation (tensura:spatial_manipulation) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:spatial_motion; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:spatial_manipulation.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Spatial Motion — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.39497747FE090C0B.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.39497747FE090C0B.title: "Spatial Motion"
	quest.39557AE49402DEAE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTrue Dragon of Scorch. Scorch-type magic while in slot. Hold to summon Velgrynd's human form.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. TR: Nightmare inner-world True Dragon teaching: Progress the Velgrynd inner-world relationship until reputation is at least 500. Learn Velgrynd's intrinsic taught skill first. Continue selecting the teaching interaction in that dragon's inner-world dialogue. Each qualifying teaching interaction rolls a 5% default chance to grant the matching True Dragon Ultimate. Repeat until it succeeds; the same grant also teaches Pseudo Dragon Body if missing.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare friendship route:&f befriend the Sentient Boss Velgrynd, meet 500 Friendship, 300 Loyalty, and 850 Bond, then choose 'Analyze Velgrynd' in the friendship menu. Each eligible attempt rolls a 10%, increased to 40% at 1,000 Bond chance to teach this skill; repeat the interaction after failures.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Pseudo Dragon Body (trnightmare:pseudo_dragon_body) through True Dragon Ultimate companion grant.&r &7Requirements: successfully learn any True Dragon Ultimate through inner-world teaching.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Reputation and the random teaching roll are not exposed to FTB Quests. This is a repeatable chance, not a guaranteed interaction.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Velgrynd, Lord of Scorch ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.39557AE49402DEAE.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.39557AE49402DEAE.title: "｢ Velgrynd, Lord of Scorch ｣"
	quest.3959C0BBB0F47A87.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Polar Bear 100 times after this quest pack is installed."
