		"&aReward: &f+1,000 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.3959C0BBB0F47A87.title: "Polar Bear: 100 Kills"
	quest.39685752E1E44779.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eRequires awakening"
		"&eMust be named"
		"&eRequires a physical body"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fPrimordial Arch Daemon&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fPrimordial Devil Lord&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. The base requirement accepts either state; complete the matching TenSura awakening route first.&r"
		"&f2. Have another eligible player name you through TenSura's Naming interaction/key menu. An anvil-renamed name tag does not satisfy the stored existence-name check.&r"
		"&f3. Incarnate into a physical body first. The condition rejects TenSura spiritual-form state.&r"
		"&f4. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact TenSura awakening state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Primordial Daemon Lord — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.39685752E1E44779.quest_subtitle: "Special / Non-standard Race • TR Origins"
	quest.39685752E1E44779.title: "Primordial Daemon Lord"
	quest.39835AAC681AE86D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f400,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eBoss kills: &f4 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fBlue Centipede Insectar&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDivine Blue Centipede&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 400,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Defeat 4 TenSura bosses. This evolution uses TenSura's lifetime boss-defeat count.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 400,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Bosses defeated: 4 — exact lifetime custom-stat counter; may predate this quest&r"
		"&f• Current race: Blue Centipede Savant — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.39835AAC681AE86D.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Mysticism"
	quest.39835AAC681AE86D.title: "Blue Centipede Savant"
	quest.398C2456FBEEB02F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7These claws can §csever§7 anything  space, matter, or even concepts  leaving nothing behind.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare friendship route:&f befriend the Sentient Boss Veldora, meet 200 Friendship, 100 Loyalty, and 80 Bond, then choose 'Hang Out With' in the friendship menu. Each eligible attempt rolls a bond / 5,000, plus 15 percentage points at 1,000 Bond chance to teach this skill; repeat the interaction after failures.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §cDiv§6id§fe — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.398C2456FBEEB02F.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.398C2456FBEEB02F.title: "Divide"
	quest.39A5164DA633AD11.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Folgen 5 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+50 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.39A5164DA633AD11.title: "Folgen: 5 Kills"
	quest.39BB9FA2F8295DD0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&7The mod does not provide an effect description for this ability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Raphael, Lord of Knowledge ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_knowledge), then use TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_wisdom), then use TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming: Own one matching source Ultimate: trnightmare:raphael_knowledge, trnightmare:raphael_wisdom, and develop its matching Ego/personality. Raise that Ego above 225 social points, then use the Ego evolution screen to confirm each stage through stage 4. Each attempt has a 12-minute cooldown and a 30% failure chance by default; failure halves social points. When stage 4 reports that the Ego is ready, use the Ego naming command/menu and choose a name. The first naming pays the configured base naming cost; the mod creates the mapped Manas skill and transfers mastery.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raphael, Lord of Knowledge ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_knowledge) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_wisdom) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can verify the source and resulting skills but cannot read Ego personality, social points, stage, cooldown, failure roll, or naming cost.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §dWise Manas — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Raphael, Lord of Knowledge ｣ — alternative/matching source aid; Ego stage and personality remain manual&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ — alternative/matching source aid; Ego stage and personality remain manual&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.39BB9FA2F8295DD0.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.39BB9FA2F8295DD0.title: "Wise Manas"
