	quest.3A53B85868FB91D0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTear space asunder connecting two points in space.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Medium-or-higher Space spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Space Spiritual Magic through Medium, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Space. Minimum contract level: Medium. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.3A53B85868FB91D0.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.3A53B85868FB91D0.title: "Gate"
	quest.3A648A5400B09686.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fOnce a day, draw out your monstrous potential to double your EP and to boost your physical prowess. Doing this will leave a temporary toll on your body.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAbyssal Dragonewt (ascension:abyssal_dragonewt); Arch Daemonic Dragon (trnightmare:arch_daemonic_dragon); Arch Dragon (trnightmare:arch_dragon); Chaos Dragon (ascension:chaos_dragon); Corrupted Dragon (ascension:corrupted_dragon); Corrupted Dragonkin (ascension:corrupted_dragonkin)&r"
		"&fCursed Dragon (ascension:cursed_dragon); Daemonic Dragon Lord (trnightmare:daemonic_dragon_lord); Death Dragon (trnightmare:death_dragon); Demon Dragon God (ascension:demon_dragon_god); Demonic Dragon (ascension:demonic_dragon); Devil Dragon Lord (trnightmare:devil_dragon_lord)&r"
		"&fDivine Dragon (tensura:divine_dragon); Divine Dragon Lord (trnightmare:divine_dragon_lord); Divine Gehenna Dragon (trnightmare:divine_gehenna_dragon); Divine Heavenly Dragon (trnightmare:divine_heavenly_dragon); Divine Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:divine_netherite_dragon); Divine Void Dragon (trnightmare:divine_void_dragon)&r"
		"&fDragon Lord (trnightmare:dragon_lord); Dragonewt (tensura:dragonewt); Element Dragon (trnightmare:element_dragon); Ender Dragon Prince (trnightmare:ender_dragon_prince); Ender Dragonewt (ascension:ender_dragonewt); Frostwrought Leviathan (mysticism:frostwrought_leviathan)&r"
		"&fGehenna Dragon (trnightmare:gehenna_dragon); Heavenly Dragon (trnightmare:heavenly_dragon); Medium Daemonic Dragon (trnightmare:medium_daemonic_dragon); Medium Ender Dragon (trnightmare:medium_ender_dragon); Medium Holy Dragon (trnightmare:medium_holy_dragon); Medium Nether Dragon (trnightmare:medium_nether_dragon)&r"
		"&fNetherite Dragon (trnightmare:netherite_dragon); Rimeblight Hydra (mysticism:rimeblight_hydra); Saint Dragon (trnightmare:saint_dragon); Scorchtalon Wyvern (mysticism:scorchtalon_wyvern); Scrap Dragon (trnightmare:scrap_dragon); Sundeity Loong (mysticism:sundeity_loong)&r"
		"&fTrue Dragonewt (tensura:true_dragonewt); Void Dragon (trnightmare:void_dragon); Void Dragonewt (ascension:void_dragonewt)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Dragon Mode — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
