	quest.3A7D75F4E67428BF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYour powerful authority over the element of Earth as the True Earth Dragon.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. TR Origins True Dragon element grant: Follow the TR Origins race progression and become the Earth True Dragon. When the True Dragon storage registers that element, DragonElementUtils automatically learns Dragon Factor: Earth and applies the element's resistance/skill package.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8The skill is intrinsic to that selected True Dragon element and is tagged no-plundering.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Dragon Factor: Earth — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
