	quest.3C99812AA10A2389.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7True stillness made manifest. Toggle for §bIce Walk§7 (frost-walker freeze); §bFreeze All§7 halts motion in an area; §fIce Wall§7 raises an indestructible barrier — or a §fSnow Crystal§7 shell with §bGabriel§7 or §bCthulhu§7.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare friendship route:&f befriend the Sentient Boss Velzard, meet 200 Friendship, 100 Loyalty, and 80 Bond, then choose 'Hang Out With' in the friendship menu. Each eligible attempt rolls a bond / 5,000, plus 15 percentage points at 1,000 Bond chance to teach this skill; repeat the interaction after failures.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §fCessation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3C99812AA10A2389.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.3C99812AA10A2389.title: "Cessation"
	quest.3C9B53286EA22C80.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAccelerate thought processing to extreme levels, mastery over magics and manipulate the fundamental laws governing the world to optimize actions and outcomes.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Second-skill roll: this skill is also in the higher-priority second Unique Skill pool when that configured roll occurs.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with Sage (tensura:sage), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Sage (tensura:sage) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:sage; possess tensura:sage, tensura:chant_annulment, tensura:farsight, tensura:telepathy, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:magic_jamming, tensura:flame_domination, tensura:poison, tensura:analytical_apprasial; pay 1,050,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 3).&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Azazel, Lord of Temptation ｣ (trnightmare:azazel) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Seeker — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3C9B53286EA22C80.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.3C9B53286EA22C80.title: "Seeker"
