	quest.3CDCE2FE31E214F6.title: "Lanternfish: 50 Kills"
	quest.3CE9AD05C360F316.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis chapter contains all &e7&f abilities players can obtain in this category.&r"
		"&fMagic is grouped as Aspectual, Spiritual, Summoning, or Miscellaneous. Battlewill is grouped by use: Melee, Projectile, Utility, or Advanced/Addon.&r"
		"&fEach page explains what the ability does, how to learn it, which mobs use it, and whether it upgrades.&r"
		"&eTomes:&r &fA bound Magic Tome teaches the named magic after it is held for at least 10 ticks. Rank-A Guild tomes rotate every 7 Minecraft days by default. An Unbound Tome at a Spellbinding Table only copies Magic you already know and have mastered; it is not an initial unlock.&r"
		"&eBattlewill Manuals:&r &fA bound manual teaches its named art. An unbound manual rolls the 26-art list. Manuals are consumed on a valid use attempt even if the ability cannot be learned.&r"
		"&7The Learn task updates when you gain the ability. The book cannot predict random tome or manual rolls, spirit-contract chances, shop rotations, or uninterrupted training.&r"
	]
	quest.3CE9AD05C360F316.quest_subtitle: "7 obtainable abilities"
	quest.3CE9AD05C360F316.title: "Projectile Battlewill Arts"
	quest.3D018CA1A7DE5ABF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fInherit the genetics of a ferocious beast known for being in groups.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess StarlightUniqueSkills.LIGHT_REMAINS.get(); then possess StarlightUniqueSkills.VESTIGES_OF_EIDOLONS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Wilden Hunter Genetics — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3D018CA1A7DE5ABF.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.3D018CA1A7DE5ABF.title: "Wilden Hunter Genetics"
	quest.3D01F539AD0731F5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fMassively empower your body and infuse it with a flame aura. Allows you to go into a risky but overwhelmingly powerful berserker mode.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Strength (tensura:strength), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Strength (tensura:strength) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 5).&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Berserk — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3D01F539AD0731F5.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.3D01F539AD0731F5.title: "Berserk"
