		"Defeat Tremorsaurus 25 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+100 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.3D19807A7616B768.title: "Tremorsaurus: 25 Kills"
	quest.3D1D913825935DBD.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fEmpower your attacks with the effect of Paralysis, toggleable when mastered.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: kill 500 tensura:evil_centipede. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fHell Moth (tensura:hell_moth)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fBlue Centipede (mysticism:blue_centipede); Blue Centipede Insectar (mysticism:blue_centipede_insectar); Blue Centipede Savant (mysticism:blue_centipede_savant); Centipede (mysticism:centipede); Divine Blue Centipede (mysticism:divine_blue_centipede); Divine Purple Centipede (mysticism:divine_purple_centipede)&r"
		"&fDivine Vampire (tensura:divine_vampire); Divine Yellow Centipede (mysticism:divine_yellow_centipede); Ghoul (tensura:ghoul); Paralysis Soul Insect (mysticism:paralysis_soul_insect); Purple Centipede (mysticism:purple_centipede); Purple Centipede Insectar (mysticism:purple_centipede_insectar)&r"
		"&fPurple Centipede Savant (mysticism:purple_centipede_savant); Spatial Soul Insect (mysticism:spatial_soul_insect); Vampire (tensura:vampire); Vampire Lord (tensura:vampire_lord); Vampire Overcomer (tensura:vampire_overcomer); Water Soul Insect (mysticism:water_soul_insect)&r"
		"&fYellow Centipede (mysticism:yellow_centipede); Yellow Centipede Insectar (mysticism:yellow_centipede_insectar); Yellow Centipede Savant (mysticism:yellow_centipede_savant)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Paralysis — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3D1D913825935DBD.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.3D1D913825935DBD.title: "Paralysis"
	quest.3D3B4BB826426A23.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUse a tenth of your magical power to summon an identical clone which takes increased damage but will fight for you until the end. The user can exchange places with the clone but risk taking increased damage. &r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: reach at least 100,000 maximum EP, then either master tensura:doppelganger OR defeat tensura:ifrit. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fIfrit (tensura:ifrit); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
