	quest.3DD1D5E5A651A73D.title: "Degenerate"
	quest.3DD231EE294BC429.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§4Lucifer, Lord Of Pride §3is capable of perfectly anything, with the ability of any skill that the user is able to see and then analyze. This is known as §cPerfect Reproduction §3however further more, the §dUltimate Skill §4Lucifer, Lord Of Pride §3is capable of so much more...&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:pride. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Pride (tensura:pride), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Pride (tensura:pride) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Nodens, God of Abyss ｣ (trnightmare:nodens) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Pride Manas (trnightmare:pride_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Learn Pride (tensura:pride)&r"
		"&f• Master 100 total skills&r"
		"&f• Be at or below 0.4 of maximum HP when attempting evolution&r"
		"&f• Master Pride (tensura:pride).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,700,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Lucifer, Lord of Pride ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: Pride — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Skills mastered (lifetime counter): 100 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Master: Pride — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,700,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.3DD231EE294BC429.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.3DD231EE294BC429.title: "｢ Lucifer, Lord of Pride ｣"
