		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare boss-drop route:&f personally defeat the Sentient Boss Veldora. The skill is rolled from that boss's configured reward list; its chance is half of TenSura's configured Otherworlder skill-drop percentage, so the kill is not guaranteed to award it.&r"
