	quest.3FC300BCDF6B840C.title: "Wind Transform"
	quest.3FE7F6DC4802C40C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fActive: call down corrupted purple lightning. Darkness-flavoured damage that bypasses Darkness Attack Nullification. Radius and damage scale with mastery. Intrinsic to Demonic Dragon.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Become Ascension's Demonic Dragon or Demon Dragon God; Purple Lightning is in each race's intrinsic-skill list. It can also appear as a bound tome because it is in the installed FOUND_IN_TOME pool.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.3FE7F6DC4802C40C.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • Ascension"
	quest.3FE7F6DC4802C40C.title: "Purple Lightning"
	quest.3FFCF2DE393F81FB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f15,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 15,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 15,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Dragon Wolf — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
