	quest.404891ADDBB0D7C1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn intrinsic Giant Clan and Dragon Race skill that condenses the user's body to a smaller combat form.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fArch Daemonic Dragon (trnightmare:arch_daemonic_dragon); Arch Dragon (trnightmare:arch_dragon); Big Cutie (trnightmare:big_cutie); Daemonic Dragon Lord (trnightmare:daemonic_dragon_lord); Death Dragon (trnightmare:death_dragon); Devil Dragon Lord (trnightmare:devil_dragon_lord)&r"
		"&fDivine Dragon Lord (trnightmare:divine_dragon_lord); Divine Gehenna Dragon (trnightmare:divine_gehenna_dragon); Divine Heavenly Dragon (trnightmare:divine_heavenly_dragon); Divine Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:divine_netherite_dragon); Divine Void Dragon (trnightmare:divine_void_dragon); Dragon Lord (trnightmare:dragon_lord)&r"
		"&fEarthshaker Dancer (trnightmare:earthshaker_dancer); Element Dragon (trnightmare:element_dragon); Ender Dragon Prince (trnightmare:ender_dragon_prince); Fang of Earth (trnightmare:fang_of_earth); Gehenna Dragon (trnightmare:gehenna_dragon); Giant Dancer (trnightmare:giant_dancer)&r"
		"&fGiant Elder (trnightmare:giant_elder); Giant King (trnightmare:giant_king); Giant Queen (trnightmare:giant_queen); Giant Warrior (trnightmare:giant_warrior); God Of Earth (trnightmare:god_of_earth); Heavenly Dragon (trnightmare:heavenly_dragon)&r"
		"&fLesser Daemonic Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_daemonic_dragon); Lesser Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_dragon); Lesser Ender Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_ender_dragon); Lesser Giant (trnightmare:lesser_giant); Lesser Holy Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_holy_dragon); Lesser Nether Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_nether_dragon)&r"
		"&fLesser Zombie Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_zombie_dragon); Medium Daemonic Dragon (trnightmare:medium_daemonic_dragon); Medium Dragon (trnightmare:medium_dragon); Medium Ender Dragon (trnightmare:medium_ender_dragon); Medium Holy Dragon (trnightmare:medium_holy_dragon); Medium Nether Dragon (trnightmare:medium_nether_dragon)&r"
		"&fMedium Zombie Dragon (trnightmare:medium_zombie_dragon); Mutant Giant (trnightmare:mutant_giant); Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:netherite_dragon); One Eyed God (trnightmare:one_eyed_god); Saint Dragon (trnightmare:saint_dragon); Scrap Dragon (trnightmare:scrap_dragon)&r"
		"&fVoid Dragon (trnightmare:void_dragon)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Size Condense — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
