	quest.405570427AE03ABB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fRecover a living being's health and food points to the maximum as well as Absorption.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Rare Frozen.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Great Rare, High Rare.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fPrimordial Blanc (trnightmare:sentient_boss_blanc); Primordial Bleu (trnightmare:sentient_boss_bleu); Primordial Jaune (trnightmare:sentient_boss_jaune); Primordial Vert (trnightmare:sentient_boss_vert)&r"
		"&fPrimordial Violet (trnightmare:sentient_boss_violet); Sentient Boss Noir (trnightmare:sentient_boss_noir); Sentient Boss Primordial Daemon (trnightmare:sentient_boss_primordial_daemon)&r"
		"&fMay roll this ability when it spawns:&r"
		"&fSentient Boss Gii Crimson (trnightmare:sentient_boss_gii_crimson)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.405570427AE03ABB.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.405570427AE03ABB.title: "Full Recovery"
	quest.4087AFC43F74E053.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fFire a beam attack that pierces through enemies and deals devastating damage while paralyzing your enemies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Greater-or-higher Wind spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Wind Spiritual Magic through Greater, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Wind. Minimum contract level: Greater. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fSylphide (tensura:sylphide)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.4087AFC43F74E053.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.4087AFC43F74E053.title: "Electro Blast"
	quest.40B9EDCE621A7D72.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f400,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f15× Elemental Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fRoyal Djinn&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fPrimordial Djinn&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 400,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 15 x Elemental Essence (tensura:elemental_essence): Defeat Akash, Ifrit, Sylphide, Undine, or War Gnome (guaranteed). Several lesser elemental mobs and qualifying summoned Elemental Colossi have a 10% source. Then eat/use all 15; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 400,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Wishbound Djinn — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
