	quest.419F8E5B574760F1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCombine all magic, sound and heat sense to detect entities around.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Magic Sense (tensura:magic_sense), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fLaplace (tensura_guild:laplace); Luminous Valentine (tensura_neb:luminous_valentine); Yuuki Kagurazaka (tensura_guild:yuuki_kagurazaka)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAccursed Goddess (trnightmare:accursed_goddess); Daughter Of Light (trnightmare:daughter_of_light); Demon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); Divine Soldier (trnightmare:divine_soldier); Earthshaker Dancer (trnightmare:earthshaker_dancer); God Slime (tensura:god_slime)&r"
		"&fGoddess Princess (trnightmare:princess_of_goddess); High-Class Demon (trnightmare:high_class_demon); Higher Goddess (trnightmare:higher_class_goddess); Lance Corporal (trnightmare:lance_corporal); Mutant Giant (trnightmare:mutant_giant); Sacred Tree Child (trnightmare:sacred_tree_child)&r"
		"&fSlayer Fairy (trnightmare:slayer_fairy); True Dragon (trorigins:true_dragon)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Magic Sense (tensura:magic_sense) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:magic_sense; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:universal_perception.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Hastur, Lord of Starwind ｣ (trnightmare:hastur) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Universal Perception — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
