	quest.41C024FAE78E2549.title: "Ignited Berserker: 5 Kills"
	quest.41D2073C308DC8C0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weak earth-based damage or resist the damage from powerful attacks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Earth grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fBeast Gnome (tensura:beast_gnome); Carrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Gazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Memoires (mysticism:memoires)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDemon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); Earth Genasi (trarcane:earth_genasi); Earth Soul Insect (mysticism:earth_soul_insect); Fang of Earth (trnightmare:fang_of_earth); Giant Dancer (trnightmare:giant_dancer); Giant Warrior (trnightmare:giant_warrior)&r"
		"&fGod Slime (tensura:god_slime); Lesser Giant (trnightmare:lesser_giant); Metal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Mountain Spirit Wolf (mysticism:mountain_spirit_wolf)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Earth Attack Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.41D2073C308DC8C0.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.41D2073C308DC8C0.title: "Earth Attack Resistance"
	quest.41D33C11EC2E518E.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSummon your contracted elemental spirit to temporarily fight for you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Contract or successfully tame a Medium-or-higher COMMON elemental spirit. The SPIRIT_UPDATE hook directly teaches Summon Medium Elemental at spirit level 2 or above.&r"
