	quest.42A760A6ED99B326.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBypass many restrictions by manipulating the law of the world.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 800,000; then master tensura:mana_manipulation; then master magic spells until the relevant counter reaches 30. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Uriel, Lord of Oaths ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_oath) through TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis.&r &7Requirements: master four component skills; 375,000 Magicules; valid non-imprinted component instances.&r"
		""
