		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Rare Ruined.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Great Upgraded, High Upgraded.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fLesser Angel (trnightmare:lesser_angel); Lesser Fallen (trnightmare:lesser_fallen); Lesser Phantom (trnightmare:lesser_phantom); Veldora Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_veldora)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.42AFE516079EEF5A.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.42AFE516079EEF5A.title: "Thunder Rain"
	quest.42B2ABEB3E443EF3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSummon your contracted greater elemental spirit to have it purge the world of heretics for you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Contract or successfully tame a Greater-or-higher COMMON elemental spirit. The SPIRIT_UPDATE hook directly teaches Summon Greater Elemental at spirit level 3 or above.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fGazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.42B2ABEB3E443EF3.quest_subtitle: "Summoning Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.42B2ABEB3E443EF3.title: "Summon Greater Elemental"
	quest.42B95B5F29BFEEB1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fPropel yourself at high speeds underwater.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Water Current Control (tensura:water_current_control), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fDolphin (minecraft:dolphin)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDivine Fish (tensura:divine_fish); Enlightened Merfolk (tensura:enlightened_merfolk); Frostcoil Sea Serpent (mysticism:frostcoil_sea_serpent); Frostwrought Leviathan (mysticism:frostwrought_leviathan); Merfolk (tensura:merfolk); Merfolk Saint (tensura:merfolk_saint)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Water Current Control (tensura:water_current_control) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:water_current_control; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:hydraulic_propulsion.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Hydraulic Propulsion — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.42B95B5F29BFEEB1.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.42B95B5F29BFEEB1.title: "Hydraulic Propulsion"
	quest.42BBC20C2F23EFA1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f2,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fDragon Lord&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDivine Gehenna Dragon&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Divine Dragon Lord — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
