	quest.42E66DBFCCA5B4AB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fActive: open a Hell Portal in front of you. Costs 10%% current MP. CD 30s (10s mastered). Auto-learned once Gate is mastered and 30 Daemon Essences are consumed from your inventory.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gate (tensura:gate), then use Ascension automatic mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Demon Lord Haki (tensura:demon_lord_haki), then use Ascension automatic mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Ascension automatic mastery unlock: Obtain Gate (tensura:gate), a Medium Space Spiritual Magic, by successfully contracting/taming a Medium-or-higher Space Spirit. Praying on a Praying Path performs the spirit-contract roll; a successful qualifying Space contract grants every Space Spiritual Magic up to that spirit level, including Gate. Then master Gate. Also master tensura:demon_lord_haki. The server checks these unlocks during player ticks. Keep the skill enabled in server settings and allow the learning check to run; failed repeated attempts are throttled to once per 60 seconds.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gate (tensura:gate) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Obtain Gate (tensura:gate), a Medium Space Spiritual Magic, by successfully contracting/taming a Medium-or-higher Space Spirit. Praying on a Praying Path performs the spirit-contract roll; a successful qualifying Space contract grants every Space Spiritual Magic up to that spirit level, including Gate. Then master Gate. Also master tensura:demon_lord_haki.&r"
		"&f• Demon Lord Haki (tensura:demon_lord_haki) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Obtain Gate (tensura:gate), a Medium Space Spiritual Magic, by successfully contracting/taming a Medium-or-higher Space Spirit. Praying on a Praying Path performs the spirit-contract roll; a successful qualifying Space contract grants every Space Spiritual Magic up to that spirit level, including Gate. Then master Gate. Also master tensura:demon_lord_haki.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Hell Passage — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: Gate — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Demon Lord Haki — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.42E66DBFCCA5B4AB.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • Ascension"
	quest.42E66DBFCCA5B4AB.title: "Hell Passage"
