		"&f2. Master Water Domination (tensura:water_domination). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Obtain 60 x Cod (minecraft:cod): Catch cod while fishing, defeat Cod, or defeat TenSura Lizardmen, whose loot table in this pack includes cod. Then eat/use all 60; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
