	quest.43CE6DEDE20B9F85.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.43CE6DEDE20B9F85.title: "Divine Boar"
	quest.43D5FC89764A672D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCall forth fiery surges of flame to incinerate targets.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Uncommon Burnt.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Great Basic, High Basic.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fDragon Clone Velgrynd (trnightmare:dragon_clone_velgrynd); Echo of Tyros, First Flamebearer (irons_spellbooks:fire_boss); Primordial Blanc (trnightmare:sentient_boss_blanc); Primordial Bleu (trnightmare:sentient_boss_bleu)&r"
		"&fPrimordial Jaune (trnightmare:sentient_boss_jaune); Primordial Vert (trnightmare:sentient_boss_vert); Primordial Violet (trnightmare:sentient_boss_violet); Pyromancer (irons_spellbooks:pyromancer)&r"
		"&fSentient Boss Ancient Daemon (trnightmare:sentient_boss_ancient_daemon); Sentient Boss Noir (trnightmare:sentient_boss_noir); Sentient Boss Primordial Daemon (trnightmare:sentient_boss_primordial_daemon); Velgrynd Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_velgrynd)&r"
		"&fMay roll this ability when it spawns:&r"
		"&fSentient Boss Gii Crimson (trnightmare:sentient_boss_gii_crimson)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.43D5FC89764A672D.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.43D5FC89764A672D.title: "Fire Storm"
	quest.43E15923B273BD0D.quest_desc: [
		"&fNothing in this chapter is locked. The tiers are a suggested climb from useful landmarks and early encounters to the pack's most dangerous arenas.&r"
		""
		"&fSet a safe return point, clear the approach, and learn the room before committing to the fight. Boss Hunting holds the repeat-kill rewards.&r"
	]
	quest.43E15923B273BD0D.title: "Pick an Arena, Then Prepare"
	quest.43E2F3E017909123.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUnleash absolute chaos through controlled destruction. Manipulate your output, ignite your reactor, and push Rampage beyond its limits.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:wrath. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Wrath (tensura:wrath), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Wrath (tensura:wrath) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Wrath Manas (trnightmare:wrath_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Wrath (tensura:wrath)&r"
		"&f• Win 20 village raids&r"
		"&f• Be at or below 0.4 of maximum HP when attempting evolution&r"
		"&f• Kill 500 mobs&r"
		"&f• Master Wrath (tensura:wrath).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,500,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Satanael, Lord of Wrath ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Wrath — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Village raids won: 20 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Mobs killed: 500 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,500,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.43E2F3E017909123.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.43E2F3E017909123.title: "｢ Satanael, Lord of Wrath ｣"
	quest.43E90C9CB9458DBB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn ultimate skill granting absolute dominion over existence, space, and life-force. Those who wield it become sovereign over the void itself.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Void Edge (elitetensura:voidedge), then use Elite Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Elite Ultimate acquisition: Learn and master every prerequisite: elitetensura:voidedge. Reach at least 10,000,000 EP and awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. Gain EP again so the normal skill-acquisition check runs. With the skill enabled, the addon grants the Ultimate automatically. Void Edge is replaced when Void Sovereign is learned.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Void Edge (elitetensura:voidedge) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Elite requirementsEnabled=false bypasses the mastery/EP/awakening gate. Void Edge is replaced when Void Sovereign is learned.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Void Sovereign — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000,000 — exact default Elite EP gate&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero gate&r"
		"&f• Master: Void Edge — exact current mastery required by Elite&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
