	quest.4463FA02CB732021.title: "Demon Marionette"
	quest.44694F6D5F5AE036.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTrue Dragon of Earth. Earth-type magic while in slot. Human summon Coming Soon — use Pseudo Dragon Body for dragon form.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. TR: Nightmare inner-world True Dragon teaching: Progress the Velgaia inner-world relationship until reputation is at least 500. Learn Velgaia's intrinsic taught skill first. Continue selecting the teaching interaction in that dragon's inner-world dialogue. Each qualifying teaching interaction rolls a 5% default chance to grant the matching True Dragon Ultimate. Repeat until it succeeds; the same grant also teaches Pseudo Dragon Body if missing.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Pseudo Dragon Body (trnightmare:pseudo_dragon_body) through True Dragon Ultimate companion grant.&r &7Requirements: successfully learn any True Dragon Ultimate through inner-world teaching.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Reputation and the random teaching roll are not exposed to FTB Quests. This is a repeatable chance, not a guaranteed interaction.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Velgaia, Lord of Earth-Star ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
