	quest.448D377786A60726.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Wind abilities by a large amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above dominationEpAcquirement (server-config value); then master tensura:wind_manipulation. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Wind Manipulation (tensura:wind_manipulation), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Wind Manipulation (tensura:wind_manipulation), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Wind Manipulation (tensura:wind_manipulation) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:wind_manipulation; possess tensura:wind_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Wind Manipulation (tensura:wind_manipulation) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:wind_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:wind_domination.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Hastur, Lord of Starwind ｣ (trnightmare:hastur) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Wind Domination — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.448D377786A60726.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.448D377786A60726.title: "Wind Domination"
	quest.44A187FEED713F1C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA unique poison art: stack Lethal Dose, refine toxins, and unleash domain-wide devastation.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
