	quest.44BF1C57107C103B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGain access to the intermediate Darkness Spirit Magic and boost your darkness attacks while buffing yourself and debuffing enemies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Abyss grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fCorrupted Dragon (ascension:corrupted_dragon); Cursed Dragon (ascension:cursed_dragon); Dark Fairy (trnightmare:dark_fairy); Demon Dragon God (ascension:demon_dragon_god); Demon Prince (trnightmare:demon_prince); Demonic Dragon (ascension:demonic_dragon)&r"
		"&fHell Rizer (trnightmare:hell_rizer); Ten Commandment (trnightmare:ten_commandments)&r"
