	quest.44F7828DF37514E5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fShoot out a blade of water which flies in a straight line.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 10,000; then master tensura:hydraulic_propulsion. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fRimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); Clawdian (cataclysm:clawdian)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Water Blade — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.44F7828DF37514E5.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.44F7828DF37514E5.title: "Water Blade"
	quest.44F9E1C8F4376A7A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f400,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fSculk Worm&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fSoul Shrieker&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fWarden&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fReaper Aberration&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fWarden&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 400,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 400,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Soul Aberration — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.44F9E1C8F4376A7A.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Mysticism"
	quest.44F9E1C8F4376A7A.title: "Soul Aberration"
	quest.44F9F20EFE77E4FE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIncrease your size and boost your physical stats.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Engorger — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.44F9F20EFE77E4FE.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
