	quest.4649AA0C2E44F872.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f4,500–7,000 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f1,500–2,500"
		"&eMagicules: &f3,000–4,500"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fNone explicitly granted by the race class/config"
		"&eRace modifiers: &fMax Health +18, Spiritual Health +80, Attack +0.3"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fGolden Chimera&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fGreater Chimera&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 4,500. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 4,500 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Lesser Chimera — checks your current race&r"
