	quest.46AE776ECE00400F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§6A heart once claimed cannot escape desire.§r\\n§8The true king hoards his own fate,§r\\n§eand greed denies even death its payment.§r&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: satisfy the skill's built-in automatic acquisition check. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: True Authority of Greed — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
