		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 3,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Master Vestiges of Eidolons (trstarlight:vestiges_of_eidolons). Open its skill quest for every learning method.&r"
		"&f3. Master Remnants of Ascension (trstarlight:remnants_of_ascension). Open its skill quest for every learning method.&r"
		"&f4. Defeat 10 TenSura bosses. This evolution uses TenSura's lifetime boss-defeat count.&r"
