	quest.4727BEC2876EFD14.title: "Mythos - Aspect of Eternity"
	quest.475BA3163797A1BC.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAltered covenant authority over prison, barrier, cleansing and law degradation.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Infinity Prison (tensura:infinity_prison), then use TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Law Manipulation (tensura:law_manipulation), then use TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Spatial Domination (tensura:spatial_domination), then use TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with Multilayer Barrier (tensura:multilayer_barrier), then use TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis: Obtain access to the Alteration creation menu through a skill that provides it. Master Infinity Prison, Law Manipulation, Spatial Domination, and Multilayer Barrier. Directive-Ego and Akashic-imprinted copies cannot be consumed. Select Uriel, Lord of Oaths in Alteration and pay the default 375,000 Magicules. Successful synthesis consumes all four mastered skills and creates Uriel.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Infinity Prison (tensura:infinity_prison) through TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis.&r &7Requirements: master four component skills; 375,000 Magicules; valid non-imprinted component instances.&r"
		"&f• Law Manipulation (tensura:law_manipulation) through TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis.&r &7Requirements: master four component skills; 375,000 Magicules; valid non-imprinted component instances.&r"
		"&f• Spatial Domination (tensura:spatial_domination) through TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis.&r &7Requirements: master four component skills; 375,000 Magicules; valid non-imprinted component instances.&r"
		"&f• Multilayer Barrier (tensura:multilayer_barrier) through TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis.&r &7Requirements: master four component skills; 375,000 Magicules; valid non-imprinted component instances.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Shub-Niggurath, King of Harvest ｣ (trnightmare:shub_niggurath) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can verify the four mastered abilities but cannot prove Alteration-menu availability, imprint state, or the synthesis payment.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Uriel, Lord of Oaths ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Infinity Prison — exact current mastery; FTB cannot detect forbidden imprint state&r"
		"&f• Master: Law Manipulation — exact current mastery; FTB cannot detect forbidden imprint state&r"
		"&f• Master: Spatial Domination — exact current mastery; FTB cannot detect forbidden imprint state&r"
		"&f• Master: Multilayer Barrier — exact current mastery; FTB cannot detect forbidden imprint state&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.475BA3163797A1BC.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.475BA3163797A1BC.title: "｢ Uriel, Lord of Oaths ｣"
	quest.475EEDAE053D7D75.quest_desc: [
