	quest.47D99884E217EC0A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIt allows the user to use the unique skills of bosses and otherworlders they have killed.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Imitator — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.47D99884E217EC0A.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Slime Throne Extras"
	quest.47D99884E217EC0A.title: "Imitator"
	quest.47DD6E266D0444F5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSend commands to nearby allies and become able to instruct them to attack players.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Telepathy (tensura:telepathy), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fDirewolf (tensura:direwolf); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAmped Guitar Wolf (mysticism:amped_guitar_wolf); Antumbra Spirit Wolf (mysticism:antumbra_spirit_wolf); Black Fang (mysticism:black_fang); Blazing Scorch Wolf (mysticism:blazing_scorch_wolf); Blue Fang (mysticism:blue_fang); Brown Fang (mysticism:brown_fang)&r"
		"&fDarkness Fang (mysticism:darkness_fang); Direwolf (mysticism:direwolf); Divine Wolf (mysticism:divine_wolf); Frost Wolf (mysticism:frost_wolf); Glacier Spirit Wolf (mysticism:glacier_spirit_wolf); Green Fang (mysticism:green_fang)&r"
		"&fGuitar Wolf (mysticism:guitar_wolf); Light Fang (mysticism:light_fang); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:gale_spirit_wolf); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:magic_spirit_wolf); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:ocean_spirit_wolf); Molten Spirit Wolf (mysticism:molten_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&fMountain Spirit Wolf (mysticism:mountain_spirit_wolf); Mystical Black Fang (mysticism:mystical_black_fang); Mystical Black Fang (mysticism:mystical_blue_fang); Mystical Brown Fang (mysticism:mystical_brown_fang); Mystical Darkness Fang (mysticism:mystical_darkness_fang); Mystical Green Fang (mysticism:mystical_green_fang)&r"
		"&fMystical Light Fang (mysticism:mystical_light_fang); Mystical Purple Fang (mysticism:mystical_purple_fang); Mystical Red Fang (mysticism:mystical_red_fang); Nivalis Frost Wolf (mysticism:nivalis_frost_wolf); Penumbra Spirit Wolf (mysticism:penumbra_spirit_wolf); Planet Spirit Wolf (mysticism:planet_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&fPurple Fang (mysticism:purple_fang); Red Fang (mysticism:red_fang); Scorch Wolf (mysticism:scorch_wolf); Star Wolf (mysticism:star_wolf); Storm Spirit Wolf (mysticism:storm_spirit_wolf); String Spirit Wolf (mysticism:string_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&fTempest Star Wolf (mysticism:tempest_star_wolf); Volcanic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:volcanic_spirit_wolf)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Telepathy (tensura:telepathy) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:telepathy; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:thought_communication.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Thought Communication — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.47DD6E266D0444F5.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.47DD6E266D0444F5.title: "Thought Communication"
	quest.47E2B70079E02A62.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fChange your fate survive fatal blows, regenerate instantly and manipulate probability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Mood Maker, Lord of Psychology ｣ (trnightmare:mood_maker) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Tuner — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
