	quest.4804E720F46E1728.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • Ascension"
	quest.4804E720F46E1728.title: "Frog Monarch"
	quest.481D712C79F3241E.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBecome the monster you were meant to be. Eat all. Analyze, craft and refine items, gain access to a spatial storage and mimic entities.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fRimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Mimicry (trnightmare:mimicry) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Predator OR Gluttony OR Beelzebuth.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Predator — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.481D712C79F3241E.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.481D712C79F3241E.title: "Predator"
