	quest.4911716A4A663E58.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fToggle: +100 max spiritual HP. Modes: Seal (trap a non-player at least 1.5x weaker than you into a stone — 30s, 20s mastered), Suppress (bank 20% of your max EP into a stone for later — 30s, 20s mastered), Stored Strength (+0.2 attack damage per use, +0.3 mastered, capped at +20, lost on death — 20s, 10s mastered).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• The One Who Seals (ascension:one_who_seals) through Ascension Awakening Altar.&r &7Requirements: Carry a Suppression Stone whose stored aura plus stored magicules is at least 400,000; one qualifying stone is consumed when the ritual prepares; mastered Sealer; max EP at least 5M; True Demon Lord or True Hero; doAscensionUltimate gamerule enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sealer — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4911716A4A663E58.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Ascension"
	quest.4911716A4A663E58.title: "Sealer"
	quest.491FD14338A96926.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weaker flame damage or resist the damage from more powerful flames.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Scorch grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fCarrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Echo of Tyros, First Flamebearer (irons_spellbooks:fire_boss); Gazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Memoires (mysticism:memoires); Pyromancer (irons_spellbooks:pyromancer); Salamander (tensura:salamander); Cinder Adder (cataclysm:cinder_adder); Fire Beetle (twilightforest:fire_beetle); Fire Minion (aether:fire_minion); Tower Ghast (twilightforest:tower_ghast); Umvuthana Raptor (mowziesmobs:umvuthana_raptor)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDivine Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:divine_netherite_dragon); Divine Tiefling (trarcane:divine_tiefling); Fire Genasi (trarcane:fire_genasi); Flame Soul Insect (mysticism:flame_soul_insect); Giant Elder (trnightmare:giant_elder); Greater Pyre Wyrm (mysticism:greater_pyre_wyrm)&r"
		"&fGreater Tiefling (trarcane:greater_tiefling); Infernal Tiefling (trarcane:infernal_tiefling); Lesser Nether Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_nether_dragon); Lesser Pyre Wyrm (mysticism:lesser_pyre_wyrm); Lower-Class Demon (trnightmare:lower_class_demon); Medium Nether Dragon (trnightmare:medium_nether_dragon)&r"
		"&fNetherite Dragon (trnightmare:netherite_dragon); Scorchtail Salamander (mysticism:scorchtail_salamander); Scorchtalon Wyvern (mysticism:scorchtalon_wyvern); Scrap Dragon (trnightmare:scrap_dragon); Sundeity Loong (mysticism:sundeity_loong); Sunfire Lindwurm (mysticism:sunfire_lindwurm)&r"
		"&fVolcanic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:volcanic_spirit_wolf)&r"
