		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.4920AF625FB2C286.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.4920AF625FB2C286.title: "Divine Netherite Dragon"
	quest.49232F5857879151.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYou've always been a powerful manipulator. Capable of bringing anyone and anything under your control. ...But, something is strange...&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Subjugator — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.49232F5857879151.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
	quest.49232F5857879151.title: "Subjugator"
	quest.493FD153122F2758.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAchieve mastery through discipline. Learn combat and magic abilities instantly, gain more mastery points, and hit much harder.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Strength (tensura:strength), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare boss-drop route:&f personally defeat the Sentient Boss Raymond. The skill is rolled from that boss's configured reward list; its chance is half of TenSura's configured Otherworlder skill-drop percentage, so the kill is not guaranteed to award it.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Strength (tensura:strength) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 4).&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Fighter — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.493FD153122F2758.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.493FD153122F2758.title: "Fighter"
