	quest.4A38AA27653B890F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe evolved form of Chaotic Fate. Manipulate destiny, distort dimensions, and counter all harm.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:cook. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Cook (tensura:cook), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Cook (tensura:cook) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Cook (tensura:cook)&r"
		"&f• Kill susan.SusanooMobKills mobs&r"
		"&f• Master susan.SusanooSkillsMastered total skills&r"
		"&f• Master Cook (tensura:cook).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 600,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Susanoo, Lord of Tyranny ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Cook — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 600,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4A38AA27653B890F.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.4A38AA27653B890F.title: "｢ Susanoo, Lord of Tyranny ｣"
	quest.4A3FB40F5E084E24.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Primordial Blanc 5 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+1,000 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.4A3FB40F5E084E24.title: "Primordial Blanc: 5 Kills"
	quest.4A594BC2567AE4EC.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f800,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fArch Dragon&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fElement Dragon&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDivine Dragon Lord&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fGehenna Dragon&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 800,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 800,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Dragon Lord — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.4A594BC2567AE4EC.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.4A594BC2567AE4EC.title: "Dragon Lord"
	quest.4A81460B86EF4BC8.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe Frosted Prison is a high-tier Cataclysm arena. Mobility and cold-looking terrain can hide dangerous drops and narrow approaches.&r"
		""
		"&fClear a retreat lane, then learn the boss pattern one phase at a time.&r"
	]
	quest.4A81460B86EF4BC8.title: "Tier 4: Break into the Frosted Prison"
	quest.4AD2C5E0F808D8A3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCall forth walls of ice upon targets.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Uncommon Frozen.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Medium Upgraded.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fCryomancer (irons_spellbooks:cryomancer); Dragon Clone Velzard (trnightmare:dragon_clone_velzard); Primordial Bleu (trnightmare:sentient_boss_bleu); Velzard Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_velzard)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.4AD2C5E0F808D8A3.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.4AD2C5E0F808D8A3.title: "Ice Wall"
	quest.4AE0D310961BEB9A.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Zoglin 5 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+50 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.4AE0D310961BEB9A.title: "Zoglin: 5 Kills"
	quest.4AE8E21859E1B6D9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fHarnesses wind currents to instinctively avoid attacks. Movement becomes reactive and unpredictable.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gift (trnightmare:gift), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation: Obtain Gift (or its Ultimate continuation Astraea) and place it in an active skill slot. Open Gift Creation / Astraea Blessing Creation and select this skill from the available blessings. Confirm creation. The default Gift creation cost is 0 Magicules with a 100-tick cooldown. The result lives inside Gift/Astraea as a sub-ability rather than a separate learned skill.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gift (trnightmare:gift) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB ability tasks cannot inspect sub-ability slots; use the parent-skill tracker and manual confirmation.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §6§lGift — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4AE8E21859E1B6D9.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.4AE8E21859E1B6D9.title: "Wind Evasion"
	quest.4B156219D8A6D6A2.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn extra skill that improves resistance against void-aligned damage and effects.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Complete TR: Nightmare's Azathoth evolution. The successful evolution grants Void Resistance immediately after Azathoth is learned.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Void Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8The tracker verifies the resulting skill; addon-specific counters and random rolls are not exposed to FTB Quests.&r"
	]
	quest.4B156219D8A6D6A2.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.4B156219D8A6D6A2.title: "Void Resistance"
	quest.4B1F20B4892C2B29.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Wilden Chimera 10 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+5,000 maximum EP&r"
