	quest.4B3691A24C6942D9.title: "Hippocamtus: 50 Kills"
	quest.4B3D9A0AF945A01C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe Empowerment of one's Holy Magic.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master magic spells until the relevant counter reaches the configured count. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Blessing of Faith — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4B3D9A0AF945A01C.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.4B3D9A0AF945A01C.title: "Blessing of Faith"
	quest.4B4462C0868F096A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fNegates all blood-attribute damage.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Blood Resistance (ascension:blood_resistance), then use TenSura resistance mastery evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. TenSura resistance mastery evolution: Become a Blood Noble to receive Blood Resistance. Use Blood Resistance until it reaches mastery. The standard TenSura resistance upgrade replaces it with Blood Nullification. Open the skill menu and confirm Blood Nullification is present after the mastery evolution.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Blood Resistance (ascension:blood_resistance) through TenSura resistance mastery evolution.&r &7Requirements: master Blood Resistance.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Mastering Blood Resistance upgrades it into Blood Nullification.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Blood Nullification — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4B4462C0868F096A.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • Ascension"
	quest.4B4462C0868F096A.title: "Blood Nullification"
