	quest.4B69015310986B2F.title: "Parrot: 5 Kills"
	quest.4B6FB4F82505AA95.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat the names mean&r"
		"&fResistance reduces or counters a matching damage or effect type. Immunity is the stronger form, but it only covers the effect named by that skill; it does not make you invulnerable to unrelated attacks.&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhy toggles matter&r"
		"&fSome defensive skills are always-on traits, while others must be equipped or toggled. Open the Status Menu, inspect the skill, bind it if needed, then test its active state. If Aura/Magicules drain unexpectedly, check active toggles first.&r"
		""
		"&fThe Resistance Skills chapter lists each installed resistance and its confirmed acquisition sources. Treat the in-game tooltip and that quest as the exact scope of protection.&r"
	]
	quest.4B6FB4F82505AA95.title: "Resistances and Immunities"
	quest.4B7A955FF6F93DBB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7Compress and amplify flame into devastating heat. Toggle §cScorching Flames§7 (+4 flame boost); grants heat and flame nullification. Hold §6Burning Breath§7, §4Bloody Lava§7, or §eSuperheating§7.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare friendship route:&f befriend the Sentient Boss Velgrynd, meet 200 Friendship, 100 Loyalty, and 80 Bond, then choose 'Hang Out With' in the friendship menu. Each eligible attempt rolls a bond / 5,000, plus 15 percentage points at 1,000 Bond chance to teach this skill; repeat the interaction after failures.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §cAcc§6ele§erat§fion — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4B7A955FF6F93DBB.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
