	quest.4C34142441328770.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f1,500,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f15× Daemon Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fDivine King&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 1,500,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 15 x Daemon Essence (tensura:daemon_essence): Defeat Arch Daemons (50%), Greater Daemons (10%), or Lesser Daemons (1%). It also appears in Hell Ruins chests and Hell Ruins archaeology. Then eat/use all 15; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 1,500,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Sun Wukong — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.4C34142441328770.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • Ascension"
	quest.4C34142441328770.title: "Sun Wukong"
	quest.4C4D801BC529D4C5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fHighlights entities that generate heat nearby.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Not obtainable in normal play: there is no direct player-learning method in this pack version. If a compatible mob below uses it, Gluttony may still be able to copy it; otherwise it is mob-only or command-only.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fHover Lizard (tensura:hover_lizard); Leech Lizard (tensura:leech_lizard); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); Tempest Serpent (tensura:tempest_serpent)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sense Heat Source — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4C4D801BC529D4C5.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.4C4D801BC529D4C5.title: "Sense Heat Source"
	quest.4C7D08519C7FA9BE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f2,500–5,000 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f2,000–4,000"
		"&eMagicules: &f500–1,000"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fHoly Attack Resistance, Light Attack Resistance, Magic Light Transform, Self-Regeneration, Heavenly Eye, Goddess Incarnation"
		"&eRace modifiers: &fMax Health +25, Spiritual Health +90, Attack +0.7, Movement Speed +0.02"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fMedium Goddess&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to start&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,500. Temporary or equipment bonuses may satisfy the quest tracker without satisfying the race's base-EP check.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select Lesser Goddess. This starting race does not consume Holy Essence.&r"
		""
		"&e&lPrepare for Medium Goddess&r"
		"&fYour first evolution uses 10 Holy Essence. The clearest routes are TR: Nightmare Human Raids or Direwolf Raids, or Sentient Masayuuki. These are addon encounters—not ordinary Minecraft village raids. Read the Medium Goddess quest before farming so you know which counter must increase.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,500 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Lesser Goddess — checks your current race&r"
	]
