	quest.4DBC505340BA73E3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f2,000,000"
		"&eBoss kills: &f5 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Enchanted Golden Apple, 15× Royal Blood, 15× Elemental Essence, 15× Dragon Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fGolden Chimera&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDivine Chimera&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Defeat 5 TenSura bosses. This evolution uses TenSura's lifetime boss-defeat count.&r"
		"&f3. Obtain 10 x Enchanted Golden Apple (minecraft:enchanted_golden_apple): Loot vanilla structure chests that contain Enchanted Golden Apples; the pack's loot viewer shows the installed tables. Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f4. Obtain 15 x Royal Blood (tensura:royal_blood): Defeat a Royal Orc (25%), Orc Lord (50%), or Orc Disaster (guaranteed). Then eat/use all 15; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f5. Obtain 15 x Elemental Essence (tensura:elemental_essence): Defeat Akash, Ifrit, Sylphide, Undine, or War Gnome (guaranteed). Several lesser elemental mobs and qualifying summoned Elemental Colossi have a 10% source. Then eat/use all 15; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f6. Obtain 15 x Dragon Essence (tensura:dragon_essence): Defeat Charybdis (1-3 guaranteed), a Basilisk (1%), or a Dragonewt-type Lizardman (25%). Lizardman throne/storage loot and Elite crates are additional sources. Then eat/use all 15; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f7. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Bosses defeated: 5 — exact lifetime custom-stat counter; may predate this quest&r"
		"&f• Current race: Chimera Lord — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
