	quest.4DD2CCA61CE3D9CF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCondense your aura into a blade projectile.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Learn Ogre-sword Guillotine from a manual, master it, then let the normal EP/ability update check grant Ogre-sword Cannon.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fEvolves/unlocks from: Ogre-sword Guillotine. Master Ogre-sword Guillotine.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.4DD2CCA61CE3D9CF.quest_subtitle: "Projectile Battlewill Arts • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.4DD2CCA61CE3D9CF.title: "Ogre-sword Cannon"
	quest.4DF6F972F236EAFF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCall forth weak undead from the ground to aid the caster.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Common Rotted.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fNecromancer (irons_spellbooks:necromancer)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.4DF6F972F236EAFF.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.4DF6F972F236EAFF.title: "Create Lesser Undead"
	quest.4DFE67F58DB67E0C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fInherit the genetics of a sizeable creature known for its oven-like body.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess StarlightUniqueSkills.LIGHT_REMAINS.get(); then possess StarlightUniqueSkills.VESTIGES_OF_EIDOLONS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Flarecannon Genetics — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4DFE67F58DB67E0C.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.4DFE67F58DB67E0C.title: "Flarecannon Genetics"
