	quest.4E0AA360BDF886DA.title: "Elemental Colossus: First Kill"
	quest.4E1156228A830376.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYour powerful authority over the elements of Flame and Light as the True Scorch Dragon.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. TR Origins True Dragon element grant: Follow the TR Origins race progression and become the Scorch True Dragon. When the True Dragon storage registers that element, DragonElementUtils automatically learns Dragon Factor: Scorch and applies the element's resistance/skill package.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8The skill is intrinsic to that selected True Dragon element and is tagged no-plundering.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Dragon Factor: Scorch — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4E1156228A830376.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR Origins"
	quest.4E1156228A830376.title: "Dragon Factor: Scorch"
	quest.4E15EC9A6BA89977.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&7The mod does not provide an effect description for this ability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ (trnightmare:raguel), then use TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming: Own one matching source Ultimate: trnightmare:raguel, and develop its matching Ego/personality. Raise that Ego above 225 social points, then use the Ego evolution screen to confirm each stage through stage 4. Each attempt has a 12-minute cooldown and a 30% failure chance by default; failure halves social points. When stage 4 reports that the Ego is ready, use the Ego naming command/menu and choose a name. The first naming pays the configured base naming cost; the mod creates the mapped Manas skill and transfers mastery.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ (trnightmare:raguel) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can verify the source and resulting skills but cannot read Ego personality, social points, stage, cooldown, failure roll, or naming cost.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §5Joyful Manas — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ — alternative/matching source aid; Ego stage and personality remain manual&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4E15EC9A6BA89977.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.4E15EC9A6BA89977.title: "Joyful Manas"
	quest.4E16A9DC1D1C3716.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSoul dominion over death and transference. In-slot attacks gain spiritual bonus from souls. Toggle Soul Shield to consume souls on fatal damage. Hold Soul Transmogrification to preserve Skill Storage memories through reset. Soul Storage revives dead player subordinates in hardcore.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Spearhead (tensura:spearhead), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Starved (tensura:starved), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with ｢ Shub-Niggurath, King of Harvest ｣ (trnightmare:shub_niggurath), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Spearhead (tensura:spearhead) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Starved (tensura:starved) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Shub-Niggurath, King of Harvest ｣ (trnightmare:shub_niggurath) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Spearhead (tensura:spearhead)&r"
		"&f• Master Starved (tensura:starved)&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Shub-Niggurath, King of Harvest ｣ (trnightmare:shub_niggurath)&r"
		"&f• Possess 5 skills of type Skill.SkillType.UNIQUE&r"
		"&f• Have at least 35,000,000 current EP&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 35,000,000 maximum Magicule capacity (fixed by the installed Tenebrosum class). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare God Skills gamerule must also be enabled.&r"
		"&f• For non-creative players, this God-class skill must not already have another world owner; the successful evolution claims its ownership record.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Tenebrosum, God of Souls ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Spearhead — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Starved — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Shub-Niggurath, King of Harvest ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Current EP: 35,000,000 — exact current EP value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 35,000,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4E16A9DC1D1C3716.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.4E16A9DC1D1C3716.title: "｢ Tenebrosum, God of Souls ｣"
	quest.4E2CFD338891537E.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f1,250,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Daemon Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fSeraphim&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fChaotic Deity&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 1,250,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 10 x Daemon Essence (tensura:daemon_essence): Defeat Arch Daemons (50%), Greater Daemons (10%), or Lesser Daemons (1%). It also appears in Hell Ruins chests and Hell Ruins archaeology. Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 1,250,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
