	quest.4E47FB58DB30C517.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCommand your absolute authority over Acceleration, allowing you to inflict all enemies with fire and spew superheated flames. Additionally, melt the surroundings into magma.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Scorch grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fBlazing Scorch Wolf (mysticism:blazing_scorch_wolf); Greater Pyre Wyrm (mysticism:greater_pyre_wyrm); Molten Spirit Wolf (mysticism:molten_spirit_wolf); Scorchtail Salamander (mysticism:scorchtail_salamander); Scorchtalon Wyvern (mysticism:scorchtalon_wyvern); Sundeity Loong (mysticism:sundeity_loong)&r"
		"&fSunfire Lindwurm (mysticism:sunfire_lindwurm)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Profaned Prominence — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
