	quest.4EF93629B7E13A7C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCompletely nullify all wind damage.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fHinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Luminous Valentine (tensura_neb:luminous_valentine); Sylphide (tensura:sylphide); Scylla (cataclysm:scylla)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fGuardian Of The Tree (trnightmare:guardian_of_the_tree)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Wind Attack Nullification — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
