		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Haniel, Lord of Glory ｣ (trnightmare:haniel) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Haniel, Lord of Glory ｣ (trnightmare:haniel)&r"
		"&f• Win 12 village raids&r"
		"&f• Master NightmareAspectualMagics.DAY_NIGHT_INVERSION.get()&r"
		"&f• Attempt the evolution in biome TensuraBiomes.ANCIENT_FOREST.location()&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 900,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Hamiel, King of Splendour ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Haniel, Lord of Glory ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Village raids won: 12 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 900,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4F5542402456D2C7.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.4F5542402456D2C7.title: "｢ Hamiel, King of Splendour ｣"
	quest.4F5C5F6E8F5BD708.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fLaunch a lighting projectile which will electrify your enemies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Medium-or-higher Wind spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Wind Spiritual Magic through Medium, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Wind. Minimum contract level: Medium. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.4F5C5F6E8F5BD708.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.4F5C5F6E8F5BD708.title: "Lightning Lance"
