	quest.4F742DBBCE45FBD3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts the power of  Earth abilities by a large amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above dominationEpAcquirement (server-config value); then master tensura:earth_manipulation. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with Earth Manipulation (tensura:earth_manipulation), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. Start with Earth Manipulation (tensura:earth_manipulation), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Earth grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fGazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Ancient Remnant (cataclysm:ancient_remnant); Kobolediator (cataclysm:kobolediator); Koboleton (cataclysm:koboleton); Modern Remnant (cataclysm:modern_remnant); Naga (twilightforest:naga); Sandworm (block_factorys_bosses:sandworm); Sculptor (mowziesmobs:sculptor); Slider (aether:slider); Wadjet (cataclysm:wadjet)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fBig Cutie (trnightmare:big_cutie); Giant Elder (trnightmare:giant_elder)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Earth Manipulation (tensura:earth_manipulation) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:earth_manipulation; possess tensura:earth_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Earth Manipulation (tensura:earth_manipulation) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:earth_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:earth_domination.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Earth Domination — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.4F742DBBCE45FBD3.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.4F742DBBCE45FBD3.title: "Earth Domination"
