	quest.4F8736B13B04C6C7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&fThis race does not use the usual EP or item requirement list. Follow its route below."
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. No explicit prerequisite object is declared. Follow an incoming evolution route shown above, then select this form when TenSura offers it.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Current race: Divine Vampiric Dragon Lord — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.4F8736B13B04C6C7.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.4F8736B13B04C6C7.title: "Divine Vampiric Dragon Lord"
	quest.4F88E8DFA01C47A1.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis chapter contains all &e13&f abilities players can obtain in this category.&r"
		"&fMagic is grouped as Aspectual, Spiritual, Summoning, or Miscellaneous. Battlewill is grouped by use: Melee, Projectile, Utility, or Advanced/Addon.&r"
		"&fEach page explains what the ability does, how to learn it, which mobs use it, and whether it upgrades.&r"
		"&eTomes:&r &fA bound Magic Tome teaches the named magic after it is held for at least 10 ticks. Rank-A Guild tomes rotate every 7 Minecraft days by default. An Unbound Tome at a Spellbinding Table only copies Magic you already know and have mastered; it is not an initial unlock.&r"
		"&eBattlewill Manuals:&r &fA bound manual teaches its named art. An unbound manual rolls the 26-art list. Manuals are consumed on a valid use attempt even if the ability cannot be learned.&r"
		"&7The Learn task updates when you gain the ability. The book cannot predict random tome or manual rolls, spirit-contract chances, shop rotations, or uninterrupted training.&r"
	]
	quest.4F88E8DFA01C47A1.quest_subtitle: "13 obtainable abilities"
	quest.4F88E8DFA01C47A1.title: "Other \\& Addon Magic"
