		"&fGod Of Earth (trnightmare:god_of_earth); God Slime (tensura:god_slime); Remnant (mysticism:remnant); Revenant (mysticism:revenant); Royal Demon (trnightmare:royal_demon); Sacred Tree Child (trnightmare:sacred_tree_child)&r"
		"&fTrue Dragon (trorigins:true_dragon); Whole (mysticism:whole)&r"
