	quest.5052FF0000DF94D0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn analysis blessing that continuously grants appraisal powerful enough to read up to roughly 10x the user’s EP while in-slot.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gift (trnightmare:gift), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation: Obtain Gift (or its Ultimate continuation Astraea) and place it in an active skill slot. Open Gift Creation / Astraea Blessing Creation and select this skill from the available blessings. Confirm creation. The default Gift creation cost is 0 Magicules with a 100-tick cooldown. The result lives inside Gift/Astraea as a sub-ability rather than a separate learned skill.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gift (trnightmare:gift) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB ability tasks cannot inspect sub-ability slots; use the parent-skill tracker and manual confirmation.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §6§lGift — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.5052FF0000DF94D0.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.5052FF0000DF94D0.title: "Divine Protection of Judgement"
	quest.505C021790A16506.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fActive: open a white Hyperbolic Portal leading to the Hyperbolic Chamber. Costs 10%% current MP. CD 30s (10s mastered). Auto-learned once Gate AND Sacred Haki are both mastered.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gate (tensura:gate), then use Ascension automatic mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Sacred Haki (tensura:sacred_haki), then use Ascension automatic mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Ascension automatic mastery unlock: Obtain Gate (tensura:gate), a Medium Space Spiritual Magic, by successfully contracting/taming a Medium-or-higher Space Spirit. Praying on a Praying Path performs the spirit-contract roll; a successful qualifying Space contract grants every Space Spiritual Magic up to that spirit level, including Gate. Then master Gate. Also master tensura:sacred_haki. The server checks these unlocks during player ticks. Keep the skill enabled in server settings and allow the learning check to run; failed repeated attempts are throttled to once per 60 seconds.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gate (tensura:gate) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Obtain Gate (tensura:gate), a Medium Space Spiritual Magic, by successfully contracting/taming a Medium-or-higher Space Spirit. Praying on a Praying Path performs the spirit-contract roll; a successful qualifying Space contract grants every Space Spiritual Magic up to that spirit level, including Gate. Then master Gate. Also master tensura:sacred_haki.&r"
		"&f• Sacred Haki (tensura:sacred_haki) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Obtain Gate (tensura:gate), a Medium Space Spiritual Magic, by successfully contracting/taming a Medium-or-higher Space Spirit. Praying on a Praying Path performs the spirit-contract roll; a successful qualifying Space contract grants every Space Spiritual Magic up to that spirit level, including Gate. Then master Gate. Also master tensura:sacred_haki.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Hyperbolic Passage — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: Gate — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Sacred Haki — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.505C021790A16506.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • Ascension"
	quest.505C021790A16506.title: "Hyperbolic Passage"
	quest.508AE35F277511E2.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Cryomancer 25 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+100 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.508AE35F277511E2.title: "Cryomancer: 25 Kills"
	quest.508EFEEFA1458010.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCoat the caster with a Physical Barrier with the strength based on Health.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Rare Buried.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Medium Rare.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fArch Angel (trnightmare:arch_angel); Arch Fallen (trnightmare:arch_fallen); Arch Phantom (trnightmare:arch_phantom); Greater Angel (trnightmare:greater_angel)&r"
		"&fGreater Fallen (trnightmare:greater_fallen); Greater Phantom (trnightmare:greater_phantom)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.508EFEEFA1458010.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.508EFEEFA1458010.title: "Barrier"
	quest.50AE66762B3B16E0.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Drowned 10 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+75 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.50AE66762B3B16E0.title: "Drowned: 10 Kills"
	quest.50BFAD1EA81CF682.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGain access to the intermediate Water Spirit Magic and boost your water attacks while buffing yourself and debuffing enemies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Become a TR: Origins True Dragon and be assigned an unclaimed Frost or Storm elemental seat. The skill is granted automatically when either seat is assigned.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Frost, Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Magic Water Transform — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8The tracker verifies the resulting skill; addon-specific counters and random rolls are not exposed to FTB Quests.&r"
	]
	quest.50BFAD1EA81CF682.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.50BFAD1EA81CF682.title: "Magic Water Transform"
	quest.50C3E982EB323E21.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f1,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eRequires awakening"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fApostle&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fHermit&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fJedidiah&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 1,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. The base requirement accepts either state; complete the matching TenSura awakening route first.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 1,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact TenSura awakening state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Disciple — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.50C3E982EB323E21.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.50C3E982EB323E21.title: "Disciple"
	quest.50D1E0B6FA25B119.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis chapter contains all &e40&f abilities players can obtain in this category.&r"
		"&fMagic is grouped as Aspectual, Spiritual, Summoning, or Miscellaneous. Battlewill is grouped by use: Melee, Projectile, Utility, or Advanced/Addon.&r"
		"&fEach page explains what the ability does, how to learn it, which mobs use it, and whether it upgrades.&r"
		"&eTomes:&r &fA bound Magic Tome teaches the named magic after it is held for at least 10 ticks. Rank-A Guild tomes rotate every 7 Minecraft days by default. An Unbound Tome at a Spellbinding Table only copies Magic you already know and have mastered; it is not an initial unlock.&r"
		"&eBattlewill Manuals:&r &fA bound manual teaches its named art. An unbound manual rolls the 26-art list. Manuals are consumed on a valid use attempt even if the ability cannot be learned.&r"
		"&7The Learn task updates when you gain the ability. The book cannot predict random tome or manual rolls, spirit-contract chances, shop rotations, or uninterrupted training.&r"
	]
	quest.50D1E0B6FA25B119.quest_subtitle: "40 obtainable abilities"
	quest.50D1E0B6FA25B119.title: "Spiritual Magic"
	quest.50F6E2D481776105.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA radiant gift that protects and purifies. Enhances healing and weakens darkness around you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gift (trnightmare:gift), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation: Obtain Gift (or its Ultimate continuation Astraea) and place it in an active skill slot. Open Gift Creation / Astraea Blessing Creation and select this skill from the available blessings. Confirm creation. The default Gift creation cost is 0 Magicules with a 100-tick cooldown. The result lives inside Gift/Astraea as a sub-ability rather than a separate learned skill.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gift (trnightmare:gift) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB ability tasks cannot inspect sub-ability slots; use the parent-skill tracker and manual confirmation.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §6§lGift — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.50F6E2D481776105.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.50F6E2D481776105.title: "Light Blessing"
	quest.50FB830C4F61699D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fMend wounds with a touch or unleash devastating afflictions, capable of both salvation and suffering.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fShinji Tanimura (tensura:shinji_tanimura)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Healer — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
