	quest.5133FB28A393B4AB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weaker physical attacks or reduce the damage from stronger blows.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fCarrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Charybdis (tensura:charybdis); Echo of Tyros, First Flamebearer (irons_spellbooks:fire_boss); Gazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Gravebound Colossus (elitetensura:gravebound_colossus); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Amethyst Crab (cataclysm:amethyst_crab); Ancient Remnant (cataclysm:ancient_remnant); Ender Golem (cataclysm:ender_golem); Ender Guardian (cataclysm:ender_guardian); Frostmaw (mowziesmobs:frostmaw); Ignis (cataclysm:ignis); Naga (mowziesmobs:naga); Netherite Monstrosity (cataclysm:netherite_monstrosity); Sculptor (mowziesmobs:sculptor); The Harbinger (cataclysm:the_harbinger); The Leviathan (cataclysm:the_leviathan)&r"
		"&fMetal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); Shizu (tensura:shizu); The Dead King (irons_spellbooks:dead_king); Vaelthorn, the Hollow Sovereign (elitetensura:lich_boss)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fArch Angel (mysticism:arch_angel); Arch Fallen (mysticism:arch_fallen); Arch Fallen of Origin (trorigins:arch_fallen_of_origin); Axolotl Knight (trnightmare:axolotl_knight); Axolotl Steel Spirit (trnightmare:axolotl_steel_spirit); Axolotl Steel Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:axolotl_steel_dragon)&r"
		"&fBrother Of Chaos (trnightmare:brother_of_chaos); Cherub (mysticism:cherub); Cursed Dreadnaught (ascension:cursed_dreadnaught); Cursed Mariner (ascension:cursed_mariner); Davy Jones (ascension:davy_jones); Diamond Sovereign (traddon:diamond_sovereign)&r"
		"&fDivine Elemental (mysticism:divine_elemental); Divine Majin Elemental (mysticism:divine_majin_elemental); Divine Skeleton (tensura:divine_skeleton); Elemental Lord (mysticism:elemental_lord); Fairy (trarcane:fairy); Fairy Lord (trarcane:fairy_lord)&r"
		"&fFairy Queen (trarcane:fairy_queen); Fallen (mysticism:fallen); Fallen Arch Angel (mysticism:fallen_arch_angel); Fallen Arch Angel of Origin (trorigins:fallen_origin_arch_angel); Fallen Cherub of Origin (trorigins:fallen_cherub_of_origin); Fallen Lord (mysticism:fallen_lord)&r"
		"&fFallen Lord of Origin (trorigins:fallen_lord_of_origin); Fallen ReaperAberration (mysticism:fallen_seraph); Fallen Seraph of Origin (trorigins:fallen_seraph_of_origin); Fallen SoulAberration (mysticism:fallen_cherub); Fallen of Origin (trorigins:fallen_of_origin); Fantasy Soul Insect (mysticism:fantasy_soul_insect)&r"
		"&fGeneral (mysticism:general); Geode Golem (traddon:geode_golem); Giant Dancer (trnightmare:giant_dancer); Giant Warrior (trnightmare:giant_warrior); Lesser Giant (trnightmare:lesser_giant); Majin Elemental Lord (mysticism:majin_lord)&r"
		"&fMedium Goddess (trnightmare:medium_class_goddess); Metal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Middle-Class Demon (trnightmare:mid_class_demon); Mystic Angel (mysticism:mystic_angel); Nameless Goddess (trnightmare:nameless_goddess); Origin Arch Angel (trorigins:origin_arch_angel)&r"
		"&fPhantom Corsair (ascension:phantom_corsair); Prism Knight (traddon:prism_knight); Seraph (mysticism:seraph); Shardling (traddon:shardling); Spirit Skeleton (tensura:spirit_skeleton); Staff Officer (mysticism:staff_officer)&r"
