	quest.5185D796657BEAC1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f700–1,000 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f600–800"
		"&eMagicules: &f100–200"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fScale Armor"
		"&eRace modifiers: &fMax Health +4, Spiritual Health +8, Attack +0.5, Movement Speed +0.01"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDragonewt&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fTrue Dragonewt&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 700. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 700 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
