	quest.51B6588F8E42B8BF.title: "Knight of Black"
	quest.51C5248509E93CAB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f10,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eRequired ability/skill: &fIs Nether"
		"&eMysticism-specific evolution condition"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fDirewolf&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fBlazing Scorch Wolf&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fStorm Spirit Wolf&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 10,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Learn Flame Manipulation (tensura:flame_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Learn Earth Manipulation (tensura:earth_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f4. Learn Wind Manipulation (tensura:wind_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f5. Attempt the evolution while standing in a Nether biome.&r"
		"&f6. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Learn: Flame Manipulation — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Learn: Earth Manipulation — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Learn: Wind Manipulation — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Scorch Wolf — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
