	quest.51E2AAF8D0050EEA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Wind abilities by a decent amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: reach Wind Spirit level 1. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fFeathered Serpent (tensura:feathered_serpent); Sylphide (tensura:sylphide)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAir Genasi (trarcane:air_genasi); Blazing Scorch Wolf (mysticism:blazing_scorch_wolf); Fairy Lord (trarcane:fairy_lord); Fairy Queen (trarcane:fairy_queen); Frost Wolf (mysticism:frost_wolf); Glacier Spirit Wolf (mysticism:glacier_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&fGreen Fang (mysticism:green_fang); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:gale_spirit_wolf); Molten Spirit Wolf (mysticism:molten_spirit_wolf); Mystical Green Fang (mysticism:mystical_green_fang); Nivalis Frost Wolf (mysticism:nivalis_frost_wolf); Scorch Wolf (mysticism:scorch_wolf)&r"
		"&fStar Wolf (mysticism:star_wolf); Storm Spirit Wolf (mysticism:storm_spirit_wolf); Tempest Star Wolf (mysticism:tempest_star_wolf); Wind Soul Insect (mysticism:wind_soul_insect)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Wind Domination (tensura:wind_domination) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:wind_manipulation; possess tensura:wind_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Wind Domination (tensura:wind_domination) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:wind_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:wind_domination.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Wind Manipulation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.51E2AAF8D0050EEA.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.51E2AAF8D0050EEA.title: "Wind Manipulation"
