	quest.51F028561CC036F2.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§5A devotional Unique Skill that turns pain, madness, and sacrifice into power for the greater good.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §5§lCultist — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.51F028561CC036F2.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.51F028561CC036F2.title: "Cultist"
	quest.5208470506B85C7E.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCompletely negate all pain effects.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fGravebound Colossus (elitetensura:gravebound_colossus); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); Vaelthorn, the Hollow Sovereign (elitetensura:lich_boss); Yuuki Kagurazaka (tensura_guild:yuuki_kagurazaka)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
