	quest.5208C227E1B2E8C1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCreate phantasmal copies of blocks, items, and engravings by taking splinters of damaged timelines and world events and shaping them to your equipment.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master StarlightUniqueSkills.MAGICULE_ENGRAVEMENT.get(); then master StarlightUniqueSkills.MEMORY_RECREATION.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Phantasmal Creation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.5208C227E1B2E8C1.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.5208C227E1B2E8C1.title: "Phantasmal Creation"
	quest.520EF4819CCDB7F9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fRadiate authority and charisma to force fear into the hearts of your enemies and to make them follow you instead, while empowering yourself and your allies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ True Hero, King of Champions ｣ (trnightmare:true_hero) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Chosen One — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.520EF4819CCDB7F9.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.520EF4819CCDB7F9.title: "Chosen One"
	quest.521C8718BA6268D9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eRequires awakening"
		"&eMust be named"
		"&eRequires a physical body"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fCherub of Origin&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fMystic Angel of Origin&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. The base requirement accepts either state; complete the matching TenSura awakening route first.&r"
		"&f2. Have another eligible player name you through TenSura's Naming interaction/key menu. An anvil-renamed name tag does not satisfy the stored existence-name check.&r"
		"&f3. Incarnate into a physical body first. The condition rejects TenSura spiritual-form state.&r"
		"&f4. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact TenSura awakening state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Seraph of Origin — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.521C8718BA6268D9.quest_subtitle: "Special / Non-standard Race • TR Origins"
