	quest.523443C9BCB495CA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f20,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f5× Enchanted Golden Apple"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fLesser Chimera&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fGolden Chimera&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 20,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 5 x Enchanted Golden Apple (minecraft:enchanted_golden_apple): Loot vanilla structure chests that contain Enchanted Golden Apples; the pack's loot viewer shows the installed tables. Then eat/use all 5; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 20,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
