	quest.5252C09C67154A60.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f6,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fContractor&8 — Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fEnforcer&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fHermit&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fWanderer&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 6,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 6,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Scholar — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.5252C09C67154A60.quest_subtitle: "Special / Non-standard Race • TR Virtuoso"
	quest.5252C09C67154A60.title: "Scholar"
	quest.5261063A96D5AA48.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fChannel your aura, recklessly enhancing your strength and cleansing you of any negative effects.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Trade with a Battlewill Trainer dwarf at level 2. Its bound-manual trade tag explicitly includes this art; buy the named/glinting manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fUnlocks Maximum Will (trnightmare:maximum_will): Master Violent Break and Battlewill.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.5261063A96D5AA48.quest_subtitle: "Utility Battlewill Arts • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.5261063A96D5AA48.title: "Violent Break"
	quest.52781F865D17CCB4.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Fox 1 time after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+25 maximum EP&r"
