	quest.52D5314FFEFC7CAA.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Ascension"
	quest.52D5314FFEFC7CAA.title: "Kindred Bloodfiend"
	quest.52E948D5704EF0C5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fWhile in-slot, the user can walk over powder snow and similar soft snowy ground unless they crouch.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gift (trnightmare:gift), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation: Obtain Gift (or its Ultimate continuation Astraea) and place it in an active skill slot. Open Gift Creation / Astraea Blessing Creation and select this skill from the available blessings. Confirm creation. The default Gift creation cost is 0 Magicules with a 100-tick cooldown. The result lives inside Gift/Astraea as a sub-ability rather than a separate learned skill.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gift (trnightmare:gift) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB ability tasks cannot inspect sub-ability slots; use the parent-skill tracker and manual confirmation.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §6§lGift — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.52E948D5704EF0C5.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.52E948D5704EF0C5.title: "Divine Protection of Sandplay"
	quest.52E9E86552C5EC41.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe Beast Kingdom of Eurazania is both a destination and a boss-stage landmark. Treat it as a large site: establish a safe edge before moving toward the important rooms.&r"
		""
		"&fStep inside the kingdom's generated bounds to finish the visit, then choose when you are ready to start its fights.&r"
	]
	quest.52E9E86552C5EC41.title: "Tier 2: Reach Eurazania"
	quest.52FBD1567174FAA0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSpew icy breath to freeze enemies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAbyssal Dragonewt (ascension:abyssal_dragonewt); Chaos Dragon (ascension:chaos_dragon); Corrupted Dragon (ascension:corrupted_dragon); Corrupted Dragonkin (ascension:corrupted_dragonkin); Cursed Dragon (ascension:cursed_dragon); Demon Dragon God (ascension:demon_dragon_god)&r"
		"&fDemonic Dragon (ascension:demonic_dragon); Divine Dragon (tensura:divine_dragon); Dragonewt (tensura:dragonewt); Ender Dragonewt (ascension:ender_dragonewt); True Dragonewt (tensura:true_dragonewt); Void Dragonewt (ascension:void_dragonewt)&r"
		""
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlpha Yeti (twilightforest:alpha_yeti); Aptrgangr (cataclysm:aptrgangr); Frostmaw (mowziesmobs:frostmaw); Snow Queen (twilightforest:snow_queen); Winter Wolf (twilightforest:winter_wolf); Yeti (block_factorys_bosses:yeti)&r"
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Ice Breath — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.52FBD1567174FAA0.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.52FBD1567174FAA0.title: "Ice Breath"
	quest.53108136ACD71A11.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&7The mod does not provide an effect description for this ability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Uriel, Lord of Vows ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_vow), then use TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming: Own one matching source Ultimate: trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_vow, and develop its matching Ego/personality. Raise that Ego above 225 social points, then use the Ego evolution screen to confirm each stage through stage 4. Each attempt has a 12-minute cooldown and a 30% failure chance by default; failure halves social points. When stage 4 reports that the Ego is ready, use the Ego naming command/menu and choose a name. The first naming pays the configured base naming cost; the mod creates the mapped Manas skill and transfers mastery.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Uriel, Lord of Vows ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_vow) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can verify the source and resulting skills but cannot read Ego personality, social points, stage, cooldown, failure roll, or naming cost.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §5Paladin Manas — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Uriel, Lord of Vows ｣ — alternative/matching source aid; Ego stage and personality remain manual&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.53108136ACD71A11.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.53108136ACD71A11.title: "Paladin Manas"
	quest.53140FAB2F922EB7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate blaze charity — Flame Authority, Blast Blow, Blazeball, Maximum Blazeball, and Blaze Wave.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ (trnightmare:raguel), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ (trnightmare:raguel) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Learn ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ (trnightmare:raguel)&r"
		"&f• Master Flame Domination (tensura:flame_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Flame Manipulation (tensura:flame_manipulation)&r"
		"&f• Master Heat Wave (tensura:heat_wave)&r"
		"&f• Enter and remain in the Nether while attempting the evolution&r"
		"&f• Raise custom statistic trnightmare:agni_blaze_powder_eaten to 10&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 5,000,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Agni, Lord of Blaze ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Flame Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Flame Manipulation — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Heat Wave — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• trnightmare:agni_blaze_powder_eaten: 10 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 5,000,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
