	quest.533CE99D80BFE41C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSlice, dice, and feel your hunger. Your thirst for the hunt is unquenching, so grab a plate and have a taste.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
