	quest.541617B341E6E98C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUse magicule to manipulate the weather with a higher efficiency.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above dominationEpAcquirement (server-config value); then master tensura:weather_manipulation. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Weather Manipulation (tensura:weather_manipulation), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Weather Manipulation (tensura:weather_manipulation), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Weather Manipulation (tensura:weather_manipulation) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:weather_manipulation; possess tensura:weather_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Weather Manipulation (tensura:weather_manipulation) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:weather_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:weather_domination.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Hastur, Lord of Starwind ｣ (trnightmare:hastur) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Weather Domination — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.541617B341E6E98C.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.541617B341E6E98C.title: "Weather Domination"
