	quest.54281C5BACCD4823.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGain access to the intermediate Space Spirit Magic and boost your spatial attacks while buffing yourself and debuffing enemies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Become a TR: Origins True Dragon and be assigned an unclaimed Abyss or Storm elemental seat. The skill is granted automatically when either seat is assigned.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Abyss, Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Magic Space Transform — completes when you learn it&r"
