	quest.550CB429702C8A1B.title: "Medium Elemental"
	quest.553E26AF75A2FF56.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fToggle: +20% outgoing blood damage (+40% mastered). Masters slowly while toggled on.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Blood Blade (ascension:blood_blade), then use Ascension automatic mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension race intrinsic grant: Follow the Ascension race chapter and become the Blood Noble race (ascension:blood_noble). When that race is applied, its racial skill list automatically grants ascension:blood_manipulation. Open the skill menu after the race change and confirm the skill was learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Ascension automatic mastery unlock: Master ascension:blood_blade. The server checks these unlocks during player ticks. Keep the skill enabled in server settings and allow the learning check to run; failed repeated attempts are throttled to once per 60 seconds.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Blood Blade (ascension:blood_blade) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master ascension:blood_blade.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB Quests can confirm the resulting skill. Race-state tracking depends on the TenSura FTB integration.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Blood Manipulation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Current race: Blood Noble — optional progress aid&r"
		"&f• Master: Blood Blade — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.553E26AF75A2FF56.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • Ascension"
	quest.553E26AF75A2FF56.title: "Blood Manipulation"
