	quest.556164DA6853CA47.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fPossess a weakened material body to gain access to a whole new world.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: master AspectualMagics.POSSESSION.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fArch Daemon (tensura:arch_daemon); Greater Daemon (tensura:greater_daemon); Lesser Daemon (tensura:lesser_daemon)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fArch Angel (mysticism:arch_angel); Arch Daemon (tensura:arch_daemon); Arch Fallen of Origin (trorigins:arch_fallen_of_origin); Ascended (mysticism:ascended); Beholder (ascension:beholder); Chaotic Deity (ascension:chaotic_deity)&r"
		"&fCherub (mysticism:cherub); Daemon Lord (tensura:daemon_lord); Death Tyrant (ascension:death_tyrant); Demon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); Devil Lord (tensura:devil_lord); Divine Elemental (mysticism:divine_elemental)&r"
		"&fDivine Excelsius (mysticism:divine_excelsius); Divine Inferius (mysticism:divine_inferius); Divine Majin Elemental (mysticism:divine_majin_elemental); Divine Tengu (mysticism:divine_tengu); Divine Wisp (stextras:divine_wisp); Elemental Lord (mysticism:elemental_lord)&r"
		"&fEmpty (mysticism:empty); Fallen Angel (ascension:fallen_angel); Fallen Arch Angel of Origin (trorigins:fallen_origin_arch_angel); Fallen Cherub of Origin (trorigins:fallen_cherub_of_origin); Fallen Lord of Origin (trorigins:fallen_lord_of_origin); Fallen Seraph of Origin (trorigins:fallen_seraph_of_origin)&r"
		"&fFallen of Origin (trorigins:fallen_of_origin); Field Officer (mysticism:field_officer); Forgotten (mysticism:forgotten); Gale Wisp (stextras:gale_wisp); Gauth (ascension:gauth); General (mysticism:general)&r"
