	quest.556EEA057B4216C3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f200,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eRequired ability/skill: &fSpace Transform"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fVoid Dragonewt&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 200,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Master Space Transform (tensura:space_transform). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Travel to the End and attempt the evolution there. The installed condition requires your current dimension to be minecraft:the_end.&r"
		"&f4. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 200,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Master: Space Transform — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Ender Dragonewt — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.556EEA057B4216C3.quest_subtitle: "Special / Non-standard Race • Ascension"
	quest.556EEA057B4216C3.title: "Ender Dragonewt"
	quest.556FEBF459625281.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fDash and pierce the opponent in five of ten vital points and uses the other five as feints.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Gazel Dwargo. On the player's first eligible Gazel kill, his death event rolls a 10% drop for a bound Five Petals Thrust Battlewill Manual. Hold use for at least 10 ticks to learn it; the manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fGazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fUnlocks Eight Petals Flash (tensura:eight_petals_flash): Master Five Petals Thrust.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.556FEBF459625281.quest_subtitle: "Melee Battlewill Arts • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.556FEBF459625281.title: "Five Petals Thrust"
	quest.55726B0CC15C8384.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Ignited Berserker 25 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+100 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.55726B0CC15C8384.title: "Ignited Berserker: 25 Kills"
	quest.55890067DC257203.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eBase maximum EP: &f80,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eHoly Essence used: &f10&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fLesser Goddess&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, or Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lStep-by-step Holy Essence route&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to 80,000. Equipment and temporary EP can make the quest tracker finish early, so verify the evolution menu itself accepts your EP.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Complete a &eTR: Nightmare Human Raid &for &eTR: Nightmare Direwolf Raid&f. These are addon raids, not Minecraft village raids. Each successful reward roll has a 75% chance to give 2–5 Holy Essence.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Alternative: defeat &eSentient Masayuuki&f. Its confirmed loot entry has a 50% chance to drop 2–10 Holy Essence.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Right-click/use all 10 Holy Essence. The evolution checks the item-used statistic; carrying ten in your inventory does nothing, and the used items are consumed.&r"
		""
		"&f5. Reopen the TenSura evolution menu and select Medium Goddess.&r"
		""
		"&3&lTracker limitation&r"
		"&fFTB Quests can track your EP and final race, but it cannot reliably read TR: Nightmare's private Holy Essence item-use condition. If the evolution remains locked, confirm that you used ten rather than merely collected ten.&r"
	]
	quest.55890067DC257203.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.55890067DC257203.title: "Medium Goddess"
