	quest.55BE4D7854F09085.title: "Elfaria, The Hallowed Icemaiden"
	quest.55BF7B8281969B78.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe land itself answers. Raise the earth to impale and to bind, reshape the ground your people hold, coax ore from bare stone, and draw the world's own magicule into yourself. Strongest where your nation's banner flies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Earth Wall (tensura:earth_wall), then use Elite Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Stone Shot (tensura:stone_shot), then use Elite Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Elite Ultimate acquisition: Learn and master every prerequisite: tensura:earth_wall, tensura:stone_shot. Reach at least 10,000,000 EP and awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. If the Elite nation gate is enabled and you are in a nation/team, reach nation level 10 or have at least 32 claimed chunks. Gain EP again so the normal skill-acquisition check runs. With the skill enabled, the addon grants the Ultimate automatically. When Elite nation requirements are enabled and you belong to a nation/team, also reach nation level 10 or claim 32 chunks.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Earth Wall (tensura:earth_wall) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		"&f• Stone Shot (tensura:stone_shot) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Elite requirementsEnabled=false bypasses the mastery/EP/awakening gate. When Elite nation requirements are enabled and you belong to a nation/team, also reach nation level 10 or claim 32 chunks.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Gaia, Lord of Earth — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000,000 — exact default Elite EP gate&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero gate&r"
		"&f• Master: Earth Wall — exact current mastery required by Elite&r"
		"&f• Master: Stone Shot — exact current mastery required by Elite&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.55BF7B8281969B78.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Elite Tensura"
	quest.55BF7B8281969B78.title: "Gaia, Lord of Earth"
