	quest.563020A996A9DE68.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA legacy skill representing the next-stage awakening of phoenix authority.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea), then use Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Astraea sub-ability creation: Obtain Astraea and place it in an active skill slot. Open Astraea's Blessing Creation mode and choose this Laguna-line skill from the offered list. Confirm creation. It is stored and used as an Astraea sub-ability; it is not learned as a separate permanent player skill.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea) through Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Astraea; choose target in Blessing Creation; create as sub-ability.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8The normal FTB ability task cannot see sub-ability slots; the quest uses an Astraea prerequisite plus a manual confirmation instead.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
