	quest.5661D59BB0B4F44C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fDeal damage from afar while using different bullets to get past resistances and ensure a quick kill.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare boss-drop route:&f personally defeat the Sentient Boss Glenda. The skill is rolled from that boss's configured reward list; its chance is half of TenSura's configured Otherworlder skill-drop percentage, so the kill is not guaranteed to award it.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sniper — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.5661D59BB0B4F44C.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.5661D59BB0B4F44C.title: "Sniper"
	quest.566427B6B9463148.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts the power of Dark abilities by a large amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above 2,000,000; then master ExtraMysticismSkills.DARKNESS_MANIPULATION.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Abyss grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fFallen (mysticism:fallen)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Darkness Domination — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.566427B6B9463148.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • Mysticism"
	quest.566427B6B9463148.title: "Darkness Domination"
	quest.567571FD2EF3807B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f150,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fKindred Bloodfiend&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fElder Bloodfiend&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 150,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 150,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Blood Noble — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
