	quest.56E42EB36216883F.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.56E42EB36216883F.title: "Witch's Envy"
	quest.56E86CB38D027A49.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe Domination of Pure Energy, Separation of Concepts, and the Prevention of Interference.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess trnightmare:saint. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Saint (trnightmare:saint), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Saint (trnightmare:saint) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Surya, King of Brillance ｣ (trnightmare:surya) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Nun Manas (trnightmare:nun_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Saint (trnightmare:saint)&r"
		"&f• Win 7 village raids&r"
		"&f• Master 5 Holy Magic spells&r"
		"&f• Master Saint (trnightmare:saint).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 950,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Metatron, Lord of Purity ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Saint — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Village raids won: 7 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 950,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.56E86CB38D027A49.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.56E86CB38D027A49.title: "｢ Metatron, Lord of Purity ｣"
	quest.570B9F627E82D042.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§6Sunshine §3is a Unique Skill of the §cDestruction §3and §eEnchantment §3Types. It radiates overwhelming heat and light, empowering the user as the sun rises, reaching its peak at noon. During this time, the user's destructive power and enchanted abilities surge to their maximum potential, turning them into an unstoppable force under the daylight.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §6Sunshine — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.570B9F627E82D042.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.570B9F627E82D042.title: "Sunshine"
