		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 180,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Master Flame Manipulation (tensura:flame_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Master Profaned Prominence (mysticism:profaned_prominence). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f4. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 180,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Master: Flame Manipulation — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Master: Profaned Prominence — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Scorchtail Salamander — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
