	quest.57B38548D87F475C.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Mysticism"
	quest.57B38548D87F475C.title: "Scorchtail Salamander"
	quest.57C77AE1D2C5F064.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Lightning abilities by a decent amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: reach Wind Spirit level 1. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fCharged Perforator (mysticism:charged_perforator); Dissonance Deity (mysticism:dissonance_deity); Lightning Aberration (mysticism:lightning_aberration); Lightning Soul Insect (mysticism:lightning_soul_insect); Overloading Worm (mysticism:overloading_worm); Storm Spirit Wolf (mysticism:storm_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&fTempest Star Wolf (mysticism:tempest_star_wolf)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Lightning Domination (tensura:lightning_domination) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:lightning_manipulation; possess tensura:lightning_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Lightning Domination (tensura:lightning_domination) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:lightning_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:lightning_domination.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Lightning Manipulation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.57C77AE1D2C5F064.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.57C77AE1D2C5F064.title: "Lightning Manipulation"
