	quest.58CD9F16CCAE92C1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUtilize your years of experience to create masterpieces with ease and engrave your weapons for terrifying efficiency.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master tensura:researcher. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Amatsumara, Lord of Crafts ｣ (trnightmare:amatsumara) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Hephaestus, Lord of Creation (elitetensura:hephaestus) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		"&f• Raphael, Lord of Wisdom (elitetensura:raphealskill) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
