	quest.5902E616EDFD1494.title: "Legioner: 25 Kills"
	quest.590777A239E59E82.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe crops, the wild, everything was there for you. You sow the seeds and wish only for a bountiful harvest. And in turn, the crops bless you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Gardener — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.590777A239E59E82.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
	quest.590777A239E59E82.title: "Gardener"
	quest.590A164B4F8BECCC.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fShoot fiery lances of magic.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Common Burnt.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Medium Basic.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fDragon Clone Velgrynd (trnightmare:dragon_clone_velgrynd); Echo of Tyros, First Flamebearer (irons_spellbooks:fire_boss); Greater Angel (trnightmare:greater_angel); Greater Daemon (tensura:greater_daemon)&r"
		"&fGreater Fallen (trnightmare:greater_fallen); Greater Phantom (trnightmare:greater_phantom); Primordial Blanc (trnightmare:sentient_boss_blanc); Velgrynd Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_velgrynd)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.590A164B4F8BECCC.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.590A164B4F8BECCC.title: "Fire Lance"
	quest.59126B28650790A3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&fThis race does not use the usual EP or item requirement list. Follow its route below."
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 120,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Drain 400 total blood through the Blood Arts blood-drain mechanics. This is the mod's cumulative totalBloodDrained value, not your current stored-blood amount.&r"
		"&f3. Successfully turn 5 mobs or consenting players into kindred with Blood Arts: Kindred Rite. This is the mod's cumulative totalThrallsTurned value.&r"
		"&f4. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 120,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Elder Bloodfiend — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
