	quest.5964DFEDE538C4D5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAnalyze living entities, then mimic learned forms and end the mimicry when needed.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Predator (tensura:predator), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Gluttony (tensura:gluttony), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with tensura:beelzebuth (tensura:beelzebuth), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f4. TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition: Master at least one configured source skill. Installed defaults allow Predator, Gluttony, or Beelzebuth. Gain EP so the acquisition check runs; possession without mastery is not enough for Predator/Gluttony/Beelzebuth.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Predator (tensura:predator) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Predator OR Gluttony OR Beelzebuth.&r"
		"&f• Gluttony (tensura:gluttony) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Predator OR Gluttony OR Beelzebuth.&r"
		"&f• tensura:beelzebuth (tensura:beelzebuth) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Predator OR Gluttony OR Beelzebuth.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Universal Shapeshift (trnightmare:universal_shapeshift) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Gluttony; possess Mimicry.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Mimicry — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
