	quest.5A1F30081585757D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBorn from the magicules of your peers, your growth depends on them and theirs depends on you. You are naturally more attuned to the absorption of energy from the environment.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Carnation (trnightmare:carnation) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sentient Being — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
