		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Magnetized Vacuum (ascension:magnetized_vacuum) through Ascension Eye of Mind analysis copy.&r &7Requirements: own Eye of Mind; analyze minecraft:iron_golem; successful 25%/50% copy roll.&r"
		"&f• Magicule Nourishment (ascension:magicule_nourishment) through Ascension Eye of Mind analysis copy.&r &7Requirements: own Eye of Mind; analyze minecraft:piglin_brute; successful 25%/50% copy roll.&r"
