	quest.5A5764B11D6E6B3B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f15,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 15,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 15,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Death Dragon — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.5A5764B11D6E6B3B.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • TR Origins"
	quest.5A5764B11D6E6B3B.title: "Death Dragon"
	quest.5A594BB04D0C6B77.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSee all, evade all. Instinctively avoid attacks, detect concealed dangers, and identify hidden entities. Nothing escapes your watchful gaze.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Second-skill roll: this skill is also in the higher-priority second Unique Skill pool when that configured roll occurs.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fShin Ryusei (tensura:shin_ryusei)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Observer — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.5A594BB04D0C6B77.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
