	quest.5A78019C0DAFBA61.title: "Divine General Mahoraga"
	quest.5A9254FCDBA4704F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f100× Magic Ore"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fSlime&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDemon Slime&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Obtain 100 x Magic Ore (tensura:magic_ore_shard): Mine TenSura Magic Ore or Deepslate Magic Ore; both drop Magic Ore Shards. Metal Slimes also drop 5-8 before Looting. Then eat/use all 100; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Current race: Metal Slime — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.5A9254FCDBA4704F.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.5A9254FCDBA4704F.title: "Metal Slime"
	quest.5A964D80179DF252.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fProtect yourself with a multitude of powerful defensive barriers.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Ranged Barrier (tensura:ranged_barrier), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fRimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); Ferrous Wroughtnaut (mowziesmobs:ferrous_wroughtnaut); Lich (twilightforest:lich); Sculptor (mowziesmobs:sculptor); Sun Spirit (aether:sun_spirit); The Leviathan (cataclysm:the_leviathan); Underworld Knight (block_factorys_bosses:underworld_knight); Ur Ghast (twilightforest:ur_ghast)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fApostle (trvirtuoso:apostle); Disciple (trvirtuoso:disciple); Jedidiah (trvirtuoso:jedidiah)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Ranged Barrier (tensura:ranged_barrier) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:ranged_barrier; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:multilayer_barrier.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Hastur, Lord of Starwind ｣ (trnightmare:hastur) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Uriel, Lord of Oaths ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_oath) through TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis.&r &7Requirements: master four component skills; 375,000 Magicules; valid non-imprinted component instances.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Multilayer Barrier — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.5A964D80179DF252.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.5A964D80179DF252.title: "Multilayer Barrier"
