		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 250,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. While your current race is Wight and you have at least 250,000 current EP, hold a vanilla Heart of the Sea (minecraft:heart_of_the_sea) and use/right-click it. Ascension consumes one, records its private ascension:cursed_heart flag, and immediately evolves you into Cursed Mariner.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 250,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Carry 1 × minecraft:heart_of_the_sea — preparation only: exact current inventory, but the item is consumed and the private completion flag has no FTB task&r"
		"&f• Current race: Cursed Mariner — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
