	quest.5B385D8FCEE0882B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&fThis race does not use the usual EP or item requirement list. Follow its route below."
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Find another player who is already a Bloodfiend. They must use the Blood Arts skill's Kindred Rite mode on you while you are alive and within range; accept the mod's player-turning consent request. On success the mod replaces your race with Bloodfiend and records that player as your blood master.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Current race: Bloodfiend — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.5B385D8FCEE0882B.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • TenSura More Skills"
	quest.5B385D8FCEE0882B.title: "Bloodfiend"
	quest.5B3A9ECD280C620B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBecome immune to damage from Magic, Skills and Battlewill, destroy barriers and block skill usage of other entities.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fYuuki Kagurazaka (tensura_guild:yuuki_kagurazaka)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Anti-Skill — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.5B3A9ECD280C620B.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.5B3A9ECD280C620B.title: "Anti-Skill"
	quest.5B3E958D8DEF51C1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCuriosity has always been your strong suit, learning came easy, and teaching just as much. You find yourself able to see and touch the information of the world itself.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess trnightmare:investigator. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Investigator (trnightmare:investigator), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Investigator (trnightmare:investigator) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Nyarlathotep, King of Chaos ｣ (trnightmare:nyarlathotep) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Investigator (trnightmare:investigator)&r"
		"&f• Use Investigator (trnightmare:investigator)'s `fullyInvestigated` mechanic until its internal counter reaches Math.max(0, faust.faustFulls - 1)&r"
		"&f• Master Investigator (trnightmare:investigator).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 750,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Faust, Lord of Investigation ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Investigator — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 750,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.5B3E958D8DEF51C1.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.5B3E958D8DEF51C1.title: "｢ Faust, Lord of Investigation ｣"
	quest.5B5FCDBFA43734C7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f1,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Daemon Essence"
