	quest.5D7B35694EEB6751.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Daemon Essence, 10× Dragon Essence, 10× Elemental Essence, 10× Royal Blood"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fGreater Chimera&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fLesser Chimera&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fChimera Lord&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Obtain 10 x Daemon Essence (tensura:daemon_essence): Defeat Arch Daemons (50%), Greater Daemons (10%), or Lesser Daemons (1%). It also appears in Hell Ruins chests and Hell Ruins archaeology. Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 10 x Dragon Essence (tensura:dragon_essence): Defeat Charybdis (1-3 guaranteed), a Basilisk (1%), or a Dragonewt-type Lizardman (25%). Lizardman throne/storage loot and Elite crates are additional sources. Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Obtain 10 x Elemental Essence (tensura:elemental_essence): Defeat Akash, Ifrit, Sylphide, Undine, or War Gnome (guaranteed). Several lesser elemental mobs and qualifying summoned Elemental Colossi have a 10% source. Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f4. Obtain 10 x Royal Blood (tensura:royal_blood): Defeat a Royal Orc (25%), Orc Lord (50%), or Orc Disaster (guaranteed). Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f5. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Current race: Golden Chimera — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.5D7B35694EEB6751.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.5D7B35694EEB6751.title: "Golden Chimera"
	quest.5D9BC66F12F54561.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Sound abilities by a large amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: raise EP above dominationEpAcquirement (server-config value); then master tensura:sound_manipulation. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Sound Manipulation (tensura:sound_manipulation), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Sound Manipulation (tensura:sound_manipulation), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Sound Manipulation (tensura:sound_manipulation) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:sound_manipulation; possess tensura:sound_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Sound Manipulation (tensura:sound_manipulation) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:sound_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:sound_domination.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Hastur, Lord of Starwind ｣ (trnightmare:hastur) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sound Domination — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
