	quest.5DE511206653E286.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe evolved Raphael. Knowledge converges into wisdom: enhanced synthesis, advanced refinement, protected cognition, and complete tactical execution through Ego or Manas integration.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:great_sage; then possess tensura:degenerate; then possess tensura:sage; then possess tensura:chant_annulment. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Great Sage (tensura:great_sage), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Degenerate (tensura:degenerate), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Great Sage (tensura:great_sage) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Degenerate (tensura:degenerate) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Azathoth, God of The Void ｣ (trnightmare:azathoth) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Wise Manas (trnightmare:wise_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		"&f• Future Attack Prediction (trnightmare:future_attack_prediction) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: own either Raphael branch; kill Hinata at least once.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Great Sage (tensura:great_sage)&r"
		"&f• Master Degenerate (tensura:degenerate)&r"
		"&f• Master 35 total skills&r"
		"&f• Win 10 village raids&r"
		"&f• Name 15 subordinates&r"
		"&f• Learn/own Chant Annulment (tensura:chant_annulment).&r"
		"&f• Learn/own Sage (tensura:sage).&r"
		"&f• Master Degenerate (tensura:degenerate).&r"
		"&f• Master Great Sage (tensura:great_sage).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 250,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		"&f• Version note: this pack's TR: Nightmare 1.0.3.2.8 config requires 250,000 maximum Magicules. The current public wiki lists 900,000 for another/current ruleset; this quest follows the authoritative installed JAR.&r"
		"&f• Raid requirement: win 10 standard vanilla Minecraft raids. The tracker reads minecraft:raid_win; TenSura raid events and addon boss fights do not count.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Great Sage — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Degenerate — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Skills mastered (lifetime counter): 35 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Village raids won: 10 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Learn: Chant Annulment — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sage — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 250,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.5DE511206653E286.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.5DE511206653E286.title: "｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣"
	quest.5DEA1B94AED6DA0F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYou shan't take severing damage, and forever will you heal.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
