	quest.5DF63A01DEB1B60C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTrap enemies in an unbreakable dimensional cage or shield yourself from any threat with your dimensional barrier. Gain access to spatial storage.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Uriel, Lord of Vows ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_vow) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Michael, Angel of Locks (tensuramoreskills:michael_angel_of_locks) through MoreSkills Michael natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Infinity Prison; possess Suppressor; maximum Magicule > 5,000,000 x MP_SKILL_COST/100.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Uriel, Lord of Oaths ｣ (trnightmare:uriel_lord_of_oath) through TR: Nightmare Alteration synthesis.&r &7Requirements: master four component skills; 375,000 Magicules; valid non-imprinted component instances.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Infinity Prison — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.5DF63A01DEB1B60C.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.5DF63A01DEB1B60C.title: "Infinity Prison"
	quest.5E031E3A2B9A77F2.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f400,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fLoxodrome Scorpion&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fLoxodrome Scorpion Insectar&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fScorpion&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDivine Loxodrome Scorpion&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 400,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Learn Ranged Barrier (tensura:ranged_barrier). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 400,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Learn: Ranged Barrier — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Poison Soul Insect — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
