	quest.5E3BBB216B6563EC.title: "Bluff: First Kill"
	quest.5E47C888A073D039.quest_desc: [
		"&fMultiplayer: make sure the playerNaming gamerule is enabled. The player receiving the name crouches and presses the TenSura Naming key (N by default) until naming is enabled. A second player then stands within six blocks, aims at them, presses the Naming key, chooses the name and naming tier, and pays the displayed Magicule cost. If the menu refuses to open, the target is already named or owned, is not accepting names, is affected by Insanity or Rampage, or has too much EP to submit; lowering the target below 25% health is the simplest normal way to satisfy submission.&r"
		""
		"&fSolo with TR: Nightmare: use /trnightmare setSelfName <name> to save the name you want. Then either win 25 ordinary Minecraft village raids, or kill 1,000 recognized human targets without dying. Villagers, raiders, witches, players, and the listed TenSura human NPCs count; the 1,000-kill total resets when you respawn. After meeting either route, defeat another creature or gain permanent EP so the naming check runs. Your existence must still be nameable, unnamed, and have no permanent owner.&r"
		""
		"&fThe 25-raid branch is tracked beside this quest. TR: Nightmare stores the one-life human total and the final named state in private player data, so FTB Quests cannot read those two values reliably; use this manual completion only after your TenSura name appears.&r"
	]
	quest.5E47C888A073D039.title: "Earn Your Name: Multiplayer or Solo"
	quest.5E64AA79B90511EF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUnique flame skill: pyromaniac aspectuals, paradox white fire, After World, and white-flame coating.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Belial, Lord of The Dead ｣ (trnightmare:belial) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Freezing Flame — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
