	quest.5EB1E559BC95DCFE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f1,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fLesser Saiyan&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fMedium Class Saiyan&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDivine Saiyan&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 1,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 1,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: High Class Saiyan — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
