	quest.5EC311629254AE3B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f10,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eRequired ability/skill: &fIs Mountain"
		"&eMysticism-specific evolution condition"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fDirewolf&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fStorm Spirit Wolf&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fTempest Star Wolf&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 10,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Learn Water Manipulation (tensura:water_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Learn Wind Manipulation (tensura:wind_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f4. Learn Spatial Manipulation (tensura:spatial_manipulation). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f5. Attempt the evolution while standing in a Mountain biome.&r"
		"&f6. Attempt at Y above 120.&r"
		"&f7. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Learn: Water Manipulation — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Learn: Wind Manipulation — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Learn: Spatial Manipulation — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Star Wolf — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.5EC311629254AE3B.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Mysticism"
	quest.5EC311629254AE3B.title: "Star Wolf"
	quest.5ED2818BF34FA644.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fToggle: at night, gain Strength III, Speed II, Haste II. Toggle: melee hits inflict Bleeding 6 for 4s (Bleeding 10 mastered). Modes: Bite (Paralysis IV / Blindness IV / Darkness IV + 20 blood damage on the target you're looking at, 25 mastered, 3s CD), Shift (toggle to half-size with 50% max HP and creative flight, 20s/10s CD), Health Drain (held: drain 10% / 20% of nearby enemies' current HP per second as blood damage in 6 blocks, 30s/10s CD).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Deus Sanguis — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
