	quest.5EE8EA31B600B928.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fLeviathan, Lord Of Envy is capable of absorbing the strength of all enemies, stealing their power to enhance itself, crippling foes with devastating effects, and improving its user endlessly by stealing the might of others.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:envy. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Envy (tensura:envy), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Envy (tensura:envy) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Cthulhu, King of Divine Ice ｣ (trnightmare:cthulhu) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Envy Manas (trnightmare:envy_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Envy (tensura:envy)&r"
		"&f• Win 5 village raids&r"
		"&f• Master Envy (tensura:envy).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,500,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Leviathan, Lord of Envy ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Envy — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Village raids won: 5 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,500,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.5EE8EA31B600B928.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.5EE8EA31B600B928.title: "｢ Leviathan, Lord of Envy ｣"
