	quest.5EFA93B7FD5FBCDB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§5The ultimate master of space and time — usurp, sever, imprison, stop time, and empower allies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Yog-Sothoth, Lord of Space-Time ｣ (trnightmare:yog_sothoth), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Yog-Sothoth, Lord of Space-Time ｣ (trnightmare:yog_sothoth) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Spacetime Domination (trnightmare:spacetime_domination) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Yog-Sothoth, Lord of Space-Time ｣ (trnightmare:yog_sothoth)&r"
		"&f• Set the player progression flag `hasCourage` to true through its associated gameplay event&r"
		"&f• Set the player progression flag `hasHope` to true through its associated gameplay event&r"
		"&f• Set the player progression flag `hasJustice` to true through its associated gameplay event&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 2,501,000&r"
		"&f• Have at least 10,000,000 EP&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 2,501,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare God Skills gamerule must also be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• For non-creative players, this God-class skill must not already have another world owner; the successful evolution claims its ownership record.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Yog-Sotohort, God of Space-Time ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Yog-Sothoth, Lord of Space-Time ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 2,501,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000,000 — exact maximum EP value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
