	quest.60ED8CA0B2825B4B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAbsorb all in your path. None can win. Receive and provide skills, gain access to a spatial storage and mimic entities.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony ｣ (trnightmare:beelzebuth) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony (elitetensura:beelzebuth) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		"&f• Mimicry (trnightmare:mimicry) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Predator OR Gluttony OR Beelzebuth.&r"
		"&f• Universal Shapeshift (trnightmare:universal_shapeshift) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Gluttony; possess Mimicry.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Gluttony — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.60ED8CA0B2825B4B.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.60ED8CA0B2825B4B.title: "Gluttony"
	quest.6129393948667857.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGreatly enhance the caster's movement speed.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Common Rotted.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Medium Rare.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.6129393948667857.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
