		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess StarlightUniqueSkills.LIGHT_REMAINS.get(); then possess StarlightUniqueSkills.VESTIGES_OF_EIDOLONS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
