	quest.6179496A725C244B.title: "The Prowler: 50 Kills"
	quest.619D3C67F9FAED88.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§oConcentrate your thoughts on death, for only in dying is life.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master StarlightUniqueSkills.LIGHT_REMAINS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Life Returns — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.619D3C67F9FAED88.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.619D3C67F9FAED88.title: "Life Returns"
	quest.619EE1DD64623686.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA holy magic that isolates a target from outside interference and support.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Rare Buried, Rare Rotted, Rare Ruined.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.619EE1DD64623686.quest_subtitle: "Other \\& Addon Magic • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.619EE1DD64623686.title: "Isolate"
	quest.61AAAF6AC250BE96.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Goblin 10 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+75 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.61AAAF6AC250BE96.title: "Goblin: 10 Kills"
	quest.61BA169392C5115B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCall forth small amounts of water.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Common Frozen.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Low Basic.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fLesser Daemon (tensura:lesser_daemon); Veldora Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_veldora)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.61BA169392C5115B.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.61BA169392C5115B.title: "Water"
	quest.61C94D2F1D03AD98.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBlink onto your target and unleash a rapid multi-hit combo.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.61C94D2F1D03AD98.quest_subtitle: "Advanced \\& Addon Battlewill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.61C94D2F1D03AD98.title: "Barrage Strike"
	quest.61CAB15F2C1A9E12.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Sorrow Pot 5 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+50 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.61CAB15F2C1A9E12.title: "Sorrow Pot: 5 Kills"
	quest.61D02D4259C42596.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fEmpower your body by a massive amount but beware the aftereffects. &r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDivine Fighter (tensura:divine_fighter)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Divine Berserker — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.61D02D4259C42596.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.61D02D4259C42596.title: "Divine Berserker"
	quest.61F5281B3C7D5ABA.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSummons a viscous sandstorm and falling rocks around you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Medium-or-higher Earth spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Earth Spiritual Magic through Medium, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Earth. Minimum contract level: Medium. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fGazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.61F5281B3C7D5ABA.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.61F5281B3C7D5ABA.title: "Earth Storm"
	quest.61F9D3BFC6473C91.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weak corrosive effects or reduce the damage from stronger corrosive attacks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fCarrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Memoires (mysticism:memoires)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fCorrosion Soul Insect (mysticism:corrosion_soul_insect); Demon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); God Slime (tensura:god_slime); Metal Slime (tensura:metal_slime)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Corrosion Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.61F9D3BFC6473C91.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.61F9D3BFC6473C91.title: "Corrosion Resistance"
