	quest.6243DD0C010D1748.title: "Cosmic Deity"
	quest.6246FD62E8F84FDB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7A unique skill that amplifies your cause. §fEncore§7 bolsters barriers and battle poise; §fStockpile§7 charges your next strike with flame and lightning.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare boss-drop route:&f personally defeat the Sentient Boss Velgrynd. The skill is rolled from that boss's configured reward list; its chance is half of TenSura's configured Otherworlder skill-drop percentage, so the kill is not guaranteed to award it.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raguel, Lord of Charity ｣ (trnightmare:raguel) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Endorse — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6246FD62E8F84FDB.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.6246FD62E8F84FDB.title: "Endorse"
	quest.624B7540DC4697B9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fInstantly restores your Aura to maximum capacity.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: satisfy the skill's built-in automatic acquisition check. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Rest — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
