	quest.6281717F0B4A2FB3.title: "Rimeblight Hydra"
	quest.628530FE2E188536.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fToggle: +25% magicule regen (+50% mastered). Auto-learned once Magicule Resonance is mastered.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Magicule Resonance (ascension:magicule_resonance), then use Ascension automatic mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension automatic mastery unlock: Master ascension:magicule_resonance. The server checks these unlocks during player ticks. Keep the skill enabled in server settings and allow the learning check to run; failed repeated attempts are throttled to once per 60 seconds.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Magicule Resonance (ascension:magicule_resonance) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master ascension:magicule_resonance.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Mysticism Restricted causes Energy Charge, Maximum Charge, Magicule Attunement, Magicule Resonance and Magicule Dominion to be removed.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Magicule Dominion — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Magicule Resonance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
