	quest.63F9D7E33AD1BD5B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAstraea's final holy evolution. Complete the heroic tasks to awaken faith itself and command divine blessings through spiritrons.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess trnightmare:astraea. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea)&r"
		"&f• Master Hero Haki (tensura:hero_haki)&r"
		"&f• Learn ｢ True Hero, King of Champions ｣ (trnightmare:true_hero)&r"
		"&f• Have at least 30,000,000 current EP&r"
		"&f• Raise custom statistic trnightmare:zehirete_dragon_slays to 1&r"
		"&f• Raise custom statistic trnightmare:zehirete_demon_fells to 1&r"
		"&f• Raise custom statistic trnightmare:zehirete_phoenix_endures to 10&r"
		"&f• Learn/own ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 750,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare God Skills gamerule must also be enabled.&r"
		"&f• For non-creative players, this God-class skill must not already have another world owner; the successful evolution claims its ownership record.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Zehirete, God of Faith ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Hero Haki — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ True Hero, King of Champions ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Current EP: 30,000,000 — exact current EP value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• trnightmare:zehirete_dragon_slays: 1 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• trnightmare:zehirete_demon_fells: 1 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• trnightmare:zehirete_phoenix_endures: 10 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 750,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.63F9D7E33AD1BD5B.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.63F9D7E33AD1BD5B.title: "｢ Zehirete, God of Faith ｣"
