	quest.655FEB048D667461.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fWield the power to cut through any who stand in your path, whether by coating your strikes or launching slashing projectiles that sever all in their path.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare boss-drop route:&f personally defeat the Sentient Boss Masayuki. The skill is rolled from that boss's configured reward list; its chance is half of TenSura's configured Otherworlder skill-drop percentage, so the kill is not guaranteed to award it.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Absolute Severance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.655FEB048D667461.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.655FEB048D667461.title: "Absolute Severance"
	quest.65669C6D3BAA90E7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f900–1,200 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f400–600"
		"&eMagicules: &f500–600"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fWater Breathing, Hydraulic Propulsion"
		"&eRace modifiers: &fMax Health +4, Spiritual Health +20, Movement Speed -0.01"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fEnlightened Merfolk&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fMerfolk Saint&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 900. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 900 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Merfolk — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.65669C6D3BAA90E7.quest_subtitle: "Starting Reincarnation • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.65669C6D3BAA90E7.title: "Merfolk"
