	quest.65D3ADC87ACA1773.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.65D3ADC87ACA1773.title: "Airflow Shut"
	quest.65D46C6D136F65FD.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCreates a powerful storm of ice to slow your enemies and turn the tides of battle.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Greater-or-higher Water spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Water Spiritual Magic through Greater, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Water. Minimum contract level: Greater. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fHinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.65D46C6D136F65FD.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.65D46C6D136F65FD.title: "Blizzard"
	quest.65DEF0B477EAC47A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weaker poisons or reduce the damage from more potent toxins.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fApothecarist (irons_spellbooks:apothecarist); Aqua Frog (tensura:aqua_frog); Carrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Memoires (mysticism:memoires); Phantaspore (tensura:phantaspore); The Dead King (irons_spellbooks:dead_king); Sandworm (block_factorys_bosses:sandworm)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAbyssal Tiefling (trarcane:abyssal_tiefling); Giant Elder (trnightmare:giant_elder); Higher Fairy (trnightmare:higher_fairy); Poison Soul Insect (mysticism:poison_soul_insect); Salamander (trnightmare:salamander); Salamander Assassin (trnightmare:salamander_assassin)&r"
		"&fSalamander Fire Spirit (trnightmare:salamander_fire_spirit); Salamander Fire Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:salamander_fire_dragon); Salamander Poison Spirit (trnightmare:salamander_poison_spirit); Salamander Poison Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:salamander_poison_dragon); Salamander Warlock (trnightmare:salamander_warlock)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Poison Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.65DEF0B477EAC47A.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.65DEF0B477EAC47A.title: "Poison Resistance"
	quest.65E7A9D60D45658C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lSpecial handling&r"
		"&fSome Elite Tensura titles are marked hidden and only reveal themselves through their intended chain. Unique titles can also use special ownership rules. The quest book does not expose secret title requirements or pretend that a manual checkmark can unlock them.&r"
		""
		"&fUse the Codex after major milestones. If a visible title does not unlock, compare every listed requirement and confirm the ETTitleSystem game rule is enabled.&r"
