	quest.6689BF4D0BF99185.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weaker heat-based damage or reduce the damage from stronger heat sources.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Scorch grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fCarrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Gazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Memoires (mysticism:memoires); Warden (minecraft:warden); Cinder Adder (cataclysm:cinder_adder); Fire Minion (aether:fire_minion); Tower Ghast (twilightforest:tower_ghast); Umvuthana Raptor (mowziesmobs:umvuthana_raptor); Ur Ghast (twilightforest:ur_ghast)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fCharged Perforator (mysticism:charged_perforator); Demon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); Dissonance Deity (mysticism:dissonance_deity); Divine Netherite Dragon (trnightmare:divine_netherite_dragon); Enflamed Aberration (mysticism:enflamed_aberration); God Slime (tensura:god_slime)&r"
		"&fLesser Nether Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_nether_dragon); Lightning Aberration (mysticism:lightning_aberration); Magma Worm (mysticism:magma_worm); Medium Nether Dragon (trnightmare:medium_nether_dragon); Metal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Molten Perforator (mysticism:molten_perforator)&r"
		"&fNetherite Dragon (trnightmare:netherite_dragon); Overloading Worm (mysticism:overloading_worm); Scorchtail Salamander (mysticism:scorchtail_salamander); Scorchtalon Wyvern (mysticism:scorchtalon_wyvern); Scrap Dragon (trnightmare:scrap_dragon); Violence Deity (mysticism:violence_deity)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Heat Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
