	quest.66E508611466807F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fEmpower and command your allies, and then collect their abilities once they pass on.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Charm (tensura:charm), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fFolgen (tensura:folgen)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Charm (tensura:charm) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 2).&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Tenebrosum, God of Souls ｣ (trnightmare:tenebrosum) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Spearhead — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.66E508611466807F.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.66E508611466807F.title: "Spearhead"
