	quest.683B84D2EC3C4045.title: "Venom Lord"
	quest.684496C6CC0D2D04.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTake everything. Conquer the world and your enemies with it. Kill anyone who stands in your path while strengthening yourself or your allies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Charm (tensura:charm), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare boss-drop route:&f personally defeat the Sentient Boss Mariabell Rosso. The skill is rolled from that boss's configured reward list; its chance is half of TenSura's configured Otherworlder skill-drop percentage, so the kill is not guaranteed to award it.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fYuuki Kagurazaka (tensura_guild:yuuki_kagurazaka)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Charm (tensura:charm) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Mammon, Lord of Greed ｣ (trnightmare:mammon) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Greed — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.684496C6CC0D2D04.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.684496C6CC0D2D04.title: "Greed"
	quest.685666AF6847AEF8.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYou seem to have awakened a tinker skill for your efforts in engineering and technology, handler hmm§ I wonder what you can optimize.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
