		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fGreater Glacier Wyrm&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Obtain 1 x Ice Essence (mysticism:ice_essence): Defeat Undine (guaranteed), or mine Mysticism Ice Ore for its configured ore drop. Then eat/use all 1; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Current race: Lesser Glacier Wyrm — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
