	quest.698B1172982B3B80.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe Voice of the World given form — a battlefield-computation entity. Analysis unlocks everything: prediction, barriers, reverse-engineering, and Raphael's own counsel.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Great Sage (tensura:great_sage), then use Elite Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Godly Craftsman (tensura:godly_craftsman), then use Elite Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Elite Ultimate acquisition: Learn and master every prerequisite: tensura:great_sage, tensura:godly_craftsman. Reach at least 10,000,000 EP and awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. Gain EP again so the normal skill-acquisition check runs. With the skill enabled, the addon grants the Ultimate automatically.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Great Sage (tensura:great_sage) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		"&f• Godly Craftsman (tensura:godly_craftsman) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Elite requirementsEnabled=false bypasses the mastery/EP/awakening gate.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Raphael, Lord of Wisdom — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000,000 — exact default Elite EP gate&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero gate&r"
		"&f• Master: Great Sage — exact current mastery required by Elite&r"
		"&f• Master: Godly Craftsman — exact current mastery required by Elite&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.698B1172982B3B80.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Elite Tensura"
	quest.698B1172982B3B80.title: "Raphael, Lord of Wisdom"
	quest.6994822AAAEEE594.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fStudy ancient magic tomes, reverse engineer them, and create wonders beyond imagination.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Second-skill roll: this skill is also in the higher-priority second Unique Skill pool when that configured roll occurs.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Researcher — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6994822AAAEEE594.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.6994822AAAEEE594.title: "Researcher"
	quest.69ACDA91DEC5070C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fEnhance cognitive processing, analyze targets and phenomena, accelerate magic casting and deepen understanding of the laws of the world to optimize all actions.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Second-skill roll: this skill is also in the higher-priority second Unique Skill pool when that configured roll occurs.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with Sage (tensura:sage), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Sage (tensura:sage) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:sage; possess tensura:sage, tensura:chant_annulment, tensura:farsight, tensura:telepathy, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:magic_jamming, tensura:flame_domination, tensura:poison, tensura:analytical_apprasial; pay 1,050,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 3).&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Analyst — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.69ACDA91DEC5070C.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.69ACDA91DEC5070C.title: "Analyst"
	quest.69AF2C3BCBFE05A7.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat War Gnome 10 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
