	quest.69E46D96AF5BEAFF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCommand the tempest infused flames to spew out black flames at your enemies or even shoot deadly fireballs and hell flares.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: master tensura:flame_transform; then possess tensura:black_lightning; then possess tensura:molecular_manipulation. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fRimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); Veldora Tempest (tensura_neb:veldora)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fCursed Dragon (ascension:cursed_dragon); Demon Dragon God (ascension:demon_dragon_god); Demonic Dragon (ascension:demonic_dragon); High-Class Demon (trnightmare:high_class_demon)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Black Flame — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
