	quest.6AB9E4E90C6A5265.quest_desc: [
		"&fTenSura More Skills adds the Paths Gate and the Paths dimension. Locate or create the gate using the addon route documented in the skill and structure guides, then cross it.&r"
		""
		"&fCrossing into the Paths completes the visit, so test the gate and its return route before exploring farther.&r"
	]
	quest.6AB9E4E90C6A5265.title: "13. Walk the Paths"
	quest.6AC5E514F0768FD3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCompletely nullify all earth damage.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Earth grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fGravebound Colossus (elitetensura:gravebound_colossus); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Luminous Valentine (tensura_neb:luminous_valentine); War Gnome (tensura:war_gnome); Sandworm (block_factorys_bosses:sandworm); Sculptor (mowziesmobs:sculptor)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fGiant King (trnightmare:giant_king); Giant Queen (trnightmare:giant_queen); One Eyed God (trnightmare:one_eyed_god); True Fairy King (trnightmare:true_fairy_king)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Earth Attack Nullification — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6AC5E514F0768FD3.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.6AC5E514F0768FD3.title: "Earth Attack Nullification"
