		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fResist the effects of weaker abnormal conditions or reduce the severity of stronger ones.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fCarrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Echo of Tyros, First Flamebearer (irons_spellbooks:fire_boss); Gazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Laplace (tensura_guild:laplace); Luminous Valentine (tensura_neb:luminous_valentine); Maledictus (cataclysm:maledictus)&r"
		"&fMemoires (mysticism:memoires); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); The Dead King (irons_spellbooks:dead_king)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAccursed Goddess (trnightmare:accursed_goddess); Chthonic Tiefling (trarcane:chthonic_tiefling); Dark Fairy (trnightmare:dark_fairy); Daughter Of Light (trnightmare:daughter_of_light); Divine Soldier (trnightmare:divine_soldier); Goddess Princess (trnightmare:princess_of_goddess)&r"
		"&fHigh-Class Demon (trnightmare:high_class_demon); Higher Goddess (trnightmare:higher_class_goddess); Lance Corporal (trnightmare:lance_corporal); Lesser Ender Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_ender_dragon); Medium Ender Dragon (trnightmare:medium_ender_dragon); Mutant Giant (trnightmare:mutant_giant)&r"
		""
