	quest.6B9D4D70A9796C3F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fWise Ego combat assistant. Copilot toggles automatic skill use. Control awakens Wise Ego with preset-limited combat and no ego-kill on clone death.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Develop a Wise Ego to ego stage 3. Its server tick grants Auto Battle Mode automatically once stage 3 is reached.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Auto Battle Mode — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8The tracker verifies the resulting skill; addon-specific counters and random rolls are not exposed to FTB Quests.&r"
	]
