	quest.6BCABD959B64C74C.title: "Scorchtalon Wyvern"
	quest.6BCB4FD47E7DA362.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUse your inherent power to turn your opponents neutral or to temporarily dominate weak opponents.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Guaranteed kill grant (default config): defeat tensura_neb:luminous_valentine; the Skill Obtain addon awards this skill at 100% default chance.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fLuminous Valentine (tensura_neb:luminous_valentine)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&f3 Tailed Fox (ascension:three_tail_fox); 6 Tailed Fox (ascension:six_tail_fox); 9 Tailed Fox (ascension:nine_tail_fox); Ascended Djinn (ascension:ascended_djinn); Beholder (ascension:beholder); Blood Noble (ascension:blood_noble)&r"
		"&fDeath Tyrant (ascension:death_tyrant); Divine Fox (stextras:divine_fox); Divine Kitsune (ascension:divine_kitsune); Divine Saiyan (elitetensura:divine_saiyan); Divine Vampire (tensura:divine_vampire); Elder Bloodfiend (ascension:elder_bloodfiend)&r"
		"&fFairy Druid (trnightmare:fairy_druid); Gauth (ascension:gauth); Gazer (ascension:gazer); High Class Saiyan (elitetensura:high_saiyan); Infinite Djinn (ascension:infinite_djinn); Kitsune (ascension:kitsune)&r"
		"&fMedium Class Saiyan (elitetensura:medium_saiyan); Mindwitness (ascension:mindwitness); Ninetail (stextras:ninetail); Omniversal Djinn (ascension:omniversal_djinn); Phantom Djinn (ascension:phantom_djinn); Primordial Djinn (ascension:primordial_djinn)&r"
		"&fProgenitor Bloodfiend (ascension:progenitor_bloodfiend); Royal Djinn (ascension:royal_djinn); Sacred Tree Child (trnightmare:sacred_tree_child); Sovereign Djinn (ascension:sovereign_djinn); Spectator (ascension:spectator_gazer); Trickster Djinn (ascension:trickster_djinn)&r"
		"&fVampire (tensura:vampire); Vampire Lord (tensura:vampire_lord); Vampire Overcomer (tensura:vampire_overcomer); Whisper Djinn (ascension:whisper_djinn); Wishbound Djinn (ascension:wishbound_djinn)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Lust (tensura:lust) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Unyielding (tensura:unyielding) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Greed (tensura:greed) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Guardian (tensura:guardian) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 3).&r"
		"&f• Commander (tensura:commander) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 4).&r"
		"&f• Oppressor (tensura:oppressor) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 4).&r"
		"&f• Spearhead (tensura:spearhead) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 2).&r"
		"&f• Suppressor (tensura:suppressor) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:charm; possess tensura:haki, tensura:charm, tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:law_manipulation, tensura:spatial_domination; pay 1,250,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 4).&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Charm — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
