	quest.6BDE57C74D83E180.title: "Mystic Fox"
	quest.6BE02014C6B6435B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAn Ultimate Skill born from Granter through demonic authority. It governs subordinates through dominion, command, and extraction.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Granter (moostensuraaddon:granter), then use Moo's Tensura Addon — Granter evolution (True Demon Lord path). Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Moo's Tensura Addon — Granter evolution (True Demon Lord path): Master Granter, become a True Demon Lord, remain named, and reach at least 1,000,000 current EP plus 500,000 current Magicules. Have 10 mastered learned skills excluding Granter, complete 10 successful Granter grants, and gather or previously register 10 subordinates within the addon's recognition system. Wait for the automatic 100-tick check. The addon consumes 500,000 Magicules, removes Granter, learns Absolute Governance, and awards moostensuraaddon:path_of_governance. If both awakening flags somehow exist, the code tests True Demon Lord first.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Granter (moostensuraaddon:granter) through Moo's Tensura Addon — Granter evolution (True Demon Lord path).&r &7Requirements: Master Granter; be named; True Demon Lord; 1,000,000 current EP; 500,000 current Magicules (consumed); 10 other mastered Skills; 10 successful Granter grants; 10 nearby or recognized subordinates.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
