	quest.6BF63EC347289B09.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fLightning magic. Loose an arc at the target you are looking at; it leaps to nearby foes, dealing less damage with each jump and leaving them Glowing and slowed. When mastered, hold past the cast time to charge a longer, harder-hitting chain that arcs through more targets. Requires Thunder mastered to learn.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Reach 25,000 current EP, master Thunder Lance, and trigger an EP update. A bound tome is also possible because this magic is in FOUND_IN_TOME.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fEvolves/unlocks from: Thunder Lance. Reach 25,000 EP and master Thunder Lance.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.6BF63EC347289B09.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • Elite Tensura"
