	quest.6C2FED90DFDEC75F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUnleash pure rage and use it to get infinitely stronger the longer your anger persists. Beware of the devastating drawback.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Strength (tensura:strength), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare boss-drop route:&f personally defeat the Sentient Boss Milim Wrath. The skill is rolled from that boss's configured reward list; its chance is half of TenSura's configured Otherworlder skill-drop percentage, so the kill is not guaranteed to award it.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Strength (tensura:strength) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Satanael, Lord of Wrath ｣ (trnightmare:satanael) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Wrath — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6C2FED90DFDEC75F.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.6C2FED90DFDEC75F.title: "Wrath"
	quest.6C30A836AA3A8D48.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fActive: apply Regeneration Suppression to the target you're looking at (≤ 16 blocks) for 10s (20s mastered), force-disabling Self / Ultraspeed / Infinite Regeneration. CD 30s. Auto-learned when Magic Jamming is mastered and you've slain 30 Vexes.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Magic Jamming (tensura:magic_jamming), then use Ascension automatic mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension automatic mastery unlock: Master tensura:magic_jamming and defeat 30 Vexes. The server checks these unlocks during player ticks. Keep the skill enabled in server settings and allow the learning check to run; failed repeated attempts are throttled to once per 60 seconds.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Magic Jamming (tensura:magic_jamming) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:magic_jamming and defeat 30 Vexes.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Blockade — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Defeat 30 × minecraft:vex (forward-only) — forward-only FTB counter; it cannot prove reward availability or historical kills&r"
		"&f• Master: Magic Jamming — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
