	quest.6D6E371AD57D1669.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe ultimate evolution of Imitator. Act any target including ultimates, battlewills, and magics. Imprint disguise onto stage crew. Open the Gallery to acquire any learned skill.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Imitator (trnightmare:imitator), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Imitator (trnightmare:imitator) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Imitator (trnightmare:imitator)&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 750,000&r"
		"&f• Record 30 abilities in Imitator's catalog&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 750,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Artist, Authentic Writer ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Imitator — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 750,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6D6E371AD57D1669.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.6D6E371AD57D1669.title: "｢ Artist, Authentic Writer ｣"
	quest.6D73B513A53BC423.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f1,600,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eBoss kills: &f4 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fAxolotl Water Spirit&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 1,600,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Defeat 4 TenSura bosses. This evolution uses TenSura's lifetime boss-defeat count.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 1,600,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Bosses defeated: 4 — exact lifetime custom-stat counter; may predate this quest&r"
		"&f• Current race: Axolotl Water Spirit Dragon — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.6D73B513A53BC423.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.6D73B513A53BC423.title: "Axolotl Water Spirit Dragon"
	quest.6D73DB8F1F2B4489.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTrue Golden Rule. Expanded weapon and shield storehouses, shield wall, Ea, Golden Mythic Armor, and the treasury's full wrath.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess trnightmare:babylon. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Babylon (trnightmare:babylon), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Babylon (trnightmare:babylon) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Gilgamesh, God of Myth ｣ (trnightmare:gilgamesh_god_of_myth) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Babylon (trnightmare:babylon)&r"
		"&f• Have at least 2,000,000 EP&r"
		"&f• Contract with 6 Greater Spirits&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 800,000&r"
		"&f• Master Babylon (trnightmare:babylon).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 800,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Gilgamesh, Lord of Treasure ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Babylon — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,000,000 — exact maximum EP value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 800,000 — exact maximum-Magicule value used by the mod's condition&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6D73DB8F1F2B4489.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
