	quest.6DC230CFA25C6490.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGravity magic. Hold to warp space at the point you are aiming at, then release to collapse it into a crushing sphere that drags everything inside toward its centre, deals a fraction of each victim's max health every second, and smothers flight and dash escapes. When mastered, hold past the cast time to charge a wider, longer, harder-crushing well. Requires Burden mastered to learn.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Reach 50,000 current EP, master Burden, and trigger an EP update. A bound tome is also possible because this magic is in FOUND_IN_TOME.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fEvolves/unlocks from: Burden. Reach 50,000 EP and master Burden.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
