	quest.6E132FD9E91BB137.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIn-slot passive: 75% chance to evade incoming attacks and ignore standard dodge bypass. Press: Precognitive Movement priming your next incoming hit to be fully negated while dashing clear (3s cooldown).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Raphael, Lord of Knowledge ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_knowledge), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_wisdom), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition: Obtain either Raphael, Lord of Knowledge or Raphael, Lord of Wisdom. Personally defeat tensura:hinata_sakaguchi at least once, then gain EP to run the acquisition check.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raphael, Lord of Knowledge ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_knowledge) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: own either Raphael branch; kill Hinata at least once.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_wisdom) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: own either Raphael branch; kill Hinata at least once.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Future Attack Prediction — completes when you learn it&r"
