		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.6E32A65ABD1B845D.quest_subtitle: "Starting Reincarnation • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.6E32A65ABD1B845D.title: "Lesser Mystic Fox"
	quest.6E44E82B90FDB641.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fStriking out from the unknown has always been one of your talents, and now even the laws of the world itself find it hard to see your attacks from the dark side of the moon.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:shadow_striker. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Shadow Striker (tensura:shadow_striker), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Shadow Striker (tensura:shadow_striker) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Shadow Striker (tensura:shadow_striker)&r"
		"&f• Be at or below 0.5 of maximum HP when attempting evolution&r"
		"&f• Kill 500 mobs&r"
		"&f• Master Shadow Striker (tensura:shadow_striker).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 600,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Tsukiyomi, Lord of Moonshadow ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Shadow Striker — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Mobs killed: 500 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 600,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6E44E82B90FDB641.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.6E44E82B90FDB641.title: "｢ Tsukiyomi, Lord of Moonshadow ｣"
	quest.6E5AAEB3024C02B0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fShoot a giant icicle spear toward targets.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Rare Frozen.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Great Upgraded, High Upgraded.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fArch Angel (trnightmare:arch_angel); Arch Daemon (tensura:arch_daemon); Arch Fallen (trnightmare:arch_fallen); Arch Phantom (trnightmare:arch_phantom)&r"
		"&fLesser Angel (trnightmare:lesser_angel); Lesser Fallen (trnightmare:lesser_fallen); Lesser Phantom (trnightmare:lesser_phantom); Primordial Blanc (trnightmare:sentient_boss_blanc)&r"
		"&fPrimordial Bleu (trnightmare:sentient_boss_bleu); Primordial Jaune (trnightmare:sentient_boss_jaune); Primordial Vert (trnightmare:sentient_boss_vert); Primordial Violet (trnightmare:sentient_boss_violet)&r"
		"&fSentient Boss Noir (trnightmare:sentient_boss_noir); Sentient Boss Primordial Daemon (trnightmare:sentient_boss_primordial_daemon); Velzard Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_velzard)&r"
		"&fMay roll this ability when it spawns:&r"
		"&fSentient Boss Gii Crimson (trnightmare:sentient_boss_gii_crimson)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.6E5AAEB3024C02B0.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.6E5AAEB3024C02B0.title: "Ice Breaker"
	quest.6E7FE424D83E247D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fInspire your allies. Conscript allies in the dark. Copy abilities from your foes and Paste them onto allies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Hidden Ruler — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6E7FE424D83E247D.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
	quest.6E7FE424D83E247D.title: "Hidden Ruler"
	quest.6E8278AF749972E2.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fGrow beyond your normal size to gain increased strength and reach.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
