		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAncient Giant (tensura:ancient_giant); Bog Ancient (ascension:bog_ancient); Divine Giant (tensura:divine_giant); Frog Monarch (ascension:frog_monarch); Giant (tensura:giant); Giant Frog (ascension:giant_frog)&r"
		"&fInfinite Djinn (ascension:infinite_djinn); Omniversal Djinn (ascension:omniversal_djinn); Poison Toad (ascension:poison_toad); Swamp Sovereign (ascension:swamp_sovereign); Venom Lord (ascension:venom_lord)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Giantification — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
