	quest.6F01A0F6153DFA40.title: "Stick Steel Thread"
	quest.6F089555059C17F0.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fHold to enter a counter stance. Incoming attacks can be dodged, then punished on release with heavy retaliatory damage.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Master both abilities and trigger the usual acquisition check. The installed acquirement cost is 0.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fEvolves/unlocks from: Violent Break, Battlewill. Master Violent Break and Battlewill.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
