	quest.6F0922EFD64004BB.title: "Hero Route: Awaken as a True Hero"
	quest.6F114BE60020ACFC.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fActive: fire a crimson blade for 10 blood-attribute damage. Costs 1 HP — pays in blood, not magicule.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Ascension race intrinsic grant: Follow the Ascension race chapter and become the Blood Noble race (ascension:blood_noble). When that race is applied, its racial skill list automatically grants ascension:blood_blade. Open the skill menu after the race change and confirm the skill was learned.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Blood Manipulation (ascension:blood_manipulation) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master ascension:blood_blade.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB Quests can confirm the resulting skill. Race-state tracking depends on the TenSura FTB integration.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Blood Blade — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Current race: Blood Noble — optional progress aid&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6F114BE60020ACFC.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • Ascension"
	quest.6F114BE60020ACFC.title: "Blood Blade"
	quest.6F2BDBD231E38F66.quest_desc: [
		"&fPick a Battlewill art that complements your weapon and practice it until mastered. These are useful even for magic-heavy builds because they draw on a different part of your kit.&r"
		""
		"&fThis tracks TenSura's lifetime Battlewill-mastered statistic.&r"
	]
	quest.6F2BDBD231E38F66.title: "Master Your First Battlewill Art"
	quest.6F2E645F869CB1FE.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis chapter covers all &e44&f player-facing Resistance skills in the pack.&r"
		"&fEach page explains what the skill does, how to learn it, which mobs use it, which races grant it, and where it can evolve.&r"
		"&7Use the checkmark to mark a page as read. Automatic tasks only report progress; they never grant a skill.&r"
		"&7Learn and mastery tasks check your current character. Statistics may include older progress, but FTB kill tasks start counting only after the quest begins tracking them.&r"
	]
	quest.6F2E645F869CB1FE.quest_subtitle: "Review the Resistance skill catalog"
	quest.6F2E645F869CB1FE.title: "Resistance Skills"
	quest.6F30423DEAA916D9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f400,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fMystic Oni&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fOgre&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDivine Oni&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 400,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 400,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Spirit Oni — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.6F30423DEAA916D9.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.6F30423DEAA916D9.title: "Spirit Oni"
	quest.6F43CF7EB5AE232B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Water abilities by a decent amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: reach Water Spirit level 1. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Frost, Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAqua Frog (tensura:aqua_frog); Undine (tensura:undine)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fBlue Fang (mysticism:blue_fang); Fairy Lord (trarcane:fairy_lord); Fairy Queen (trarcane:fairy_queen); Frost Wolf (mysticism:frost_wolf); Glacier Spirit Wolf (mysticism:glacier_spirit_wolf); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:ocean_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&fMystical Black Fang (mysticism:mystical_blue_fang); Nivalis Frost Wolf (mysticism:nivalis_frost_wolf); Star Wolf (mysticism:star_wolf); Storm Spirit Wolf (mysticism:storm_spirit_wolf); Tempest Star Wolf (mysticism:tempest_star_wolf); Water Genasi (trarcane:water_genasi)&r"
		"&fWater Soul Insect (mysticism:water_soul_insect)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Water Domination (tensura:water_domination) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:water_manipulation; possess tensura:water_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Water Domination (tensura:water_domination) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:water_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:water_domination.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Water Manipulation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6F43CF7EB5AE232B.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.6F43CF7EB5AE232B.title: "Water Manipulation"
	quest.6F5023FEFA3120D1.quest_desc: [
