	quest.6FB0377D32F6F2BE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fFires a concentrated blade of wind which has heavy knockback.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Medium-or-higher Wind spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Wind Spiritual Magic through Medium, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Wind. Minimum contract level: Medium. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fSylphide (tensura:sylphide)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.6FB0377D32F6F2BE.quest_subtitle: "Spiritual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.6FB0377D32F6F2BE.title: "Wind Blade"
	quest.6FB14208786E840C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts Sound abilities by a decent amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fFrostwrought Leviathan (mysticism:frostwrought_leviathan)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Sound Domination (tensura:sound_domination) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:sound_manipulation; possess tensura:sound_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Sound Domination (tensura:sound_domination) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:sound_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:sound_domination.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sound Manipulation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6FB14208786E840C.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.6FB14208786E840C.title: "Sound Manipulation"
	quest.6FB65CF583DD40EB.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Zoglin 50 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+100 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.6FB65CF583DD40EB.title: "Zoglin: 50 Kills"
	quest.6FB91AD3FB775F87.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fImprove your cognitive skills to learn and cast faster, become able to appraise targets and use analysis to copy skills and process materials to craft or clone items or equipment.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Second-skill roll: this skill is also in the higher-priority second Unique Skill pool when that configured roll occurs.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with Sage (tensura:sage), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. Start with Sage (tensura:sage), then use Moo's Tensura Addon — Great Crystal Altar awakening. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f6. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f7. Moo's Tensura Addon — Great Crystal Altar awakening: Learn Sage. The sages_first_step advancement is awarded automatically when you learn Sage. Reach vanilla XP level 45, at least 60,000 current EP, and at least 1 mastered skill. This pack's default Great Sage magicule cost is 0 and the default named requirement is disabled. Find a generated Great Crystal Shrine or place a moostensuraaddon:great_crystal_altar. The altar is a two-block structure and requires no additional multiblock. Interact with the Great Crystal Altar. When you own Sage, the altar prioritizes this awakening and awards great_crystal_resonance as the ritual starts. Remain alive, in the same dimension, with the altar unbroken for 300 ticks (15 seconds). Logging out, dying, changing dimension, or breaking the altar cancels the ritual. On success the addon removes Sage, grants Great Sage, removes 25 XP levels, and awards moostensuraaddon:the_great_sage_awakens.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fRimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Sage (tensura:sage) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:sage; possess tensura:sage, tensura:chant_annulment, tensura:farsight, tensura:telepathy, tensura:thought_communication, tensura:magic_jamming, tensura:flame_domination, tensura:poison, tensura:analytical_apprasial; pay 1,050,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Sage (tensura:sage) through Moo's Tensura Addon — Great Crystal Altar awakening.&r &7Requirements: Own Sage; XP level 45; at least 60,000 current EP at ritual start; at least 1 mastered Skill; remain at the altar for 300 ticks. Default magicule cost is 0 and naming is not required.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raphael, Lord of Knowledge ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_knowledge) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Raphael, Lord of Wisdom ｣ (trnightmare:raphael_wisdom) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Raphael, Lord of Wisdom (elitetensura:raphealskill) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB Quests has no exact vanilla XP-level task and cannot track uninterrupted altar ritual time. The advancement task is an exact completion check, not a prerequisite check.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Great Sage — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sage — exact prerequisite before the altar replaces Sage&r"
		"&f• Current EP: 60,000 — exact current EP gate checked when the altar ritual starts&r"
		"&f• Skills mastered (lifetime counter): 1 — approximate lifetime aid; the addon counts currently mastered learned skills&r"
		"&f• Advancement completed: moostensuraaddon:sages_first_step — exact Moo progression milestone awarded by code after obtaining Sage&r"
		"&f• Advancement completed: moostensuraaddon:great_crystal_resonance — exact Moo progression milestone awarded when the altar ritual starts&r"
		"&f• Advancement completed: moostensuraaddon:the_great_sage_awakens — exact successful Moo altar-awakening outcome&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6FB91AD3FB775F87.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.6FB91AD3FB775F87.title: "Great Sage"
	quest.6FBA10C03AB025F3.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f2,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Dragon Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fAscended Djinn&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fInfinite Djinn&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 10 x Dragon Essence (tensura:dragon_essence): Defeat Charybdis (1-3 guaranteed), a Basilisk (1%), or a Dragonewt-type Lizardman (25%). Lizardman throne/storage loot and Elite crates are additional sources. Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Sovereign Djinn — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.6FBA10C03AB025F3.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Ascension"
	quest.6FBA10C03AB025F3.title: "Sovereign Djinn"
	quest.6FFBD2AF8E234AD9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fShoot black lightning at varying strength, or summon a massive storm which attacks any non-allied mobs. A short range plasma blast can also be used to melt even the strongest of foes.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Guaranteed kill grant (default config): defeat tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight; the Skill Obtain addon awards this skill at 100% default chance.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fRimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); Veldora Tempest (tensura_neb:veldora)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fStorm Spirit Wolf (mysticism:storm_spirit_wolf); Tempest Star Wolf (mysticism:tempest_star_wolf)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Black Lightning — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.6FFBD2AF8E234AD9.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.6FFBD2AF8E234AD9.title: "Black Lightning"
