	quest.7068A7676C0A48A4.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBoosts the power of fire abilities by a decent amount.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: reach Flame Spirit level 1. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Scorch grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fIfrit (tensura:ifrit); Salamander (tensura:salamander); Shizu (tensura:shizu); Cinder Adder (cataclysm:cinder_adder); Fire Beetle (twilightforest:fire_beetle); Fire Minion (aether:fire_minion); Ignis (cataclysm:ignis); Infernal Dragon (block_factorys_bosses:infernal_dragon); Sun Spirit (aether:sun_spirit); Tower Ghast (twilightforest:tower_ghast); Umvuthi (mowziesmobs:umvuthi); Ur Ghast (twilightforest:ur_ghast)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fBlazing Scorch Wolf (mysticism:blazing_scorch_wolf); Fire Genasi (trarcane:fire_genasi); Flame Soul Insect (mysticism:flame_soul_insect); Lower-Class Demon (trnightmare:lower_class_demon); Molten Spirit Wolf (mysticism:molten_spirit_wolf); Mystical Red Fang (mysticism:mystical_red_fang)&r"
		"&fRed Fang (mysticism:red_fang); Scorch Wolf (mysticism:scorch_wolf); Volcanic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:volcanic_spirit_wolf)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Flame Domination (tensura:flame_domination) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:flame_manipulation; possess tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 100,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 1).&r"
		"&f• Heat Wave (tensura:heat_wave) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:flame_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:heat_wave.&r"
		"&f• Flame Domination (tensura:flame_domination) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:flame_manipulation; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:flame_domination.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Flame Manipulation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
