		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 100,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 10 x Flame Essence (mysticism:flame_essence): Defeat Ifrit (guaranteed) or a vanilla Blaze (1%). Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 100,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Magma Worm — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
