	quest.70C8D83178A83936.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTransform into a beast to restore your vitality and boost your physical body. The transformation will grant great physical prowess but leave a toll on your body.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Guaranteed kill grant (default config): defeat tensura_neb:carrion; the Skill Obtain addon awards this skill at 100% default chance.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fOkami (mysticism:okami)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&f3 Tailed Fox (ascension:three_tail_fox); 6 Tailed Fox (ascension:six_tail_fox); 9 Tailed Fox (ascension:nine_tail_fox); Beast Lord (tensura:beast_lord); Beastfolk (tensura:beastfolk); Divine Beast (tensura:divine_beast)&r"
		"&fDivine Fox (stextras:divine_fox); Divine King (ascension:divine_king); Divine Kitsune (ascension:divine_kitsune); Divine Tengu (mysticism:divine_tengu); Kitsune (ascension:kitsune); Monkey King (ascension:monkey_king)&r"
		"&fMystic Fox (stextras:mystic_fox); Ninetail (stextras:ninetail); Soul Beast (stextras:soul_beast); Spirit Beast (tensura:spirit_beast); Sun Wukong (ascension:sun_wukong); Tengu (mysticism:tengu)&r"
		"&fTengu Saint (mysticism:tengu_saint)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Beast Transformation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
