	]
	quest.714732334B0C06C2.title: "Vindicator: 100 Kills"
	quest.71577ABD97F4B502.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe forge answers its lord. Repair and reforge what exists, engrave it, conjure arms from nothing, sense the ore beneath stone, and turn a smith's mastery into a weapon.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Godly Craftsman (tensura:godly_craftsman), then use Elite Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Creator (tensura:creator), then use Elite Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Elite Ultimate acquisition: Learn and master every prerequisite: tensura:godly_craftsman, tensura:creator. Reach at least 10,000,000 EP and awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. Gain EP again so the normal skill-acquisition check runs. With the skill enabled, the addon grants the Ultimate automatically.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Godly Craftsman (tensura:godly_craftsman) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		"&f• Creator (tensura:creator) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Elite requirementsEnabled=false bypasses the mastery/EP/awakening gate.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Hephaestus, Lord of Creation — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000,000 — exact default Elite EP gate&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero gate&r"
		"&f• Master: Godly Craftsman — exact current mastery required by Elite&r"
		"&f• Master: Creator — exact current mastery required by Elite&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.71577ABD97F4B502.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Elite Tensura"
	quest.71577ABD97F4B502.title: "Hephaestus, Lord of Creation"
	quest.715D05D9B4B394F6.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fAs the King of Scorpions, your poison is highly dangerous. An upgrade to the Poison skill. Can only be used by King Scorpions and their evolutionary line.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: master tensura:poison. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDivine Loxodrome Scorpion (mysticism:divine_loxodrome_scorpion)&r"
		""
