	quest.719E3984AAB670BE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f4,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Lightning Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fSculk Worm&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fLightning Aberration&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fOverloading Worm&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 4,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 10 x Lightning Essence (mysticism:lightning_essence): Defeat Sylphide (guaranteed), or collect an essence created by a lightning strike (10% strike chance; the Elemental Realm wind biome also runs the installed lightning/essence event). Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 4,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Charged Perforator — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
