	quest.724468DE396E3CA7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7Fusion of §dGabriel§7 and §3Leviathan§7. §8Serpent's Jealousy§7 siphons magicule on hit while in-slot; toggle §fEnvious Fortune§7 for luck and effect purge. Command ice, envy, and absolute temporal fixation.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master trnightmare:gabriel; then master trnightmare:leviathan. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Gabriel, Lord of Patience ｣ (trnightmare:gabriel), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with ｢ Leviathan, Lord of Envy ｣ (trnightmare:leviathan), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Gabriel, Lord of Patience ｣ (trnightmare:gabriel) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Leviathan, Lord of Envy ｣ (trnightmare:leviathan) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Gabriel, Lord of Patience ｣ (trnightmare:gabriel)&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Leviathan, Lord of Envy ｣ (trnightmare:leviathan)&r"
		"&f• Kill 15,000 mobs&r"
		"&f• Have the specified effect at minimum amplifier 3&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Gabriel, Lord of Patience ｣ (trnightmare:gabriel).&r"
		"&f• Master ｢ Leviathan, Lord of Envy ｣ (trnightmare:leviathan).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 3,000,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Cthulhu, King of Divine Ice ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Gabriel, Lord of Patience ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: ｢ Leviathan, Lord of Envy ｣ — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Mobs killed: 15,000 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 3,000,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.724468DE396E3CA7.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.724468DE396E3CA7.title: "｢ Cthulhu, King of Divine Ice ｣"
