	quest.72AADAF08F7F5916.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fRemove the requirement of air underwater.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAxolotl (minecraft:axolotl); Cod (minecraft:cod); Giant Cod (tensura:giant_cod); Giant Salmon (tensura:giant_salmon); Glow Squid (minecraft:glow_squid); Pufferfish (minecraft:pufferfish); The Leviathan (cataclysm:the_leviathan)&r"
		"&fSalmon (minecraft:salmon); Sissie (tensura:sissie); Spear Toro (tensura:spear_toro); Squid (minecraft:squid); Tropical Fish (minecraft:tropical_fish)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAxolotl (trnightmare:axolotl); Axolotl Knight (trnightmare:axolotl_knight); Axolotl Steel Spirit (trnightmare:axolotl_steel_spirit); Axolotl Steel Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:axolotl_steel_dragon); Axolotl Water Spirit (trnightmare:axolotl_water_spirit); Axolotl Water Spirit Dragon (trnightmare:axolotl_water_dragon)&r"
		"&fAxolotl Wizard (trnightmare:axolotl_wizard); Bog Ancient (ascension:bog_ancient); Cursed Dreadnaught (ascension:cursed_dreadnaught); Cursed Mariner (ascension:cursed_mariner); Davy Jones (ascension:davy_jones); Divine Fish (tensura:divine_fish)&r"
		"&fEnlightened Merfolk (tensura:enlightened_merfolk); Frog (ascension:frog); Frog Monarch (ascension:frog_monarch); Giant Frog (ascension:giant_frog); Merfolk (tensura:merfolk); Merfolk Saint (tensura:merfolk_saint)&r"
		"&fPhantom Corsair (ascension:phantom_corsair); Poison Toad (ascension:poison_toad); Swamp Sovereign (ascension:swamp_sovereign); Venom Lord (ascension:venom_lord)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Water Breathing — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.72AADAF08F7F5916.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.72AADAF08F7F5916.title: "Water Breathing"
	quest.72B591DA93BC3A94.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§8Death abides no reason—§r\\n§7For it cannot be defied.§r\\n§fEven by those who see it coming.§r&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Awakened Feldway reward: Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival or Adventure; the killing damage must resolve to you as the reward player. Choose this available authority in Feldway’s reward screen. It must be unclaimed and you must be allowed to claim an exclusive skill. The reward is once per player by the default Feldway reward gamerule. Exclusive ownership is enforced across players and a player is limited to one exclusive authority.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8A kill counter cannot establish world-wide exclusive ownership or whether a reward was already claimed. Check the reward screen.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Ronova — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Defeat 1 × tensuramoreskills:feldway_awakened (forward-only) — forward-only FTB counter; it cannot prove reward availability or historical kills&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.72B591DA93BC3A94.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Tensura More Skills"
	quest.72B591DA93BC3A94.title: "Ronova"
	quest.72C100DE9A2843C5.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUsing magicule to sense entities around.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Automatic acquisition check: satisfy the skill's built-in automatic acquisition check. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fArch Daemon (tensura:arch_daemon); Beast Gnome (tensura:beast_gnome); Carrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Charybdis (tensura:charybdis); Crystal Glutton (magicule_glutton:crystal_glutton); Echo of Tyros, First Flamebearer (irons_spellbooks:fire_boss); Adherent (twilightforest:adherent); Death Tome (twilightforest:death_tome); Lich (twilightforest:lich); Scylla (cataclysm:scylla); The Prowler (cataclysm:the_prowler)&r"
		"&fGazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Greater Daemon (tensura:greater_daemon); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Laplace (tensura_guild:laplace); Lesser Daemon (tensura:lesser_daemon); Luminous Valentine (tensura_neb:luminous_valentine)&r"
		"&fMai Furuki (tensura:mai_furuki); Memoires (mysticism:memoires); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); Shizu (tensura:shizu); The Dead King (irons_spellbooks:dead_king); Yuuki Kagurazaka (tensura_guild:yuuki_kagurazaka)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fAir Genasi (trarcane:air_genasi); Ancient Genasi (trarcane:ancient_genasi); Black Fang (mysticism:black_fang); Divine Genasi (trarcane:divine_genasi); Earth Genasi (trarcane:earth_genasi); Fire Genasi (trarcane:fire_genasi)&r"
		"&fGenasi (trarcane:genasi); Lower-Class Demon (trnightmare:lower_class_demon); Magic Spirit Wolf (mysticism:magic_spirit_wolf); Mystical Black Fang (mysticism:mystical_black_fang); Water Genasi (trarcane:water_genasi)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Universal Perception (tensura:universal_perception) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:magic_sense; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:universal_perception.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Magic Sense — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.72C100DE9A2843C5.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.72C100DE9A2843C5.title: "Magic Sense"
	quest.72C33392FE266C05.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f500,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eRequired ability/skill: &fIdeal"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fHermit&8 — Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fSorcerer&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDisciple&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 500,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Master Ideal (trvirtuoso:ideal). Open its matching quest in the skill chapters for its learning and upgrade routes.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 500,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Master: Ideal — exact TenSura ability state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Apostle — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.72C33392FE266C05.quest_subtitle: "Special / Non-standard Race • TR Virtuoso"
	quest.72C33392FE266C05.title: "Apostle"
	quest.72C41EE49C85782C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fSummon a Daemon from hell to fight for you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Epic Tome.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Search Hell Ruins chests or brush Hell Ruins suspicious blocks; the installed Hell Treasure Tome pool can bind this spell.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.72C41EE49C85782C.quest_subtitle: "Summoning Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.72C41EE49C85782C.title: "Summon Daemon"
