	quest.72F5E45298800F6A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fStrike fear into the hearts of evil and give strength to your allies.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master tensura:hero_haki; then be awakened as a True Hero. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Hero Haki (tensura:hero_haki), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Hero Haki (tensura:hero_haki) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:hero_haki; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:sacred_haki.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Hyperbolic Passage (ascension:hyperbolic_passage) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Obtain Gate (tensura:gate), a Medium Space Spiritual Magic, by successfully contracting/taming a Medium-or-higher Space Spirit. Praying on a Praying Path performs the spirit-contract roll; a successful qualifying Space contract grants every Space Spiritual Magic up to that spirit level, including Gate. Then master Gate. Also master tensura:sacred_haki.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sacred Haki — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
