	quest.7338D1DA9FB7CA4A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCall on your spirit to reduce the enemy's vision in a wide area.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Form a Lesser-or-higher Darkness spirit contract. Find and tame a qualifying elemental spirit (the configured tame chance applies), or stand centered above a Praying Path and keep sneaking for its configured prayer time; a successful roll stores the higher contract and grants every Darkness Spiritual Magic through Lesser, including this one.&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpirit contract&r"
		"&fElement: Darkness. Minimum contract level: Lesser. A higher contract also grants this spell because grantSpiritMagic includes every matching spell at or below the stored level.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fCultist (irons_spellbooks:cultist); Necromancer (irons_spellbooks:necromancer); The Dead King (irons_spellbooks:dead_king)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
