	quest.7381DAA48C45A126.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fPassive: +10% magicule regen. Toggle: reflect projectiles back at their source. Modes: Storage (pocket dimension, 81 stacks), Candy Beam (turn a non-player at least 1.5x weaker than you into edible candy that passes their EP and skills to whoever eats it), Regeneration (full HP for 5% max aura).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• The Evil Majin (ascension:evil_majin) through Ascension Awakening Altar.&r &7Requirements: Eat 50 Majin Candies over your lifetime; the ascension:majin_candies_eaten counter must reach 50; mastered Bubble Majin; max EP at least 5M; True Demon Lord or True Hero; doAscensionUltimate gamerule enabled.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Bubble Majin — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7381DAA48C45A126.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Ascension"
	quest.7381DAA48C45A126.title: "Bubble Majin"
	quest.7384AA93C7B95FF9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe ultimate evolution of Deadly Poison — Death World, nihility, and absolute barrier control.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Deadly Poison (trnightmare:deadly_poison), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Deadly Poison (trnightmare:deadly_poison) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Spacetime Domination (trnightmare:spacetime_domination) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Spacetime Manipulation; possess one compatible configured authority.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Deadly Poison (trnightmare:deadly_poison)&r"
		"&f• Master Spatial Domination (tensura:spatial_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Multilayer Barrier (tensura:multilayer_barrier)&r"
		"&f• Master Spatial Motion (tensura:spatial_motion)&r"
		"&f• Kill 1,500 mobs&r"
		"&f• Raise custom statistic trnightmare:lethal_dose_at_100 to 25&r"
		"&f• Reach a maximum Magicule capacity of 900,000&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 900,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
