	quest.74733EF6727BCC86.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fMammon, Lord of Greed is the ultimate evolved Skill of Greed. This powerful skill is capable of stealing even the Life from its victims. This is truly the manifestation of Greed&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess tensura:greed. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Greed (tensura:greed), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Greed (tensura:greed) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Greedy Manas (trnightmare:greedy_manas) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Greed (tensura:greed)&r"
		"&f• Complete 100 villager trades&r"
		"&f• Win 10 village raids&r"
		"&f• Carry 7 x minecraft:gold_block (the condition does not consume it when its final flag is false)&r"
		"&f• Master Greed (tensura:greed).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 1,250,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Mammon, Lord of Greed ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Greed — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Villager trades: 100 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Village raids won: 10 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Carry 7 × minecraft:gold_block — exact current inventory count; consumption/ritual success is not proven&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 1,250,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
