		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• Sacred Haki (tensura:sacred_haki) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:hero_haki; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:sacred_haki.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Hero Haki — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
