	quest.74E5E8E28A87CE3B.title: "Vex: 10 Kills"
	quest.7508FEFB074F8731.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTurn the world into a weapon, absorb the environment to create powerful mines and grenades.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Nightmare boss-drop route:&f personally defeat the Sentient Boss Lucius. The skill is rolled from that boss's configured reward list; its chance is half of TenSura's configured Otherworlder skill-drop percentage, so the kill is not guaranteed to award it.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Fusionist — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7508FEFB074F8731.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.7508FEFB074F8731.title: "Fusionist"
	quest.7541FD875AB8A812.quest_desc: [
		"Each mob has its own kill milestones. All milestones begin tracking together, so your first kill also counts toward 5, 10, and every later goal."
		""
		"&eImportant:&r FTB records kills from the moment this quest file is loaded. Kills from before installing the pack cannot be recovered automatically."
		"&eRewards:&r Every reward permanently increases your maximum EP. Claim it from the completed milestone quest."
	]
	quest.7541FD875AB8A812.title: "Vanilla Mob Hunts"
	quest.7558BEC52FECCB63.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUse your aura to propel you forward, and hover in air.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Trade with a Battlewill Trainer dwarf at level 4. Its bound-manual trade tag explicitly includes this art; buy the named/glinting manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.7558BEC52FECCB63.quest_subtitle: "Utility Battlewill Arts • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.7558BEC52FECCB63.title: "Air Flight"
	quest.755B3328B746E8BE.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Hell Caterpillar 100 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+1,000 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.755B3328B746E8BE.title: "Hell Caterpillar: 100 Kills"
	quest.755FB20DA92A8042.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eRequires awakening"
		"&eMust be named"
		"&eRequires a physical body"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fArch Fallen of Origin&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fFallen Cherub of Origin&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fFallen of Origin&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. The base requirement accepts either state; complete the matching TenSura awakening route first.&r"
		"&f2. Have another eligible player name you through TenSura's Naming interaction/key menu. An anvil-renamed name tag does not satisfy the stored existence-name check.&r"
		"&f3. Incarnate into a physical body first. The condition rejects TenSura spiritual-form state.&r"
		"&f4. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact TenSura awakening state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Fallen Lord of Origin — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.755FB20DA92A8042.quest_subtitle: "Special / Non-standard Race • TR Origins"
	quest.755FB20DA92A8042.title: "Fallen Lord of Origin"
	quest.756A79855803AD2A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f200,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
