	quest.764C7954B5FE60AF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&7The mod does not provide an effect description for this ability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Leviathan, Lord of Envy ｣ (trnightmare:leviathan), then use TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming: Own one matching source Ultimate: trnightmare:leviathan, and develop its matching Ego/personality. Raise that Ego above 225 social points, then use the Ego evolution screen to confirm each stage through stage 4. Each attempt has a 12-minute cooldown and a 30% failure chance by default; failure halves social points. When stage 4 reports that the Ego is ready, use the Ego naming command/menu and choose a name. The first naming pays the configured base naming cost; the mod creates the mapped Manas skill and transfers mastery.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Leviathan, Lord of Envy ｣ (trnightmare:leviathan) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can verify the source and resulting skills but cannot read Ego personality, social points, stage, cooldown, failure roll, or naming cost.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §5Envy Manas — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Leviathan, Lord of Envy ｣ — alternative/matching source aid; Ego stage and personality remain manual&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.764C7954B5FE60AF.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.764C7954B5FE60AF.title: "Envy Manas"
