		"&f2. Obtain and keep 1 x Dragon Egg (minecraft:dragon_egg) in your inventory: Defeat the Ender Dragon and collect the Dragon Egg from the exit portal.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
