	quest.77A2223FA39AFAF4.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fThe full unfettered potential of the Sword Saint's bloodline, descendant from the first Von Astraea&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess trnightmare:glorious. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Gift (trnightmare:gift), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gift (trnightmare:gift) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Zehirete, God of Faith ｣ (trnightmare:zehirete) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		"&f• Phoenix (trnightmare:phoenix) through Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Astraea; choose target in Blessing Creation; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Sword Saint (trnightmare:sword_saint) through Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Astraea; choose target in Blessing Creation; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Death God (trnightmare:death_god) through Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Astraea; choose target in Blessing Creation; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Phoenix Next (trnightmare:phoenix_next) through Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Astraea; choose target in Blessing Creation; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Dark Blessing (trnightmare:dark_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Earth Blessing (trnightmare:earth_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Fire Blessing (trnightmare:fire_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Divine Protection of Gathering Spirits (trnightmare:gathering_spirits_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Divine Protection of Judgement (trnightmare:judgement_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Divine Protection of Lakes (trnightmare:lakes_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Light Blessing (trnightmare:light_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Divine Protection of Sandplay (trnightmare:sandplay_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Divine Protection of Shedding Blood (trnightmare:shedding_blood_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Divine Protection of Time (trnightmare:time_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Water Blessing (trnightmare:water_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Wind Blessing (trnightmare:wind_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Divine Protection of Unarmed Combat (trnightmare:unarmed_combat_blessing) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Wind Reading (trnightmare:wind_reading) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Wind Evasion (trnightmare:wind_evasion) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Sky Enjoyer (trnightmare:sky_enjoyer) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Insensitivity (trnightmare:insensitivity) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Durability (trnightmare:durability) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• Food Lover (trnightmare:food_lover) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master §6§lGift (trnightmare:gift)&r"
		"&f• Kill 500 mobs&r"
		"&f• Master 50 total skills&r"
		"&f• Win 50 village raids&r"
		"&f• Name 50 subordinates&r"
		"&f• Master Glorious (trnightmare:glorious).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 750,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: §6§lGift — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Mobs killed: 500 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Skills mastered (lifetime counter): 50 — optional approximate tracker&r"
		"&f• Village raids won: 50 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Master: Glorious — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 750,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
