	quest.77F145BE9DFB26DC.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fTransforms your skin into one of a Basilisk scales which become tougher as you gain more EP(Cap however easter egg)&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Crocodile Skin (elitetensura:crocodile_skin), then use Elite Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Elite Ultimate acquisition: Learn and master every prerequisite: elitetensura:crocodile_skin. Reach at least 10,000,000 EP and awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. Gain EP again so the normal skill-acquisition check runs. With the skill enabled, the addon grants the Ultimate automatically. Crocodile Skin is replaced when Basilisk Skin is learned.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Crocodile Skin (elitetensura:crocodile_skin) through Elite Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master every listed prerequisite; EP at least 10,000,000; True Demon Lord OR True Hero; skill enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8Elite requirementsEnabled=false bypasses the mastery/EP/awakening gate. Crocodile Skin is replaced when Basilisk Skin is learned.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Basilisk Skin — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 10,000,000 — exact default Elite EP gate&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact True Demon Lord-or-True Hero gate&r"
		"&f• Master: Crocodile Skin — exact current mastery required by Elite&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.77F145BE9DFB26DC.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • Elite Tensura"
	quest.77F145BE9DFB26DC.title: "Basilisk Skin"
