	quest.788EBBB97402CEEB.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&7The mod does not provide an effect description for this ability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Mammon, Lord of Greed ｣ (trnightmare:mammon), then use TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming: Own one matching source Ultimate: trnightmare:mammon, and develop its matching Ego/personality. Raise that Ego above 225 social points, then use the Ego evolution screen to confirm each stage through stage 4. Each attempt has a 12-minute cooldown and a 30% failure chance by default; failure halves social points. When stage 4 reports that the Ego is ready, use the Ego naming command/menu and choose a name. The first naming pays the configured base naming cost; the mod creates the mapped Manas skill and transfers mastery.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Mammon, Lord of Greed ｣ (trnightmare:mammon) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can verify the source and resulting skills but cannot read Ego personality, social points, stage, cooldown, failure roll, or naming cost.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §5Greedy Manas — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Mammon, Lord of Greed ｣ — alternative/matching source aid; Ego stage and personality remain manual&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.788EBBB97402CEEB.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.788EBBB97402CEEB.title: "Greedy Manas"
	quest.7896E3C7991508C6.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate authority over wind, sound, and star tempest. Toggle Thought Acceleration; sonic/wind domination while slotted; turbulence black wind; Uriel-style barriers; and Apocalypse Howling.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Thought Acceleration (tensura:thought_acceleration), then use TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Universal Perception (tensura:universal_perception), then use TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Demon Lord Haki (tensura:demon_lord_haki), then use TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with Weather Domination (tensura:weather_domination), then use TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. Start with Sound Domination (tensura:sound_domination), then use TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f6. Start with Wind Domination (tensura:wind_domination), then use TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f7. Start with Spatial Domination (tensura:spatial_domination), then use TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f8. Start with Voice Cannon (tensura:voice_cannon), then use TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f9. Start with Multilayer Barrier (tensura:multilayer_barrier), then use TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f10. TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition: Master all nine skills: tensura:thought_acceleration, tensura:universal_perception, tensura:demon_lord_haki, tensura:weather_domination, tensura:sound_domination, tensura:wind_domination, tensura:spatial_domination, tensura:voice_cannon, tensura:multilayer_barrier. Have no other Ultimate Skill, keep Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled, and gain EP so the acquisition check runs. The installed Hastur class grants the skill when those nine mastery checks pass.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Thought Acceleration (tensura:thought_acceleration) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		"&f• Universal Perception (tensura:universal_perception) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		"&f• Demon Lord Haki (tensura:demon_lord_haki) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		"&f• Weather Domination (tensura:weather_domination) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		"&f• Sound Domination (tensura:sound_domination) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		"&f• Wind Domination (tensura:wind_domination) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		"&f• Spatial Domination (tensura:spatial_domination) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		"&f• Voice Cannon (tensura:voice_cannon) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		"&f• Multilayer Barrier (tensura:multilayer_barrier) through TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition.&r &7Requirements: nine listed skills mastered; no other Ultimate; Automatic Evolution and Nightmare Ultimates enabled.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Thought Acceleration (tensura:thought_acceleration)&r"
		"&f• Master Universal Perception (tensura:universal_perception)&r"
		"&f• Master Demon Lord Haki (tensura:demon_lord_haki)&r"
		"&f• Master Weather Domination (tensura:weather_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Sound Domination (tensura:sound_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Wind Domination (tensura:wind_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Spatial Domination (tensura:spatial_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Voice Cannon (tensura:voice_cannon)&r"
		"&f• Master Multilayer Barrier (tensura:multilayer_barrier)&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 550,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare automatic Ultimate acquisition:&r"
		"&f• Limitation: The registry contains stale 35-mastered-skill and 30-named-subordinate condition rows, but HasturSkill does not read them in this installed version; the quest intentionally does not require them.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Hastur, Lord of Starwind ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Thought Acceleration — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Universal Perception — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Demon Lord Haki — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Weather Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Sound Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Wind Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Spatial Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Voice Cannon — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Multilayer Barrier — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 550,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7896E3C7991508C6.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.7896E3C7991508C6.title: "｢ Hastur, Lord of Starwind ｣"
