		"&f2. Obtain 10 x Daemon Essence (tensura:daemon_essence): Defeat Arch Daemons (50%), Greater Daemons (10%), or Lesser Daemons (1%). It also appears in Hell Ruins chests and Hell Ruins archaeology. Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
