	quest.791922F063D75FC3.title: "Guardian Of The Tree"
	quest.7956064D6E02D67B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fFire concentrated blades of wind toward targets.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Common Ruined.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Low Basic.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fLesser Daemon (tensura:lesser_daemon); Veldora Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_veldora)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.7956064D6E02D67B.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.7956064D6E02D67B.title: "Wind Cutter"
	quest.796A7171C3C92D0C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fInherit the genetics of a small creature known for its lasting potions.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: possess StarlightUniqueSkills.LIGHT_REMAINS.get(); then possess StarlightUniqueSkills.VESTIGES_OF_EIDOLONS.get(). Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Wixie Genetics — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.796A7171C3C92D0C.quest_subtitle: "Intrinsic skill • TR: Starlight"
	quest.796A7171C3C92D0C.title: "Wixie Genetics"
	quest.797AFA20463CC898.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fMalleable like clay, the tides of fate are yours to mold to your desire. Your body seems to work like the metal of a forge, hardening and relaxing under pressure, as you merge yourself with the elements around you.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Malleable — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.797AFA20463CC898.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
	quest.797AFA20463CC898.title: "Malleable"
	quest.798C857B9771E261.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Deep One Knight 1 time after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+25 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.798C857B9771E261.title: "Deep One Knight: First Kill"
	quest.798E3A72C0AF293A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&7The mod does not provide an effect description for this ability.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with ｢ Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony ｣ (trnightmare:beelzebuth), then use TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming: Own one matching source Ultimate: trnightmare:beelzebuth, and develop its matching Ego/personality. Raise that Ego above 225 social points, then use the Ego evolution screen to confirm each stage through stage 4. Each attempt has a 12-minute cooldown and a 30% failure chance by default; failure halves social points. When stage 4 reports that the Ego is ready, use the Ego naming command/menu and choose a name. The first naming pays the configured base naming cost; the mod creates the mapped Manas skill and transfers mastery.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony ｣ (trnightmare:beelzebuth) through TR: Nightmare Ego-to-Manas naming.&r &7Requirements: matching Ultimate and Ego personality; social points > 225; Ego stage 4; successful naming.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can verify the source and resulting skills but cannot read Ego personality, social points, stage, cooldown, failure roll, or naming cost.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §5Gluttony Manas — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Beelzebuth, Lord of Gluttony ｣ — alternative/matching source aid; Ego stage and personality remain manual&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.798E3A72C0AF293A.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.798E3A72C0AF293A.title: "Gluttony Manas"
	quest.799E07DDE4D6995F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fRelease strong currents of winds to create gusts or wind charges toward targets.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Join the Adventurer Guild and complete commissions for Reputation Coins. At rank A, the rotating shop can offer this spell as a Random Magic Tome for 200 coins. You can buy one per refresh, and the shop refreshes every 7 Minecraft days by default. Buy the tome when this spell appears, then hold use for at least 10 ticks.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Search Wizard Tower chests for a bound tome. This spell appears in these tower pools: Common Ruined.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Level a Magic Instructor dwarf and check its offers. This spell can appear in these trade tiers: Low Basic.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fAlways has this ability:&r"
		"&fLesser Daemon (tensura:lesser_daemon); Priest (irons_spellbooks:priest); Veldora Tempest (trnightmare:sentient_boss_veldora)&r"
		"&8Seeing a mob use this ability does not mean it can drop or teach it. Follow one of the methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
