	quest.799E07DDE4D6995F.quest_subtitle: "Aspectual Magic • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.799E07DDE4D6995F.title: "Wind Gust"
	quest.79A1DEC0270AE559.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weaker light damage or reduce the damage from more powerful attacks.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Scorch grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fCarrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Gazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Hinata Sakaguchi (tensura:hinata_sakaguchi); Memoires (mysticism:memoires); Priest (irons_spellbooks:priest)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDemon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); Divine Heavenly Dragon (trnightmare:divine_heavenly_dragon); Fairy Princess (trnightmare:fairy_princess); God Slime (tensura:god_slime); Heavenly Dragon (trnightmare:heavenly_dragon); Lesser Goddess (trnightmare:lesser_goddess)&r"
		"&fLesser Holy Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_holy_dragon); Medium Holy Dragon (trnightmare:medium_holy_dragon); Metal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Saint Dragon (trnightmare:saint_dragon); True Fairy King (trnightmare:true_fairy_king)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Light Attack Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.79A1DEC0270AE559.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.79A1DEC0270AE559.title: "Light Attack Resistance"
