	]
	quest.7A39094C2FF03A88.title: "Bluff: 10 Kills"
	quest.7A397BCB4A5AE95A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fDisappear into the shadows and deal massive damage, also become undetectable by sound.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Second-skill roll: this skill is also in the higher-priority second Unique Skill pool when that configured roll occurs.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f4. Start with Strength (tensura:strength), then use TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f5. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eArios conditional reward:&f personally defeat TR: Nightmare's Sentient Boss Arios while you already possess Abaddon. The death handler grants Murderer directly when that condition is met.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Strength (tensura:strength) through TR: Nightmare Designer evolution recipe.&r &7Requirements: Own one of Designer/Astarte/Astaroth/Hand of Creation; input tensura:strength; possess tensura:strength, tensura:steel_strength, tensura:strengthen_body, tensura:demonic_power, tensura:formhide, tensura:flame_manipulation; pay 750,000 MP. Result is weighted (weight 2).&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Sandalphon, Lord of Judgement ｣ (trnightmare:sandalphon_judgment) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Murderer — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7A397BCB4A5AE95A.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
