	quest.7A971CF774A5C0D2.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f600,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eBoss kills: &f3 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fCursed Mariner&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fPhantom Corsair&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 600,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Defeat 3 TenSura bosses. This evolution uses TenSura's lifetime boss-defeat count.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 600,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Bosses defeated: 3 — exact lifetime custom-stat counter; may predate this quest&r"
		"&f• Current race: Cursed Dreadnaught — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
