	quest.7B88C5FF9ED01575.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fEmpower your ears to precisely locate any nearby entities.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Start with Danger Sense (tensura:danger_sense), then use TenSura mastery unlock. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fBat (minecraft:bat); Rimuru Tempest (tensura_neb:rimuru_ogre_fight); Warden (minecraft:warden)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fCharged Perforator (mysticism:charged_perforator); Dissonance Deity (mysticism:dissonance_deity); Enflamed Aberration (mysticism:enflamed_aberration); Lightning Aberration (mysticism:lightning_aberration); Magma Worm (mysticism:magma_worm); Molten Perforator (mysticism:molten_perforator)&r"
		"&fOverloading Worm (mysticism:overloading_worm); Reaper Aberration (mysticism:reaper_aberration); Sculk Worm (mysticism:sculk_worm); Soul Aberration (mysticism:soul_aberration); Soul Shrieker (mysticism:soul_shrieker); Violence Deity (mysticism:violence_deity)&r"
		"&fWarden (mysticism:warden)&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Danger Sense (tensura:danger_sense) through TenSura mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Master tensura:danger_sense; the source skill's onSkillMastered hook starts learning tensura:sense_soundwave.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Sense Soundwave — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
