	quest.7BAA682DFA85DD4B.quest_desc: [
		"&fOpen TenSura's naming interaction on an eligible monster, choose a name, and pay the displayed energy cost. This creates a subordinate relationship used by many skills and evolutions.&r"
		""
		"&fThis task uses TenSura's lifetime entity-named statistic, the same counter read by several addon conditions.&r"
	]
	quest.7BAA682DFA85DD4B.title: "Name Your First Monster"
	quest.7BBD27368C6FCE11.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f150,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eConsumes item: &f10× Holy Essence"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fMedium Goddess&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDivine Soldier&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		"&fGoddess Princess&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		"&fWingless Goddess&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 150,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Obtain 10 x Holy Essence (trnightmare:holy_essence): Complete Human Raids or Direwolf Raids (2-5 at 75% per reward roll), or defeat Sentient Masayuuki (2-10 at 50%). Then eat/use all 10; carrying them is not enough because this condition checks the item-used statistic.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 150,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Higher Goddess — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.7BBD27368C6FCE11.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.7BBD27368C6FCE11.title: "Higher Goddess"
	quest.7BC5AC0BB1CAD49B.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Electromancer 5 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+50 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.7BC5AC0BB1CAD49B.title: "Electromancer: 5 Kills"
	quest.7BE5995A221089B2.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis is the main road through the pack. It introduces the TenSura systems in an order that works for a first character, then sends you to the race and skill chapters whenever your choices begin to branch.&r"
		""
		"&fFollow the quests around the center for a complete playthrough. The outer branches are useful milestones, but a hero and a demon lord are not expected to complete the same route.&r"
	]
	quest.7BE5995A221089B2.quest_subtitle: "Reincarnation choices, evolution routes, and requirements"
	quest.7BE5995A221089B2.title: "Welcome to Waka Edition"
	quest.7C0E4AF0E1C0C5D8.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fActive: roar to inflict Fear and Weakness on all enemies within 8 blocks for 6s (10s mastered). 20s cooldown.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Ascension race intrinsic grant: Follow the Ascension race chapter and become the Monkey race (ascension:monkey). When that race is applied, its racial skill list automatically grants ascension:intimidating_roar. Open the skill menu after the race change and confirm the skill was learned.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB Quests can confirm the resulting skill. Race-state tracking depends on the TenSura FTB integration.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Intimidating Roar — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Current race: Monkey — optional progress aid&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7C0E4AF0E1C0C5D8.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • Ascension"
	quest.7C0E4AF0E1C0C5D8.title: "Intimidating Roar"
	quest.7C1C154240792878.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Watcher 100 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+1,000 maximum EP&r"
		"&8This milestone tracks alongside the other kill goals for this mob, so every kill counts toward all of them.&r"
	]
	quest.7C1C154240792878.title: "Watcher: 100 Kills"
	quest.7C276F79479561C1.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCoat your weapon in aura enhancing its blows.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fUnlocks Ogre-sword Cannon (tensura:ogre_sword_cannon): Master Ogre-sword Guillotine.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.7C276F79479561C1.quest_subtitle: "Melee Battlewill Arts • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.7C276F79479561C1.title: "Ogre-sword Guillotine"
	quest.7C2D408A5429CF88.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fIgnore weaker spatial attacks or reduce the damage from stronger dimensional strikes.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Abyss, Storm grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fCarrion (tensura_neb:carrion); Gazel Dwargo (tensura:gazel_dwargo); Winged Cat (tensura:winged_cat)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fDemon Slime (tensura:demon_slime); God Slime (tensura:god_slime); Lesser Ender Dragon (trnightmare:lesser_ender_dragon); Medium Ender Dragon (trnightmare:medium_ender_dragon); Metal Slime (tensura:metal_slime); Planet Spirit Wolf (mysticism:planet_spirit_wolf)&r"
		"&fSpatial Soul Insect (mysticism:spatial_soul_insect)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Spatial Attack Resistance — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7C2D408A5429CF88.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.7C2D408A5429CF88.title: "Spatial Attack Resistance"
	quest.7C5946A00E6799CF.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f2,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fSoul Beast&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 2,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 2,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Divine Fox — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.7C5946A00E6799CF.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.7C5946A00E6799CF.title: "Divine Fox"
	quest.7C81324B5FE750B8.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fYou were cursed from birth. Your raw, unfiltered potential, blocked by a curse gifted by the heavens. Your skill... It's stopping you from learning other skills. But why...?&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fBound Enlightenment (mysticism:bound_enlightenment); Heavenly Restriction (mysticism:heavenly_restriction); Restricted Human (mysticism:restricted_human); Restricted Saint (mysticism:restricted_saint)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Restricted — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7C81324B5FE750B8.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • Mysticism"
	quest.7C81324B5FE750B8.title: "Restricted"
	quest.7C8E0C8702C3790A.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&f§7This §dUnique Skill §7is a §cPredation §7ability with further developed capabilities, allowing one to even predate §eitems§7, §earmor§7 and §egear§7.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §6Scavenger — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7C8E0C8702C3790A.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.7C8E0C8702C3790A.title: "Scavenger"
	quest.7C95960807A61CC8.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis chapter covers all &e80&f player-facing Intrinsic skills in the pack.&r"
		"&fEach page explains what the skill does, how to learn it, which mobs use it, which races grant it, and where it can evolve.&r"
		"&7Use the checkmark to mark a page as read. Automatic tasks only report progress; they never grant a skill.&r"
		"&7Learn and mastery tasks check your current character. Statistics may include older progress, but FTB kill tasks start counting only after the quest begins tracking them.&r"
	]
	quest.7C95960807A61CC8.quest_subtitle: "Review the Intrinsic skill catalog"
	quest.7C95960807A61CC8.title: "Intrinsic Skills"
	quest.7C9B9ABA28DDCD8C.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fPress: refill hunger and grant saturation for 15% of max magicule (7.5% mastered). 10s cooldown (5s mastered).&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Eye of Mind (ascension:eye_of_mind), then use Ascension Eye of Mind analysis copy. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Ascension Eye of Mind analysis copy: Obtain Eye of Mind (ascension:eye_of_mind) and place it in an active skill slot. Find a newly loaded Piglin Brute (minecraft:piglin_brute). Ascension automatically gives that mob ascension:magicule_nourishment while the relevant skill setting is enabled. Target the mob within 20 blocks, select Eye of Mind's Analysis mode, and activate it. The copy chance is 25% normally or 50% after mastering Eye of Mind. Repeat after the short failed-attempt cooldown until the skill is copied. If the target has other eligible skills, Analysis randomly chooses among the eligible unowned skills.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Eye of Mind (ascension:eye_of_mind) through Ascension Eye of Mind analysis copy.&r &7Requirements: own Eye of Mind; analyze minecraft:piglin_brute; successful 25%/50% copy roll.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB can confirm Eye of Mind and the resulting skill, but cannot observe the targeted mob or random Analysis roll.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Magicule Nourishment — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7C9B9ABA28DDCD8C.quest_subtitle: "Common skill • Ascension"
	quest.7C9B9ABA28DDCD8C.title: "Magicule Nourishment"
	quest.7C9CDE8DABD7E026.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Apothic Crusader 10 times after this quest pack is installed."
		""
		"&aReward: &f+75 maximum EP&r"
