	quest.7C9CDE8DABD7E026.title: "Apothic Crusader: 10 Kills"
	quest.7CA02857C6F4A2F3.quest_desc: [
		"&fEasy race lines are the most approachable place to learn the pack. Their early steps are generally more forgiving, but every race still has its own EP, naming, item, skill, alignment, and boss requirements.&r"
		""
		"&fThe difficulty label is a guide to the route's overall demands; it does not change your stats or the mod's evolution rules. Pick a race around this marker and follow its connected line outward.&r"
	]
	quest.7CA02857C6F4A2F3.title: "About Easy Races"
	quest.7CA3773CED9B87BA.quest_desc: [
