	quest.7D82FFA5CC3341DE.title: "Maximum Magic Bullet"
	quest.7D8893EA9C200EEE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fHave a body made of magisteel, making it much harder and gaining progressively stronger armor depending on your EP.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Choose or evolve into one of the races listed below. The race grants this skill automatically.&r"
		""
		"&d&lRaces that grant it&r"
		"&fArch Doll (mysticism:arch_doll); Chaos Doll (mysticism:chaos_doll); Chaos Metalloid (mysticism:chaos_metalloid); Daemon Doll (mysticism:daemon_doll); Devil Doll (mysticism:devil_doll); Greater Doll (mysticism:greater_doll)&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Magisteel Body — completes when you learn it&r"
