	quest.7DB617FA155E88C3.title: "Lesser Angel: 5 Kills"
	quest.7DB89DF5BF7CA50D.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f400,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		"&eBoss kills: &f4 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fLixivant Mantis Insectar&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fDivine Lixivant Mantis&8 — Normal evolution, Awakening evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 400,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Defeat 4 TenSura bosses. This evolution uses TenSura's lifetime boss-defeat count.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 400,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Bosses defeated: 4 — exact lifetime custom-stat counter; may predate this quest&r"
		"&f• Current race: Lixivant Mantis Savant — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.7DB89DF5BF7CA50D.quest_subtitle: "Evolution • Mysticism"
	quest.7DB89DF5BF7CA50D.title: "Lixivant Mantis Savant"
	quest.7DBDB331A79DD3A4.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA unique skill that reduces emotional and sensory interference in battle.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gift (trnightmare:gift), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea), then use Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation: Obtain Gift (or its Ultimate continuation Astraea) and place it in an active skill slot. Open Gift Creation / Astraea Blessing Creation and select this skill from the available blessings. Confirm creation. The default Gift creation cost is 0 Magicules with a 100-tick cooldown. The result lives inside Gift/Astraea as a sub-ability rather than a separate learned skill.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gift (trnightmare:gift) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		"&f• ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ (trnightmare:astraea) through Gift/Astraea sub-ability creation.&r &7Requirements: own Gift or Astraea; target present in allowedBlessings; create as sub-ability.&r"
		""
		"&c&lImportant&r"
		"&8FTB ability tasks cannot inspect sub-ability slots; use the parent-skill tracker and manual confirmation.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: §6§lGift — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Astraea, Lord of Gifts ｣ — exact parent-skill state; FTB cannot inspect the created sub-ability slot&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7DBDB331A79DD3A4.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.7DBDB331A79DD3A4.title: "Insensitivity"
	quest.7DC31CD9AE11C74F.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fCompletely negate all heat damage.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Not obtainable in normal play: there is no direct player-learning method in this pack version. If a compatible mob below uses it, Gluttony may still be able to copy it; otherwise it is mob-only or command-only.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Steal it from one of the mobs below with Gluttony. Either make the mob your subordinate and use Gluttony's skill-retrieval mode, or kill it with Corrosion mode. This only works for allowed Common, Extra, Intrinsic, or Resistance skills, and another mod can still block the attempt.&r"
		""
		"&f1. &eTR: Origins True Dragon route:&f become the True Dragon race and receive an unclaimed elemental seat. The addon randomly assigns one available Abyss, Earth, Scorch, Frost, or Storm seat; receiving Scorch grants this skill automatically. Each elemental seat can have only one owner per world, so this route cannot be targeted reliably on an established server.&r"
		""
		"&6&lMobs that use it&r"
		"&fBlaze (minecraft:blaze); Luminous Valentine (tensura_neb:luminous_valentine); Magma Cube (minecraft:magma_cube); Strider (minecraft:strider); Wither Skeleton (minecraft:wither_skeleton); Hydra (twilightforest:hydra); Ignis (cataclysm:ignis); Infernal Dragon (block_factorys_bosses:infernal_dragon); Netherite Monstrosity (cataclysm:netherite_monstrosity); Sun Spirit (aether:sun_spirit); Umvuthi (mowziesmobs:umvuthi)&r"
		"&8A mob having the skill does not guarantee a drop. Use one of the learning methods above.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Heat Nullification — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7DC31CD9AE11C74F.quest_subtitle: "Resistance skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
