		"&f• Hell Passage (ascension:hell_passage) through Ascension automatic mastery unlock.&r &7Requirements: Obtain Gate (tensura:gate), a Medium Space Spiritual Magic, by successfully contracting/taming a Medium-or-higher Space Spirit. Praying on a Praying Path performs the spirit-contract roll; a successful qualifying Space contract grants every Space Spiritual Magic up to that spirit level, including Gate. Then master Gate. Also master tensura:demon_lord_haki.&r"
