	quest.7ED1A75316D3D2F7.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fA mastered form of Mimicry that grants full control over one's shape and presence.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Start with Gluttony (tensura:gluttony), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Mimicry (trnightmare:mimicry), then use TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&f3. TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition: Master Gluttony and learn Mimicry. Gain EP so the acquisition check runs. Universal Shapeshift is learned and Mimicry is consumed.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Gluttony (tensura:gluttony) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Gluttony; possess Mimicry.&r"
		"&f• Mimicry (trnightmare:mimicry) through TR: Nightmare bespoke natural acquisition.&r &7Requirements: master Gluttony; possess Mimicry.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Universal Shapeshift — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7ED1A75316D3D2F7.quest_subtitle: "Extra skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.7ED1A75316D3D2F7.title: "Universal Shapeshift"
	quest.7ED87B625C228BFE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUse your aura to create a pillar of fire.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Find an unbound Battlewill Manual and hold use for at least 10 ticks. This art is one of the manual's 26 possible rolls. Manuals have a 50% injection chance in simple dungeons, mineshafts, hoglin-stable bastions, stronghold crossings, desert pyramids, igloos, selected trial chambers, ruined portals, large underwater ruins, and woodland mansions. They also appear in Dwarf Dojos, Lizardman Bedrooms, and Ant Nest archaeology. The manual is consumed even if learning fails.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&fUnlocks Oni Pyre (trnightmare:oni_pyre): Reach 400,000 EP and master both Ogre Flame and Flame Domination.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&fThe Learn task checks whether you currently know this ability. Extra mastery or EP tasks appear only when every valid route requires them.&r"
		"&8The book cannot predict random loot, shop rotations, manual rolls, taming chances, contract rolls, or uninterrupted training time.&r"
	]
	quest.7ED87B625C228BFE.quest_subtitle: "Projectile Battlewill Arts • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.7ED87B625C228BFE.title: "Ogre Flame"
	quest.7EDDF63FC40E48B6.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f12,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fFallen Lord&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fGreater Fallen&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 12,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 12,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: Lesser Fallen — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
