	quest.7F05D94E4CA9769B.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lStarting stats and abilities&r"
		"&eStarting EP range: &f1,570–2,350 &8(from base Aura + Magicules)&r"
		"&eAura: &f1,520–2,280"
		"&eMagicules: &f50–70"
		"&eIntrinsic skills: &fRestricted"
		"&eRace modifiers: &fMax Health +10, Attack +0.5, Movement Speed +0.05"
		""
		"&e&lWhere this path leads&r"
		"&fBound Enlightenment&8 — Awakening evolution&r"
		"&fRestricted Saint&8 — Normal evolution, Harvest Festival evolution&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 50,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Defeat 2 TenSura bosses. This evolution uses TenSura's lifetime boss-defeat count.&r"
		"&f3. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 50,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Bosses defeated: 2 — exact lifetime custom-stat counter; may predate this quest&r"
		"&f• Current race: Restricted Human — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.7F05D94E4CA9769B.quest_subtitle: "Starting Reincarnation • Mysticism"
	quest.7F05D94E4CA9769B.title: "Restricted Human"
	quest.7F1E1C4B720E3958.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fBend reality to ensure your enemies meet their demise by ignoring their dodge and barriers.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Reincarnation roll: leave the skill unlocked, reincarnate/reset, and roll the configured starting Unique Skill pool. World uniqueness and the server's skill-count/cost rules still apply.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Gluttony Steals addon: find a skill-bearing Goblin, Dwarf, Lizardman, Villager, Pillager, Wandering Trader, or MCA villager (10% default assignment chance; Wandering Traders are forced to Traveler), then land the killing blow with Gluttony's Mist mode. The mob's assigned Unique Skill is learned.&r"
		""
		"&f3. Defeat Awakened Feldway in Survival. If you have already exhausted his exclusive authority rewards, he rolls a random Unique skill you do not own instead. This skill is in that pool, but the result is random, normal learning restrictions still apply, and Feldway's reward is normally once per player.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eCan evolve into / unlock:&r"
		"&f• ｢ Susanoo, Lord of Tyranny ｣ (trnightmare:susanoo) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: Cook — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7F1E1C4B720E3958.quest_subtitle: "Unique skill • TenSura: Reincarnated"
	quest.7F1E1C4B720E3958.title: "Cook"
	quest.7F3895D8A73004EE.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eRequires awakening"
		"&eMust be named"
		"&eRequires a physical body"
		""
		"&e&lComes from&r"
		"&fSeraph of Origin&8 — Normal evolution&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Awaken as either a True Demon Lord or a True Hero. The base requirement accepts either state; complete the matching TenSura awakening route first.&r"
		"&f2. Have another eligible player name you through TenSura's Naming interaction/key menu. An anvil-renamed name tag does not satisfy the stored existence-name check.&r"
		"&f3. Incarnate into a physical body first. The condition rejects TenSura spiritual-form state.&r"
		"&f4. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• True Demon Lord or True Hero — exact TenSura awakening state&r"
		"&f• Current race: Mystic Angel of Origin — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
