	quest.7F9FD1AF4B5AC166.quest_desc: [
		"&fThis chapter contains all &e8&f abilities players can obtain in this category.&r"
		"&fMagic is grouped as Aspectual, Spiritual, Summoning, or Miscellaneous. Battlewill is grouped by use: Melee, Projectile, Utility, or Advanced/Addon.&r"
		"&fEach page explains what the ability does, how to learn it, which mobs use it, and whether it upgrades.&r"
		"&eTomes:&r &fA bound Magic Tome teaches the named magic after it is held for at least 10 ticks. Rank-A Guild tomes rotate every 7 Minecraft days by default. An Unbound Tome at a Spellbinding Table only copies Magic you already know and have mastered; it is not an initial unlock.&r"
		"&eBattlewill Manuals:&r &fA bound manual teaches its named art. An unbound manual rolls the 26-art list. Manuals are consumed on a valid use attempt even if the ability cannot be learned.&r"
		"&7The Learn task updates when you gain the ability. The book cannot predict random tome or manual rolls, spirit-contract chances, shop rotations, or uninterrupted training.&r"
	]
	quest.7F9FD1AF4B5AC166.quest_subtitle: "8 obtainable abilities"
	quest.7F9FD1AF4B5AC166.title: "Melee Battlewill Arts"
	quest.7FA3CF7DCFEDD1F9.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat you need&r"
		"&eEP: &f20,000,000 &8(configurable default)&r"
		""
		"&e&lEnd of this path&r"
		"&fThis is the end of this evolution path."
		""
		"&d&lSpecial progression route&r"
		"&fThis registered race is not reachable from the pack's normal starting-race evolution graph. It may require a special mechanic, command, mod-specific transformation, or another non-standard route."
		""
		"&a&lHow to evolve&r"
		"&f1. Raise your base maximum EP to at least 20,000,000. Defeat eligible enemies to grow permanent Aura/Magicules, then reopen the TenSura evolution menu. Temporary or equipment bonuses may fill the displayed EP tracker without meeting this base-EP condition.&r"
		"&f2. Open the TenSura evolution menu and select this race. The quest does not perform the evolution for you.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Maximum EP: 20,000,000 — approximate: FTB reads total maximum EP; race checks base maximum EP&r"
		"&f• Current race: True Dragon — checks your current race&r"
		"&8Trackers show your progress, but you still evolve through TenSura's evolution menu.&r"
		"&8Naming, body/form state, location conditions, item-use counts, and some addon counters cannot be tracked automatically. Follow the steps above whenever no tracker is shown.&r"
	]
	quest.7FA3CF7DCFEDD1F9.quest_subtitle: "Final Evolution • TR Origins"
	quest.7FA3CF7DCFEDD1F9.title: "True Dragon"
	quest.7FB1FE04A40C8814.quest_desc: [
		"&e&lWhat it does&r"
		"&fUltimate underworld flame: All of Creation, spacetime, soul bank, nihilistic world, white flare, and nihility.&r"
		""
		"&a&lHow to get it&r"
		""
		"&f1. Automatic acquisition check: master trnightmare:freezing_flame. Trigger a normal EP update after satisfying it (for example by defeating another mob) so TenSura re-evaluates learnable skills.&r"
		""
		"&f2. Start with Freezing Flame (trnightmare:freezing_flame), then use TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution. Follow the requirements below.&r"
		""
		"&5&lUpgrades and unlocks&r"
		"&eStarts from:&r"
		"&f• Freezing Flame (trnightmare:freezing_flame) through TR: Nightmare Ultimate evolution.&r &7Requirements: See the full requirements on the target skill's page.&r"
		""
		"&c&lDetailed steps&r"
		"&f• TR: Nightmare requirements:&r"
		"&f• Master Freezing Flame (trnightmare:freezing_flame)&r"
		"&f• Master 5 skills from tag TensuraSkillTags.FLAME_SKILLS&r"
		"&f• Master Spatial Domination (tensura:spatial_domination)&r"
		"&f• Master Multilayer Barrier (tensura:multilayer_barrier)&r"
		"&f• Kill 4,500 mobs&r"
		"&f• Name 15 subordinates&r"
		"&f• Master Freezing Flame (trnightmare:freezing_flame).&r"
		"&f• Reach at least 900,000 maximum Magicule capacity (configurable default). UltimateEvolutionHelper checks capacity and does not spend it during this evolution helper.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare automatic-evolution gamerule must be enabled; satisfy the checklist, then trigger a normal EP update so the acquisition check runs.&r"
		"&f• The TR: Nightmare Nightmare Ultimates gamerule must be enabled.&r"
		"&f• This target's configurable ultimate-evolution switch must remain enabled.&r"
		"&f• A predecessor marked as a Directive Ego or Akashic Star Order imprint cannot be consumed by UltimateEvolutionHelper; clear or use that special state before attempting the normal replacement path.&r"
		""
		"&3&lQuest tracking&r"
		"&f• Learn: ｢ Belial, Lord of The Dead ｣ — completes when you learn it&r"
		"&f• Master: Freezing Flame — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Spatial Domination — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Master: Multilayer Barrier — completes when mastered&r"
		"&f• Mobs killed: 4,500 — exact lifetime statistic used by this condition&r"
		"&f• Maximum Magicules: 900,000 — exact configured-default capacity gate used by UltimateEvolutionHelper&r"
		"&8These tasks only track progress; they never grant or evolve a skill.&r"
	]
	quest.7FB1FE04A40C8814.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate skill • TR: Nightmare"
	quest.7FB1FE04A40C8814.title: "｢ Belial, Lord of The Dead ｣"
