		"Each mob has its own kill milestones. All milestones begin tracking together, so your first kill also counts toward 5, 10, and every later goal."
		""
		"&eImportant:&r FTB records kills from the moment this quest file is loaded. Kills from before installing the pack cannot be recovered automatically."
